<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:00.200" end="00:00:03.700" style="s2">Wasn&#39;t this supposed to be floating</p>
<p begin="00:00:01.700" end="00:00:05.900" style="s2">island survival? Where&#39;d this ocean come</p>
<p begin="00:00:03.700" end="00:00:08.800" style="s2">from?</p>
<p begin="00:00:05.900" end="00:00:10.800" style="s2">Wait, where&#39;s my island? I had a whole</p>
<p begin="00:00:08.800" end="00:00:13.500" style="s2">freaking island. This isn&#39;t what I</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.800" end="00:00:16.500" style="s2">signed up for. System, I got screwed.</p>
<p begin="00:00:13.500" end="00:00:18.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Abyssal Island, level one, area 100,000</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.500" end="00:00:21.200" style="s2">SQ meters, movement speed 60 meters per</p>
<p begin="00:00:18.800" end="00:00:22.500" style="s2">hour, current altitude 3,000 meters.</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.200" end="00:00:24.700" style="s2">Island traits have vanished.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.500" end="00:00:27.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s really gone. My island.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.700" end="00:00:29.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Abyssal trait, corruption. Water from</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.200" end="00:00:31.100" style="s2">the ancient abyss steadily corrupts all</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.000" end="00:00:31.800" style="s2">life within it. Even its owner is not</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.100" end="00:00:33.500" style="s2">exempt.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.800" end="00:00:35.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I&#39;m still soaking in it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.500" end="00:00:37.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gorgon&#39;s curse, the gaze of the three</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.400" end="00:00:40.000" style="s2">sisters. They forever watch these</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.400" end="00:00:43.000" style="s2">waters. Luck reduced by 80%.</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.000" end="00:00:45.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Like I wasn&#39;t unlucky enough already.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.000" end="00:00:46.700" style="s2">Am I stuck floating here forever?</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.000" end="00:00:48.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master craftsman, craft whatever you</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.700" end="00:00:51.000" style="s2">want with suitable materials. Crafting</p>
<p begin="00:00:48.500" end="00:00:52.500" style="s2">speed increased by 50%. Success rate</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.000" end="00:00:54.000" style="s2">increased by 20%.</p>
<p begin="00:00:52.500" end="00:00:57.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure, I can craft.</p>
<p begin="00:00:54.000" end="00:00:58.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haul out some materials first.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.000" end="00:00:59.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m stuck in a tree. Someone get me</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.600" end="00:01:02.400" style="s2">down.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.600" end="00:01:04.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All this survival stuff, I&#39;m too old to</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.400" end="00:01:05.800" style="s2">figure it out. Could one of you</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.199" end="00:01:08.400" style="s2">youngsters help me out?</p>
<p begin="00:01:05.800" end="00:01:10.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I got Skull Island. Upgrade it, and I</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.400" end="00:01:12.400" style="s2">can even bring back King Kong.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.200" end="00:01:16.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The fruit here&#39;s so sweet. Weird color</p>
<p begin="00:01:12.400" end="00:01:17.100" style="s2">though. I found a diary. Check this out.</p>
<p begin="00:01:16.200" end="00:01:19.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.100" end="00:01:21.300" style="s2">What are they?</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.400" end="00:01:24.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Albino giant mouth manatee carcass,</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.300" end="00:01:25.300" style="s2">corruption 5%. Rich, tender meat. Eating</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.200" end="00:01:28.200" style="s2">it causes corruption.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.300" end="00:01:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This thing&#39;s edible.</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.200" end="00:01:33.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, at least I&#39;ve got a bed.</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.800" end="00:01:35.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, the system says it&#39;s edible even</p>
<p begin="00:01:33.400" end="00:01:36.100" style="s2">though it&#39;s dead. Should I give it a</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.000" end="00:01:38.100" style="s2">try?</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.100" end="00:01:40.300" style="s2">Might as well eat it fresh. Why wait</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.100" end="00:01:43.300" style="s2">till it rots?</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.300" end="00:01:45.400" style="s2">Smells awful, but tastes pretty good.</p>
<p begin="00:01:43.300" end="00:01:47.300" style="s2">This manatee packs a punch.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.400" end="00:01:50.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Erosion increased by 1%.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.300" end="00:01:52.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1% erosion, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.800" end="00:01:54.600" style="s2">Lungs supply oxygen. Can I make</p>
<p begin="00:01:52.800" end="00:01:56.100" style="s2">breathing gear out of this manatee?</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.600" end="00:01:57.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve had a bizarre thought. Sanity</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.100" end="00:02:00.292" style="s2">decreased by five.</p>
<p begin="00:01:57.300" end="00:02:02.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. Now let me think.</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.292" end="00:02:04.892" style="s2">It worked. Crafting successful. Manatee</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.592" end="00:02:07.192" style="s2">breathing set. Blue tier eroded item.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.892" end="00:02:09.392" style="s2">First craft reward, 500 island coins.</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.192" end="00:02:11.792" style="s2">500 island coins must be the currency</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.392" end="00:02:13.092" style="s2">here. Right. The chat menu had a trading</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.792" end="00:02:15.586" style="s2">feature.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.092" end="00:02:17.606" style="s2">Dude, why is the WHOLE PICTURE CENSORED?</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.586" end="00:02:17.606" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:17.892" end="00:02:22.692" style="s2">WHAT KIND OF OXYGEN TANK scares the</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.992" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">system into censoring it? Seriously?</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.692" end="00:02:27.292" style="s2">It&#39;s just an oxygen tank. Why censor it?</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.492" end="00:02:34.192" style="s2">Raw albino giant mouth manatee meat,</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.492" end="00:02:35.992" style="s2">eroded. Manatee guy&#39;s back. Causes mild</p>
<p begin="00:02:34.192" end="00:02:38.692" style="s2">contamination if eaten. Is that even</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.992" end="00:02:41.092" style="s2">edible? My bad. It&#39;s censored guy now.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.692" end="00:02:43.392" style="s2">It&#39;s raw and contaminated. You sure?</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.092" end="00:02:45.592" style="s2">Yep. It&#39;s all plants on my island. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.392" end="00:02:47.392" style="s2">can&#39;t even find a worm. Besides, my holy</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.592" end="00:02:49.492" style="s2">islands trait blocks contamination. I</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.392" end="00:02:51.292" style="s2">just want tasty meat. What&#39;s your offer?</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.492" end="00:02:53.192" style="s2">A cup of holy water, sipped by Zhong</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.292" end="00:02:54.792" style="s2">Biao. It carries a minor blessing.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.192" end="00:02:56.892" style="s2">Today&#39;s blessing turns the water in any</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.792" end="00:02:58.892" style="s2">container I drink from into holy water.</p>
<p begin="00:02:56.892" end="00:03:01.392" style="s2">It protects against contamination. Just</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.892" end="00:03:02.792" style="s2">one cup. I&#39;m short on fresh water, too.</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.392" end="00:03:05.192" style="s2">Who knows what blessing I&#39;ll get</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.792" end="00:03:06.892" style="s2">tomorrow. Nice. Thanks, man. I&#39;ll hit</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.192" end="00:03:08.892" style="s2">you up when I find more good stuff. No</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.892" end="00:03:11.292" style="s2">problem. Hope you don&#39;t mind. I only</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.892" end="00:03:13.292" style="s2">took one sip. Dude, next time tell me</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.292" end="00:03:15.592" style="s2">that before we trade. Save me some good</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.292" end="00:03:15.592" style="s2">meat.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.692" end="00:03:27.692" style="s2">Big eye turbot, a fast boneless fish</p>
<p begin="00:03:25.092" end="00:03:30.392" style="s2">with tender silky flesh. Its huge eyes</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.692" end="00:03:33.492" style="s2">track predators from every angle.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.392" end="00:03:35.892" style="s2">Extremely cunning. Fine. Just you wait.</p>
<p begin="00:03:33.492" end="00:03:38.092" style="s2">You&#39;ll be dinner someday. Right now, I</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.892" end="00:03:41.892" style="s2">need materials to put my talent to use.</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.092" end="00:03:44.592" style="s2">Ideally rocks or ore.</p>
<p begin="00:03:41.892" end="00:03:47.092" style="s2">Spiny kelp entangles and attacks nearby</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.592" end="00:03:50.092" style="s2">creatures. Even the kelp is deadly. So</p>
<p begin="00:03:47.092" end="00:03:50.092" style="s2">I&#39;m the only pushover here.</p>
<p begin="00:03:50.892" end="00:03:57.792" style="s2">What&#39;s that? Curiosity killed the cat,</p>
<p begin="00:03:53.392" end="00:03:57.792" style="s2">but no risk, no reward. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:03:58.392" end="00:04:00.792" style="s2">Faster.</p>
<p begin="00:04:08.494" end="00:04:12.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So-called psychic interference detected.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.894" end="00:04:14.294" style="s2">Checking.</p>
<p begin="00:04:12.194" end="00:04:16.094" style="s2">Your spirit stat is too low.</p>
<p begin="00:04:14.294" end="00:04:17.994" style="s2">Psychic interference went unnoticed.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.094" end="00:04:20.094" style="s2">Psychic interference. These sea</p>
<p begin="00:04:17.994" end="00:04:21.494" style="s2">creatures have psychic attacks, too. I</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.094" end="00:04:23.094" style="s2">was wondering what all that commotion</p>
<p begin="00:04:21.494" end="00:04:26.394" style="s2">behind me was.</p>
<p begin="00:04:23.094" end="00:04:28.094" style="s2">Turns out you&#39;re fighting each other.</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.394" end="00:04:29.494" style="s2">Nice find. I&#39;ll leave this with the</p>
<p begin="00:04:28.094" end="00:04:31.294" style="s2">manatee later.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.494" end="00:04:33.094" style="s2">Add a little variety.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.294" end="00:04:34.294" style="s2">No idea where the manatee drifted off</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.094" end="00:04:36.694" style="s2">to, though.</p>
<p begin="00:04:34.294" end="00:04:39.294" style="s2">Whatever. I&#39;ll find it when I surface.</p>
<p begin="00:04:36.694" end="00:04:42.194" style="s2">Not even an inventory? This system&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:39.294" end="00:04:42.194" style="s2">slacking off.</p>
<p begin="00:04:46.094" end="00:04:48.394" style="s2">Hidden things behind the psychic</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.294" end="00:04:50.894" style="s2">attacks.</p>
<p begin="00:04:48.394" end="00:04:52.394" style="s2">Ghost face sea jade.</p>
<p begin="00:04:50.894" end="00:04:54.194" style="s2">Where&#39;s the ghost face?</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.394" end="00:04:56.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Psychic interference went unnoticed. My</p>
<p begin="00:04:54.194" end="00:04:59.294" style="s2">spirit&#39;s so low. I can&#39;t even see</p>
<p begin="00:04:56.694" end="00:04:59.294" style="s2">ghosts.</p>
<p begin="00:05:07.194" end="00:05:10.794" style="s2">Crafting successful. Ghost face dagger.</p>
<p begin="00:05:09.194" end="00:05:11.894" style="s2">A blue tier eroded weapon that causes</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.794" end="00:05:15.894" style="s2">psychic interference.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.894" end="00:05:15.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now I can finally catch a fish, right?</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.194" end="00:05:26.094" style="s2">Giant spine fish. Erosion, 12%.</p>
<p begin="00:05:23.394" end="00:05:28.094" style="s2">Carnivorous. Highly aggressive.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.094" end="00:05:30.794" style="s2">Talk about a bad back. His bones are</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.094" end="00:05:33.594" style="s2">sticking right out.</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.794" end="00:05:33.594" style="s2">Let go and I&#39;m dinner.</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.894" end="00:05:45.394" style="s2">You&#39;re the one that grabbed my foot.</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.794" end="00:05:47.994" style="s2">Blind purple worm. A spine fish symbiote</p>
<p begin="00:05:45.394" end="00:05:47.994" style="s2">that helps it hunt.</p>
<p begin="00:05:48.494" end="00:05:52.794" style="s2">You&#39;re already this freakish AND YOU</p>
<p begin="00:05:50.094" end="00:05:52.794" style="s2">NEED BACKUP.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.594" end="00:06:02.194" style="s2">TWO TARGETS SLAIN. One core and one</p>
<p begin="00:05:59.794" end="00:06:04.694" style="s2">potion awarded. Bestiary and inventory</p>
<p begin="00:06:02.194" end="00:06:04.694" style="s2">unlocked.</p>
<p begin="00:06:05.794" end="00:06:09.695" style="s2">Finally,</p>
<p begin="00:06:06.895" end="00:06:09.695" style="s2">an inventory.</p>
<p begin="00:06:11.195" end="00:06:15.195" style="s2">Use to upgrade your island. Upgrade. I</p>
<p begin="00:06:13.495" end="00:06:17.195" style="s2">have no land, but upgrading the water</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.195" end="00:06:19.595" style="s2">works, too. I&#39;ll save it. It&#39;ll come in</p>
<p begin="00:06:17.195" end="00:06:19.595" style="s2">handy.</p>
<p begin="00:06:19.695" end="00:06:23.834" style="s2">You&#39;re selling scrap, too? Are you even</p>
<p begin="00:06:21.495" end="00:06:25.854" style="s2">legit?</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.834" end="00:06:25.854" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:26.495" end="00:06:29.895" style="s2">What&#39;s that smell?</p>
<p begin="00:06:27.595" end="00:06:31.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Strength increased. CURRENT STRENGTH</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.895" end="00:06:35.595" style="s2">EIGHT.</p>
<p begin="00:06:31.895" end="00:06:35.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GETTING STRONGER COMES WITH A BEATING?</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.895" end="00:06:42.595" style="s2">Got a drop. Monsters drop enhancement</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.795" end="00:06:44.695" style="s2">potions.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.595" end="00:06:45.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Monsters? A rabbit nearly KICKED ME TO</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.695" end="00:06:47.295" style="s2">DEATH.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.495" end="00:06:49.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A small freshwater croc. I&#39;m pretty</p>
<p begin="00:06:47.295" end="00:06:50.995" style="s2">strong. Know your limits.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.395" end="00:06:53.495" style="s2">Funny. I just took down a big one</p>
<p begin="00:06:50.995" end="00:06:53.495" style="s2">myself.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.595" end="00:06:59.995" style="s2">I&#39;ve never seen stars like these.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.195" end="00:07:00.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anyone see that huge black pillar? LET&#39;S</p>
<p begin="00:06:59.995" end="00:07:03.395" style="s2">FLY BESIDE IT.</p>
<p begin="00:07:00.895" end="00:07:03.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BIRDS.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.695" end="00:07:07.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m close by. I can see it.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.295" end="00:07:14.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those aren&#39;t birds.</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.095" end="00:07:19.495" style="s2">Only two hours of oxygen left. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.595" end="00:07:20.795" style="s2">hide underwater all night. I&#39;ve got to</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.495" end="00:07:22.695" style="s2">think of something.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.795" end="00:07:24.495" style="s2">What can I craft?</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.695" end="00:07:26.795" style="s2">It needs to hit from a distance and be</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.495" end="00:07:31.195" style="s2">retrievable. Supplies are limited, so</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.795" end="00:07:31.195" style="s2">keep it simple. That&#39;s it. A spear.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.195" end="00:07:41.995" style="s2">Almost done. You had a bizarre idea.</p>
<p begin="00:07:40.495" end="00:07:44.695" style="s2">Sanity decreased by three.</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.995" end="00:07:46.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, I know. Just run the check.</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.695" end="00:07:48.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Crafting successful. Cunning spinefish</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.795" end="00:07:51.395" style="s2">spear gun. Its spear homes in on</p>
<p begin="00:07:48.695" end="00:07:53.995" style="s2">targets. Returns after four seconds.</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.395" end="00:07:55.395" style="s2">Stay clear. A missed shot may impale the</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.995" end="00:07:57.295" style="s2">user on return.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.395" end="00:08:00.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I turned you into rope, and you still</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.295" end="00:08:00.095" style="s2">want revenge.</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.095" end="00:08:13.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally. This damn thing can even catch</p>
<p begin="00:08:10.297" end="00:08:13.297" style="s2">fish underwater.</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.597" end="00:08:21.497" style="s2">Yes, that here.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.197" end="00:08:30.597" style="s2">I&#39;ve got nothing to brace against.</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.197" end="00:08:33.297" style="s2">I can&#39;t keep betting the fishing line</p>
<p begin="00:08:30.597" end="00:08:33.297" style="s2">won&#39;t snap.</p>
<p begin="00:08:37.097" end="00:08:40.997" style="s2">Bunny, your timing is perfect.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.997" end="00:08:53.397" style="s2">Play some music.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.597" end="00:08:56.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just needed a rope to tie us together.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.397" end="00:08:56.297" style="s2">How thoughtful of you.</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.197" end="00:09:10.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Try getting loose now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.697" end="00:09:15.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Die.</p>
<p begin="00:09:17.497" end="00:09:21.697" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have slain a winged night demon.</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.297" end="00:09:39.597" style="s2">You rule the surface.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.297" end="00:09:43.397" style="s2">But underwater, I&#39;m the damn boss now.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.597" end="00:09:43.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Winged night demon slain.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.897" end="00:09:49.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s going back to warn the others.</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.997" end="00:09:50.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three winged night demons slain on your</p>
<p begin="00:09:49.197" end="00:09:53.397" style="s2">first night.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.497" end="00:09:57.697" style="s2">Rare title unlocked. Night Hunter.</p>
<p begin="00:09:53.397" end="00:09:57.697" style="s2">Reward, 5,000 island coins.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.597" end="00:10:03.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just finished fighting out there. Now</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.797" end="00:10:03.497" style="s2">you again.</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.497" end="00:10:09.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just got lucky this time.</p>
<p begin="00:10:07.397" end="00:10:12.198" style="s2">Only two came down at once.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.197" end="00:10:12.198" style="s2">But about next time?</p>
<p begin="00:10:12.298" end="00:10:17.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Night Hunter, deal 30% more damage to</p>
<p begin="00:10:14.698" end="00:10:18.198" style="s2">monsters in the dark, plus an extra 10%</p>
<p begin="00:10:17.098" end="00:10:20.698" style="s2">against night demons.</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.198" end="00:10:22.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that&#39;s a serious combat boost.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.698" end="00:10:23.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like everyone&#39;s still fighting for</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.098" end="00:10:25.098" style="s2">their lives. I wonder how many will</p>
<p begin="00:10:23.998" end="00:10:27.298" style="s2">survive tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:10:25.098" end="00:10:29.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations on surviving your first</p>
<p begin="00:10:27.298" end="00:10:31.298" style="s2">night. 123,710</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.598" end="00:10:32.798" style="s2">challengers died last night. Islands</p>
<p begin="00:10:31.298" end="00:10:35.098" style="s2">with no surviving challengers have</p>
<p begin="00:10:32.798" end="00:10:37.198" style="s2">fallen. 68,115</p>
<p begin="00:10:35.098" end="00:10:38.598" style="s2">challengers slew a winged night demon.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.198" end="00:10:40.398" style="s2">Rewards have been issued. Check your</p>
<p begin="00:10:38.598" end="00:10:41.798" style="s2">terminal for details. One challenger</p>
<p begin="00:10:40.398" end="00:10:43.898" style="s2">slew three winged night demons on the</p>
<p begin="00:10:41.798" end="00:10:44.998" style="s2">first night, unlocking totem poles early</p>
<p begin="00:10:43.898" end="00:10:46.998" style="s2">for all challengers.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.998" end="00:10:48.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over 120,000?</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.998" end="00:10:49.798" style="s2">That many died last night?</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.498" end="00:10:51.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone killed three three of those</p>
<p begin="00:10:49.798" end="00:10:53.498" style="s2">things in a row? Seriously? Paging the</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.698" end="00:10:55.498" style="s2">badass who killed three NIGHT DEMONS.</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.498" end="00:10:57.098" style="s2">MESSAGE ME. I&#39;LL BE YOUR LOYAL SIDEKICK</p>
<p begin="00:10:55.498" end="00:11:00.398" style="s2">FOREVER.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.098" end="00:11:02.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Over 8 billion people. Only 120,000 or</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.398" end="00:11:05.998" style="s2">so died against those monsters. How many</p>
<p begin="00:11:02.998" end="00:11:05.998" style="s2">people were sent here?</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.698" end="00:11:16.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s camouflaged, too. Who keeps</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.898" end="00:11:16.898" style="s2">valuables in a crappy wooden box?</p>
<p begin="00:11:17.198" end="00:11:21.298" style="s2">Just my luck. It won&#39;t open.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.498" end="00:11:32.298" style="s2">Well, this tastes better than the last</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.798" end="00:11:32.298" style="s2">bottle.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.498" end="00:11:42.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A curse.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.898" end="00:11:46.498" style="s2">Found it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:43.698" end="00:11:48.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Night demon attacks can inflict a curse.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.498" end="00:11:52.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get to the point. You&#39;re killing me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:48.898" end="00:11:54.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The wound goes numb, then hardens.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.298" end="00:11:55.998" style="s2">It spreads until the whole body turns to</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.598" end="00:11:58.398" style="s2">stone.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.998" end="00:12:01.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The cure. The book must mention a cure.</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.398" end="00:12:01.498" style="s2">That&#39;s all there is.</p>
<p begin="00:12:04.598" end="00:12:08.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wards off mild corruption. Might not</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.698" end="00:12:09.898" style="s2">break the curse, though. I have only got</p>
<p begin="00:12:08.298" end="00:12:12.998" style="s2">one cup.</p>
<p begin="00:12:09.898" end="00:12:12.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not dying just yet.</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.199" end="00:12:18.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s its dad?</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.799" end="00:12:22.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The manatee lost its head, too.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.699" end="00:12:22.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ate it right next to it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.499" end="00:12:31.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With legs that look like that, it&#39;s hard</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.899" end="00:12:31.999" style="s2">to stomach eating them.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.299" end="00:12:44.699" style="s2">I unlocked the reward.</p>
<p begin="00:12:48.299" end="00:12:50.899" style="s2">Unviolent.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.999" end="00:12:54.399" style="s2">You released a floating island.</p>
<p begin="00:12:57.399" end="00:12:59.799" style="s2">Want some cuttlefish tentacles? They&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.099" end="00:13:01.199" style="s2">fresh.</p>
<p begin="00:12:59.799" end="00:13:02.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;d you get those?</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.199" end="00:13:03.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dude, did you have babies? Name your</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.599" end="00:13:06.699" style="s2">price, buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:03.499" end="00:13:06.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What blessing did you get today?</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.899" end="00:13:12.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll tell you, but keep it to yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:13:13.299" end="00:13:18.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flower petals</p>
<p begin="00:13:14.899" end="00:13:19.499" style="s2">and a floral scent.</p>
<p begin="00:13:18.099" end="00:13:22.384" style="s2">Do the petals do anything?</p>
<p begin="00:13:19.499" end="00:13:22.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead, laugh. JUST DON&#39;T TELL ANYONE.</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.384" end="00:13:26.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:13:22.799" end="00:13:26.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TELL me what you want, buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:13:26.299" end="00:13:29.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, they do have some use. Do they</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.299" end="00:13:31.299" style="s2">keep things warm?</p>
<p begin="00:13:29.199" end="00:13:34.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, and they retain moisture.</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.299" end="00:13:34.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal. I&#39;ll take this for now.</p>
<p begin="00:13:35.499" end="00:13:41.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Island detected within 300 m. Assessing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.299" end="00:13:44.599" style="s2">Assessment complete. Temporary passage</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.499" end="00:13:46.699" style="s2">to Volcano Island created. Duration, 36</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.599" end="00:13:48.899" style="s2">hours. Both islands will travel side by</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.699" end="00:13:50.899" style="s2">side at the same speed while the passage</p>
<p begin="00:13:48.899" end="00:13:53.899" style="s2">is active. Return to your island before</p>
<p begin="00:13:50.899" end="00:13:53.899" style="s2">the passage closes.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.899" end="00:13:59.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I have to make it back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:00.499" end="00:14:04.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hot. So hot.</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.299" end="00:14:05.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that really a banana?</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.099" end="00:14:07.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Restores health when eaten. Explodes on</p>
<p begin="00:14:05.899" end="00:14:09.199" style="s2">contact with an open flame. The trunk</p>
<p begin="00:14:07.799" end="00:14:10.599" style="s2">stores heat, providing protection</p>
<p begin="00:14:09.199" end="00:14:12.899" style="s2">against extreme cold.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.599" end="00:14:15.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it&#39;s a jalapeno bomb. My butt hurts</p>
<p begin="00:14:12.899" end="00:14:15.901" style="s2">just thinking it.</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.801" end="00:14:23.901" style="s2">Something&#39;s being here.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.201" end="00:14:23.901" style="s2">Something big.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.401" end="00:14:33.801" style="s2">Amber stone stores large amounts of heat</p>
<p begin="00:14:31.601" end="00:14:36.701" style="s2">and can be used to start fires. Now I</p>
<p begin="00:14:33.801" end="00:14:39.201" style="s2">can make fire, grilled fish, cuttlefish,</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.701" end="00:14:39.201" style="s2">shrimp.</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.601" end="00:14:46.801" style="s2">This rock&#39;s almost hot enough to fry</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.201" end="00:14:46.801" style="s2">meat on.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.601" end="00:14:54.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, bro. I&#39;m counting on you.</p>
<p begin="00:14:55.001" end="00:15:00.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Crafting successful. Holy gloves protect</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.701" end="00:15:02.101" style="s2">your hands, deals corrosive damage to</p>
<p begin="00:15:00.001" end="00:15:04.401" style="s2">night demons and dark creatures.</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.101" end="00:15:06.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keeps my hands warm and moisturized.</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.401" end="00:15:09.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Encounters night demons to boot.</p>
<p begin="00:15:06.201" end="00:15:09.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nice. Very nice.</p>
<p begin="00:15:15.201" end="00:15:19.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You witnessed an incomprehensible sight.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.001" end="00:15:23.801" style="s2">Sanity decreased by three.</p>
<p begin="00:15:19.901" end="00:15:23.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You call this taking a bath?</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.601" end="00:15:33.401" style="s2">All right. My strength&#39;s at 11 now.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.601" end="00:15:48.801" style="s2">Where&#39;s he going?</p>
<p begin="00:15:46.101" end="00:15:48.801" style="s2">Let&#39;s follow him.</p>
<p begin="00:15:53.101" end="00:15:55.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill him.</p>
<p begin="00:16:13.401" end="00:16:15.901" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Human.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.601" end="00:16:20.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat [clears throat] this.</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.402" end="00:16:32.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like you&#39;ve ravaged another</p>
<p begin="00:16:30.102" end="00:16:34.902" style="s2">island.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.602" end="00:16:37.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is all I get to eat. You might as</p>
<p begin="00:16:34.902" end="00:16:40.602" style="s2">well let me starve and those mole people</p>
<p begin="00:16:37.302" end="00:16:40.602" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t yell at you every day.</p>
<p begin="00:16:41.502" end="00:16:47.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Die and we&#39;ll just find Pearl Island</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.002" end="00:16:50.102" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:47.702" end="00:16:51.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll never come across Pearl Island</p>
<p begin="00:16:50.102" end="00:16:56.571" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:16:51.602" end="00:16:58.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The great emissary has his ways.</p>
<p begin="00:16:56.571" end="00:16:58.591" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:17:01.302" end="00:17:05.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, everyone attack.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.902" end="00:17:14.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hold it together.</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.202" end="00:17:17.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:17:14.502" end="00:17:17.302" style="s2">My Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.102" end="00:17:28.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You savage monkeys. I SAID NOT TO DRAIN</p>
<p begin="00:17:25.302" end="00:17:28.902" style="s2">THEM DRY. OUR GREAT LORD DOESN&#39;T like</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.002" end="00:17:31.602" style="s2">offerings like that.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.902" end="00:17:33.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our Lord likes the essence of fire.</p>
<p begin="00:17:31.602" end="00:17:34.602" style="s2">Those monkeys make fine offerings once</p>
<p begin="00:17:33.802" end="00:17:37.502" style="s2">they&#39;re dead.</p>
<p begin="00:17:34.602" end="00:17:39.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A petrification curse. Unlucky monkey.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.502" end="00:17:42.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No matter. To our great Lord, that&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.902" end="00:17:45.502" style="s2">nothing. A perfect monkey offering.</p>
<p begin="00:17:42.702" end="00:17:47.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Rocks, rocks, and glorious</p>
<p begin="00:17:45.502" end="00:17:50.802" style="s2">ore. Keep digging.</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.702" end="00:17:50.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s something buried here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.102" end="00:17:56.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, I&#39;ve been caught.</p>
<p begin="00:17:59.102" end="00:18:01.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t leave me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.002" end="00:18:09.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mental manipulation detected. No effect.</p>
<p begin="00:18:07.702" end="00:18:10.602" style="s2">The harpoon psychic interference has</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.402" end="00:18:11.602" style="s2">disrupted the target&#39;s mind</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.602" end="00:18:13.902" style="s2">controllability.</p>
<p begin="00:18:11.602" end="00:18:15.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A psychic attack, huh? Trying that on</p>
<p begin="00:18:13.902" end="00:18:17.002" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:18:15.002" end="00:18:19.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT SHOULD HAVE WORKED. WHY DIDN&#39;T IT?</p>
<p begin="00:18:17.002" end="00:18:20.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tiny head you&#39;ve got. Can&#39;t take much of</p>
<p begin="00:18:19.402" end="00:18:20.503" style="s2">a beating.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.302" end="00:18:23.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.503" end="00:18:25.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; hit me. Hit him. He knows more.</p>
<p begin="00:18:23.203" end="00:18:27.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ran off and now you want me to TAKE</p>
<p begin="00:18:25.303" end="00:18:27.903" style="s2">THE BEATING.</p>
<p begin="00:18:28.903" end="00:18:31.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET ME ASK YOU SOMETHING. THAT WOMAN,</p>
<p begin="00:18:30.403" end="00:18:33.103" style="s2">THE RED-HAIRED baboon is holding</p>
<p begin="00:18:31.603" end="00:18:33.903" style="s2">captive. Where&#39;s she from?</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.103" end="00:18:35.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:18:33.903" end="00:18:37.603" style="s2">What&#39;s a woman?</p>
<p begin="00:18:35.003" end="00:18:38.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The female Pearl folk. How dense are</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.603" end="00:18:40.303" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:38.003" end="00:18:41.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. The Pearl folk. Why&#39;d you capture</p>
<p begin="00:18:40.303" end="00:18:43.603" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:18:41.003" end="00:18:45.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our great lord chose her as an offering.</p>
<p begin="00:18:43.603" end="00:18:46.103" style="s2">She&#39;s blessed to become part of our</p>
<p begin="00:18:45.103" end="00:18:48.603" style="s2">lord.</p>
<p begin="00:18:46.103" end="00:18:49.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Such a wonderful blessing wanted for</p>
<p begin="00:18:48.603" end="00:18:50.803" style="s2">yourselves.</p>
<p begin="00:18:49.603" end="00:18:51.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:18:50.803" end="00:18:52.903" style="s2">do you?</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.603" end="00:18:54.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.903" end="00:18:56.703" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.403" end="00:18:58.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Actually, we&#39;re on the same side.</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.703" end="00:18:59.603" style="s2">I&#39;m from Abyss Island. Heard of the lord</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.703" end="00:19:03.103" style="s2">of the abyss?</p>
<p begin="00:18:59.603" end="00:19:05.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He and your lord are sworn brothers.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.103" end="00:19:07.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sounds impressive.</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.003" end="00:19:08.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lord of the abyss sent me here today</p>
<p begin="00:19:07.603" end="00:19:10.803" style="s2">for one reason.</p>
<p begin="00:19:08.903" end="00:19:12.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He wants to make a deal with your lord.</p>
<p begin="00:19:10.803" end="00:19:14.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the difference between making a</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.303" end="00:19:15.403" style="s2">deal with the great lord and offering a</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.403" end="00:19:18.003" style="s2">sacrifice?</p>
<p begin="00:19:15.403" end="00:19:20.203" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s only a deal when both sides are</p>
<p begin="00:19:18.003" end="00:19:21.503" style="s2">equals. You hand things over to the one</p>
<p begin="00:19:20.203" end="00:19:22.303" style="s2">above you. That&#39;s what you call a</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.503" end="00:19:23.303" style="s2">sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:19:22.303" end="00:19:27.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.303" end="00:19:27.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s what the high priest said, too.</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.503" end="00:19:38.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill the alien demon. Kill the fire</p>
<p begin="00:19:35.703" end="00:19:39.103" style="s2">cultivator, Pong Pi Pong.</p>
<p begin="00:19:38.303" end="00:19:41.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.103" end="00:19:43.603" style="s2">We&#39;re all family here.</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.103" end="00:19:44.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now take me to meet your lord. You two,</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.603" end="00:19:47.103" style="s2">help me carry this.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.903" end="00:19:48.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This monkey&#39;s huge. If you ask again,</p>
<p begin="00:19:47.103" end="00:19:49.003" style="s2">it&#39;ll beat you up.</p>
<p begin="00:19:48.103" end="00:19:51.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And me too.</p>
<p begin="00:19:49.003" end="00:19:52.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on. We&#39;re family. No need to talk</p>
<p begin="00:19:51.103" end="00:19:54.603" style="s2">about fighting. You don&#39;t have to carry</p>
<p begin="00:19:52.703" end="00:19:55.903" style="s2">it. You&#39;re taking these to the sacrifice</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.603" end="00:19:57.903" style="s2">later anyway, right?</p>
<p begin="00:19:55.903" end="00:19:59.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, right, right. Let the monkeys carry</p>
<p begin="00:19:57.903" end="00:20:00.803" style="s2">it. We&#39;ll take you there.</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.303" end="00:20:02.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We still don&#39;t know what to call you,</p>
<p begin="00:20:00.803" end="00:20:04.303" style="s2">envoy of the lord of the abyss.</p>
<p begin="00:20:02.703" end="00:20:06.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just call me envoy king.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.303" end="00:20:09.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Envoy king, sir.</p>
<p begin="00:20:06.003" end="00:20:11.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s too long. Just call me lord Wang.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.003" end="00:20:11.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, lord Wang.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.303" end="00:20:17.703" style="s2">This is lord Wang, a guest of the great</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.503" end="00:20:20.803" style="s2">lord and one of our family.</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.703" end="00:20:22.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;ll be starved for 3 days. He&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.803" end="00:20:23.405" style="s2">sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:20:22.103" end="00:20:25.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s an important sacrifice for the</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.405" end="00:20:28.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lord. The ceremony is tomorrow night.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.705" end="00:20:29.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let him waste away before then. Is</p>
<p begin="00:20:28.305" end="00:20:31.505" style="s2">that clear?</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.005" end="00:20:31.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fly enough.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.905" end="00:20:35.105" style="s2">Walk on the ground.</p>
<p begin="00:20:33.905" end="00:20:37.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep walking like that.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.105" end="00:20:38.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One pit with every step. It&#39;s part of</p>
<p begin="00:20:37.205" end="00:20:39.805" style="s2">the ritual for meeting the Lord. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.905" end="00:20:42.705" style="s2">you know the rules?</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.805" end="00:20:42.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.505" end="00:20:59.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Elders, this is Lord Wang.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.405" end="00:21:00.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;d call just anyone Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.205" end="00:21:04.405" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s an envoy sent by the Lord of the</p>
<p begin="00:21:00.705" end="00:21:04.405" style="s2">abyss to meet the great Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.605" end="00:21:09.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since he&#39;s an envoy, we must treat him</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.705" end="00:21:11.505" style="s2">properly. Please rest here. At tomorrow</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.305" end="00:21:12.905" style="s2">night&#39;s ceremony, you&#39;ll be granted an</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.505" end="00:21:14.105" style="s2">audience with the Lord.</p>
<p begin="00:21:12.905" end="00:21:19.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Much obliged.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.105" end="00:21:19.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Praise the Lord of the abyss, Zuo Huang.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.905" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rest as you please, Lord Wang. Just stay</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.005" end="00:21:25.305" style="s2">away from the volcano wall.</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.905" end="00:21:30.905" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s still time.</p>
<p begin="00:21:48.105" end="00:21:50.705" style="s2">Wake up.</p>
<p begin="00:21:54.105" end="00:21:56.405" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:22:05.405" end="00:22:09.105" style="s2">Give me a proper welcome.</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.075" end="00:22:26.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.905" end="00:22:26.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re actually awake.</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.805" end="00:22:28.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The</p>
<p begin="00:22:26.906" end="00:22:31.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; fluid that Mount secretes puts you to</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.806" end="00:22:32.206" style="s2">sleep. You should have slept until you</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.006" end="00:22:34.306" style="s2">died.</p>
<p begin="00:22:32.206" end="00:22:35.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m an envoy here to see your lord. Is</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.306" end="00:22:36.506" style="s2">this how you treat guests?</p>
<p begin="00:22:35.865" end="00:22:38.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.506" end="00:22:41.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lord of the abyss.</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.306" end="00:22:43.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sea has long been masterless. He</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.006" end="00:22:45.706" style="s2">could never appear in these skies.</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.206" end="00:22:47.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And an abyss island? Please, at least</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.706" end="00:22:49.406" style="s2">make your lies believable.</p>
<p begin="00:22:47.306" end="00:22:50.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really are clueless.</p>
<p begin="00:22:49.406" end="00:22:52.106" style="s2">You wouldn&#39;t know your own lord if HE</p>
<p begin="00:22:50.706" end="00:22:55.406" style="s2">STOOD RIGHT BEFORE YOU.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.106" end="00:22:56.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOW DARE YOU? YOU dare insult our great</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.406" end="00:22:58.306" style="s2">lord?</p>
<p begin="00:22:56.306" end="00:23:00.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mental manipulation ineffective. After</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.306" end="00:23:03.206" style="s2">hearing an unknown entity&#39;s whispers,</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.306" end="00:23:05.906" style="s2">mental resistance increased by 200% for</p>
<p begin="00:23:03.206" end="00:23:05.906" style="s2">30 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:23:05.995" end="00:23:09.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.506" end="00:23:12.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now it&#39;s my turn. Eat this, an 11</p>
<p begin="00:23:09.706" end="00:23:12.606" style="s2">strength thrust.</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.306" end="00:23:20.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ghost face dagger damaged, repair</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.306" end="00:23:20.706" style="s2">possible.</p>
<p begin="00:23:23.306" end="00:23:25.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charge.</p>
<p begin="00:23:36.906" end="00:23:42.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is a game.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.806" end="00:23:43.706" style="s2">As long as my HP isn&#39;t zero, I won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.806" end="00:23:46.706" style="s2">die.</p>
<p begin="00:23:43.706" end="00:23:49.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire speckle pepper used, restored 5 HP.</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.706" end="00:23:53.806" style="s2">Fire speckle pepper used, restored 5 HP.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.106" end="00:23:53.806" style="s2">Fire speckle pepper used, restored 5 HP.</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.706" end="00:24:10.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lord Wang, why did you come rolling down</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.806" end="00:24:10.506" style="s2">the mountain?</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.606" end="00:24:15.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your lord was delighted to hear I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.106" end="00:24:16.906" style="s2">arrived. He sent an elder that very</p>
<p begin="00:24:15.906" end="00:24:21.206" style="s2">night to invite me up.</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.906" end="00:24:23.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why hasn&#39;t that elder returned?</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.206" end="00:24:24.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On the way, he heard your lord calling</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.306" end="00:24:26.806" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.706" end="00:24:28.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He transcended his limits and entered</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.806" end="00:24:29.307" style="s2">your lord&#39;s embrace.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.006" end="00:24:31.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How wonderful. Your</p>
<p begin="00:24:29.307" end="00:24:32.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; lord accepted him just like that. He</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.007" end="00:24:33.607" style="s2">must have been blessed for showing</p>
<p begin="00:24:32.007" end="00:24:36.507" style="s2">another envoy respect.</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.607" end="00:24:39.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve made so many sacrifices, but our</p>
<p begin="00:24:36.507" end="00:24:41.408" style="s2">lord never answered. He takes this man</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.507" end="00:24:44.408" style="s2">up there and it works.</p>
<p begin="00:24:41.408" end="00:24:48.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could he really be an envoy?</p>
<p begin="00:24:44.408" end="00:24:50.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our lucky charm. I mean Lord Wang.</p>
<p begin="00:24:48.507" end="00:24:52.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did you get hurt so badly?</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.507" end="00:24:54.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, that fellow may be blessed.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.408" end="00:24:55.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But he was so reckless. He even got you</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.507" end="00:24:58.807" style="s2">hurt, Lord Wang.</p>
<p begin="00:24:55.707" end="00:24:59.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. Hey, you. Yes, you. Go fetch my</p>
<p begin="00:24:58.807" end="00:25:00.607" style="s2">special remedy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:59.807" end="00:25:04.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Me?</p>
<p begin="00:25:00.607" end="00:25:04.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, you. Get moving.</p>
<p begin="00:25:10.908" end="00:25:14.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s good. Plenty of fresh air.</p>
<p begin="00:25:16.207" end="00:25:21.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Saltpeter sulfur soup restores HP over 1</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.307" end="00:25:24.007" style="s2">hour. Deft crafting talent detected.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.908" end="00:25:27.307" style="s2">Recipe analysis complete. Saltpeter</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.007" end="00:25:27.307" style="s2">sulfur soup recipe learned.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.908" end="00:25:32.507" style="s2">Good stuff.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.607" end="00:25:40.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry, buddy. Envoy Wang&#39;s got</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.607" end="00:25:41.207" style="s2">your back. I&#39;ll make sure you get the</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.107" end="00:25:44.207" style="s2">lord&#39;s blessing too.</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.207" end="00:25:44.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right now, Lord Wang.</p>
<p begin="00:25:45.307" end="00:25:48.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow, of course. Even our great lord</p>
<p begin="00:25:47.807" end="00:25:52.408" style="s2">needs a break.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.707" end="00:25:52.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good things come to those who wait.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.707" end="00:26:07.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I only just recovered. I can&#39;t risk</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.707" end="00:26:07.507" style="s2">another explosion.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.908" end="00:26:14.908" style="s2">Crafting complete.</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.607" end="00:26:22.107" style="s2">Elite enemies on the third night. They</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.507" end="00:26:22.107" style="s2">won&#39;t even give me a breather.</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.107" end="00:26:33.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Send me the stats. Let me see. Here are</p>
<p begin="00:26:30.409" end="00:26:33.909" style="s2">my item stats.</p>
<p begin="00:26:41.709" end="00:26:45.609" style="s2">Don&#39;t worry. They&#39;re from a set, but I</p>
<p begin="00:26:44.009" end="00:26:47.909" style="s2">have several sets on my island. Breaking</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.609" end="00:26:49.809" style="s2">up one is no big deal. I&#39;ll give you 40</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.909" end="00:26:51.809" style="s2">stacks of fire spotted bananas and a</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.809" end="00:26:54.109" style="s2">pair of holy gloves. Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.809" end="00:26:54.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.509" end="00:27:25.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s try a sip and see how much HP it</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.909" end="00:27:29.109" style="s2">restores. If I can get my HP back up,</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.509" end="00:27:29.109" style="s2">maybe I&#39;ll be able to stand again.</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.509" end="00:27:38.909" style="s2">Don&#39;t even need a stove, but if I stay</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.709" end="00:27:38.909" style="s2">here much longer, I&#39;ll be cooked too.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.709" end="00:27:47.609" style="s2">I&#39;ll call you two Lefty and Righty.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.409" end="00:27:49.009" style="s2">Come here. I&#39;ve got a question.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.609" end="00:27:50.109" style="s2">How do you polish these flow fire</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.009" end="00:27:51.909" style="s2">stones?</p>
<p begin="00:27:50.109" end="00:27:54.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With our teeth. They&#39;re harder than</p>
<p begin="00:27:51.909" end="00:27:54.309" style="s2">rock.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.409" end="00:27:58.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.409" end="00:27:59.709" style="s2">Why don&#39;t you use your teeth and claws</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.109" end="00:28:01.709" style="s2">to fight?</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.709" end="00:28:02.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our teeth are for eating. Our claws for</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.709" end="00:28:04.209" style="s2">digging.</p>
<p begin="00:28:02.309" end="00:28:06.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The baboons do the fighting.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.209" end="00:28:08.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Then help me with something you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.109" end="00:28:08.509" style="s2">good at.</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.609" end="00:28:15.809" style="s2">Grind it into this shape. Embed the Jade</p>
<p begin="00:28:13.509" end="00:28:17.209" style="s2">shards. Get the edges thin as you can.</p>
<p begin="00:28:15.809" end="00:28:20.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s this for, sir?</p>
<p begin="00:28:17.209" end="00:28:21.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s for someone. Just get it done.</p>
<p begin="00:28:20.209" end="00:28:22.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Find me at the baboons&#39; cave when you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:28:21.409" end="00:28:23.109" style="s2">done.</p>
<p begin="00:28:22.009" end="00:28:25.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll check on the Pearl Kin.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.109" end="00:28:25.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ritual&#39;s tonight. Why go see her</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.209" end="00:28:27.109" style="s2">now?</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.709" end="00:28:29.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say she won&#39;t eat?</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.109" end="00:28:30.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m an outsider, too. I&#39;ll talk to her.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.009" end="00:28:31.409" style="s2">Can&#39;t let your precious sacrifice starve</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.709" end="00:28:33.110" style="s2">to death.</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.409" end="00:28:35.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, sir. We&#39;ll come as soon as</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.110" end="00:28:38.910" style="s2">the blade&#39;s ready.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.410" end="00:28:39.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Spirit three, sanity slowly recovering.</p>
<p begin="00:28:38.910" end="00:28:43.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big rat.</p>
<p begin="00:28:39.810" end="00:28:43.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got a guest. Come say hello.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.010" end="00:28:48.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want?</p>
<p begin="00:28:46.210" end="00:28:50.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can I just drop by? Put me down first.</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.610" end="00:28:52.910" style="s2">Let me see the pearl can you&#39;re holding.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.410" end="00:28:55.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s an important sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.910" end="00:28:57.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, yes. She&#39;s for the great lord. I</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.110" end="00:28:59.710" style="s2">won&#39;t hurt her, but she hasn&#39;t eaten in</p>
<p begin="00:28:57.410" end="00:29:02.110" style="s2">three days. What if she starves to death</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.710" end="00:29:03.910" style="s2">before tonight? I&#39;m an outsider, too.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.110" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">She won&#39;t listen to you. But who&#39;s to</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.910" end="00:29:06.910" style="s2">say she won&#39;t listen to me?</p>
<p begin="00:29:09.110" end="00:29:12.310" style="s2">Too weak to even put on a brave face,</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.210" end="00:29:13.810" style="s2">huh?</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.310" end="00:29:16.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you real?</p>
<p begin="00:29:13.810" end="00:29:18.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep. Heaven sent me with food so you</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.510" end="00:29:20.510" style="s2">wouldn&#39;t starve. I&#39;d have to cook the</p>
<p begin="00:29:18.610" end="00:29:22.410" style="s2">raw fish. You&#39;re probably sick of</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.510" end="00:29:23.410" style="s2">looking at bananas by now. Try some</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.410" end="00:29:24.910" style="s2">kelp.</p>
<p begin="00:29:23.410" end="00:29:26.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who are you?</p>
<p begin="00:29:24.910" end="00:29:28.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m from another island. Just call me</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.710" end="00:29:29.510" style="s2">Envoy King.</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.010" end="00:29:31.410" style="s2">I&#39;m meeting that great lord tonight,</p>
<p begin="00:29:29.510" end="00:29:33.710" style="s2">too. Tonight might be your last night</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.410" end="00:29:34.810" style="s2">alive. You know that. Might as well eat</p>
<p begin="00:29:33.710" end="00:29:36.010" style="s2">something first.</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.810" end="00:29:38.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:29:36.010" end="00:29:39.510" style="s2">I know people like you. My name is</p>
<p begin="00:29:38.510" end="00:29:41.810" style="s2">Lanlan.</p>
<p begin="00:29:39.510" end="00:29:43.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tonight&#39;s the big night. You&#39;ll be</p>
<p begin="00:29:41.810" end="00:29:45.010" style="s2">ready, won&#39;t you?</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.710" end="00:29:47.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.010" end="00:29:47.710" style="s2">I&#39;ll be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.510" end="00:29:56.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You all agree that Envoy Wang should</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.010" end="00:29:58.410" style="s2">meet our lord at tonight&#39;s ritual.</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.310" end="00:30:00.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Envoy Wang brought our lord&#39;s blessing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.410" end="00:30:02.110" style="s2">Perhaps this is his will. If Envoy Wang</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.610" end="00:30:03.410" style="s2">can help awaken our lord tonight, it</p>
<p begin="00:30:02.110" end="00:30:04.110" style="s2">will surely bring searing heat and</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.410" end="00:30:05.610" style="s2">eternity.</p>
<p begin="00:30:04.110" end="00:30:07.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They say the pearl folk are blessed by</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.610" end="00:30:08.710" style="s2">the god of fertility, born with the</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.110" end="00:30:11.110" style="s2">power to revive and heal.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.710" end="00:30:13.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No harm must come to the pearl folk</p>
<p begin="00:30:11.110" end="00:30:16.110" style="s2">girl. As for the one claiming to be from</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.610" end="00:30:19.110" style="s2">the abyss, keep watching him.</p>
<p begin="00:30:16.110" end="00:30:20.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; As you command, high priest.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.110" end="00:30:22.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That baboon king again.</p>
<p begin="00:30:20.910" end="00:30:25.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is he barging in unannounced again?</p>
<p begin="00:30:22.710" end="00:30:27.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. He serves our lord just as you</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.010" end="00:30:30.010" style="s2">do. Go see what he wants.</p>
<p begin="00:30:27.110" end="00:30:30.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:30:31.710" end="00:30:34.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="00:30:32.510" end="00:30:35.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t I tell you to keep a constant</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.210" end="00:30:36.112" style="s2">watch on the pearl folk girl?</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.910" end="00:30:37.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What</p>
<p begin="00:30:36.112" end="00:30:40.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you doing here?</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.312" end="00:30:41.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Speak. That envoy Wang is up to</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.112" end="00:30:42.712" style="s2">something.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.012" end="00:30:44.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Pearl Folk Girl hadn&#39;t eaten for</p>
<p begin="00:30:42.712" end="00:30:47.212" style="s2">three days, but when he told her to get</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.912" end="00:30:48.912" style="s2">ready for tonight, she started eating.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.212" end="00:30:51.412" style="s2">HE MUST BE PLOTTING SOMETHING.</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.912" end="00:30:53.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A PLOT? ENOUGH.</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.412" end="00:30:53.912" style="s2">HOW DARE you slander Lord Wang before</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.112" end="00:30:56.012" style="s2">the elders?</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.912" end="00:30:57.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lord Wang is an honored guest favored by</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.012" end="00:30:58.512" style="s2">our great lord.</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.112" end="00:30:59.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You dare question our lord?</p>
<p begin="00:30:58.512" end="00:31:01.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your devotion to our lord is</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.912" end="00:31:04.112" style="s2">commendable. When we&#39;ve all gone to join</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.812" end="00:31:05.612" style="s2">our lord, you too shall take our places.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.112" end="00:31:07.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But enough of this.</p>
<p begin="00:31:05.612" end="00:31:10.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more word and you&#39;re barred from</p>
<p begin="00:31:07.412" end="00:31:10.112" style="s2">tonight&#39;s ritual.</p>
<p begin="00:31:20.312" end="00:31:26.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire Baboon King, tier one elite, has</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.412" end="00:31:26.612" style="s2">mastered a powerful skill.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.912" end="00:31:29.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This move would hurt me too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:28.712" end="00:31:31.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I still need a weapon that can take on a</p>
<p begin="00:31:29.912" end="00:31:33.712" style="s2">whole pack of baboons. If I get trapped</p>
<p begin="00:31:31.912" end="00:31:35.112" style="s2">in the flames, I&#39;m in trouble.</p>
<p begin="00:31:33.712" end="00:31:36.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Offering healing food, blue quality</p>
<p begin="00:31:35.112" end="00:31:38.612" style="s2">tools that can hurt night demons, and</p>
<p begin="00:31:36.712" end="00:31:40.512" style="s2">thermal ore. Looking for AoE weapons</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.612" end="00:31:42.912" style="s2">that deal non-fire damage or materials</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.512" end="00:31:44.912" style="s2">that deal cold damage.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.912" end="00:31:46.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s only day three, and someone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.912" end="00:31:48.512" style="s2">already trading stuff like that. Need</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.912" end="00:31:50.312" style="s2">heating gear or healing potions. My</p>
<p begin="00:31:48.512" end="00:31:51.912" style="s2">wife&#39;s freezing to death. Even regular</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.312" end="00:31:53.612" style="s2">food would help.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.912" end="00:31:55.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got any materials that deal cold damage?</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.612" end="00:31:56.312" style="s2">I can offer healing food, blue quality</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.012" end="00:31:57.712" style="s2">tools that hurt night demons, and</p>
<p begin="00:31:56.312" end="00:31:59.612" style="s2">thermal ore in exchange.</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.712" end="00:32:01.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have any rare materials. You</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.612" end="00:32:02.212" style="s2">probably wouldn&#39;t want what I&#39;ve got.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.312" end="00:32:04.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got any snow?</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.212" end="00:32:07.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the snow here freezes solid.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.912" end="00:32:08.612" style="s2">Pretty much everything&#39;s frozen.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.012" end="00:32:09.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything nearby you can break off and</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.612" end="00:32:13.612" style="s2">put in your inventory.</p>
<p begin="00:32:09.712" end="00:32:13.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything will do. Let me take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.412" end="00:32:26.812" style="s2">I need two more teeth for the knife. Can</p>
<p begin="00:32:25.412" end="00:32:27.812" style="s2">you each give me two?</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.812" end="00:32:31.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh-huh.</p>
<p begin="00:32:27.812" end="00:32:31.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One each, I mean. That&#39;s all I need.</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.912" end="00:32:37.712" style="s2">Once you become elders, I&#39;ll have the</p>
<p begin="00:32:36.612" end="00:32:38.913" style="s2">goddess bless you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:37.712" end="00:32:39.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, it&#39;s a small price</p>
<p begin="00:32:38.913" end="00:32:41.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; to pay.</p>
<p begin="00:32:39.413" end="00:32:42.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. Lord Wang&#39;s business comes</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.513" end="00:32:43.913" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.113" end="00:32:45.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sharp chunk of ice fell and hurt my</p>
<p begin="00:32:43.913" end="00:32:46.713" style="s2">wife. There seems to be a blind ground</p>
<p begin="00:32:45.413" end="00:32:48.313" style="s2">beetle nest in the cave. I found them in</p>
<p begin="00:32:46.713" end="00:32:52.013" style="s2">a crack in the rocks. There are loads of</p>
<p begin="00:32:48.313" end="00:32:52.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take them. As many as you&#39;ve got.</p>
<p begin="00:32:57.213" end="00:33:00.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All the ice pellets in the cave, boss.</p>
<p begin="00:32:58.813" end="00:33:01.113" style="s2">If you want more, you may have to wait a</p>
<p begin="00:33:00.713" end="00:33:03.313" style="s2">day.</p>
<p begin="00:33:01.113" end="00:33:04.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No need. This is plenty. By the way, how</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.313" end="00:33:06.513" style="s2">did you survive the first two nights?</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.913" end="00:33:08.413" style="s2">Oh, those night demons everyone talks</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.513" end="00:33:10.513" style="s2">about? We haven&#39;t seen any. There are a</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.413" end="00:33:12.213" style="s2">few new ice statues outside though.</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.513" end="00:33:13.713" style="s2">Maybe that&#39;s them. That doesn&#39;t matter.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.213" end="00:33:15.513" style="s2">Keep some sulfur right to start a fire</p>
<p begin="00:33:13.713" end="00:33:18.913" style="s2">and trade for some fuel. Stay out of the</p>
<p begin="00:33:15.513" end="00:33:18.913" style="s2">blizzards and you should make it.</p>
<p begin="00:33:26.313" end="00:33:30.113" style="s2">This should work as a repair, right?</p>
<p begin="00:33:30.313" end="00:33:34.613" style="s2">Repair successful. Materials altered.</p>
<p begin="00:33:32.713" end="00:33:37.013" style="s2">Ghost face dagger is now beacon fire</p>
<p begin="00:33:34.613" end="00:33:37.013" style="s2">dagger.</p>
<p begin="00:34:01.813" end="00:34:07.413" style="s2">Crafting success rate 30% plus 20%</p>
<p begin="00:34:05.113" end="00:34:09.413" style="s2">crafting failed. Insufficient energy.</p>
<p begin="00:34:07.413" end="00:34:11.613" style="s2">Replace the power source.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.413" end="00:34:15.113" style="s2">Even the fire stone isn&#39;t enough?</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.613" end="00:34:15.113" style="s2">Do I really have to use that?</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.513" end="00:34:24.813" style="s2">Crafting success rate 75% plus 20%</p>
<p begin="00:34:22.713" end="00:34:27.113" style="s2">crafting successful. Compact frost storm</p>
<p begin="00:34:24.813" end="00:34:29.213" style="s2">launcher projectile mode fires a volley</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.113" end="00:34:29.813" style="s2">of ice spikes with a range of about 30</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.213" end="00:34:31.313" style="s2">m.</p>
<p begin="00:34:29.813" end="00:34:33.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Both modes inflict frostbite and</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.313" end="00:34:34.713" style="s2">erosion. Prolonged use may crack the</p>
<p begin="00:34:33.013" end="00:34:37.013" style="s2">casing or cause an explosion.</p>
<p begin="00:34:34.713" end="00:34:39.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If storm mode makes unusual noises, stop</p>
<p begin="00:34:37.013" end="00:34:41.814" style="s2">use and cool for at least 6 hours. Ice</p>
<p begin="00:34:39.214" end="00:34:45.014" style="s2">Ice mode recharges separately. Unusable</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.814" end="00:34:45.014" style="s2">until fully recharged.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.914" end="00:34:54.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll save some for Lanla tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:34:52.614" end="00:34:57.014" style="s2">I&#39;ll get her out first if I get the</p>
<p begin="00:34:54.514" end="00:34:57.014" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="00:34:59.314" end="00:35:05.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An elite night demon plus a downpour</p>
<p begin="00:35:02.214" end="00:35:05.314" style="s2">quite a night ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:35:07.314" end="00:35:10.714" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.114" end="00:35:13.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Big Rat, I&#39;ve only got two legs.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.714" end="00:35:15.729" style="s2">This is as fast as I can go.</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.709" end="00:35:15.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:35:20.514" end="00:35:27.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An odd-eyed demon.</p>
<p begin="00:35:24.514" end="00:35:30.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Big Rat, FIGHT ALL YOU WANT, BUT PUT ME</p>
<p begin="00:35:27.414" end="00:35:30.314" style="s2">DOWN FIRST.</p>
<p begin="00:35:37.289" end="00:35:39.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:35:41.514" end="00:35:45.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CARRY ON. THAT GIVES ME AN OPENING to</p>
<p begin="00:35:43.214" end="00:35:45.814" style="s2">rescue her.</p>
<p begin="00:35:50.714" end="00:35:55.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was just trying to wake you up.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.514" end="00:35:56.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why so jumpy? Never mind. Thanks. What&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:35:55.414" end="00:35:57.714" style="s2">going on?</p>
<p begin="00:35:56.114" end="00:35:59.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The odd-eyed demon boss brought his</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.714" end="00:36:01.814" style="s2">minions to attack. They&#39;re fighting that</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.514" end="00:36:03.714" style="s2">red-haired baboon.</p>
<p begin="00:36:01.814" end="00:36:05.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m a pearl folk. Eating pearls</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.714" end="00:36:07.014" style="s2">naturally heals me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.114" end="00:36:07.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you let yourself get so</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.014" end="00:36:09.914" style="s2">weak?</p>
<p begin="00:36:07.814" end="00:36:14.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Was I supposed to make myself a</p>
<p begin="00:36:09.914" end="00:36:14.114" style="s2">sacrifice? I don&#39;t eat meat.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.014" end="00:36:21.514" style="s2">Come on. Let&#39;s get out of here.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.814" end="00:36:23.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leave.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.514" end="00:36:25.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the perfect chance to let them</p>
<p begin="00:36:23.114" end="00:36:28.414" style="s2">fight and reap the rewards.</p>
<p begin="00:36:25.114" end="00:36:28.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m in no hurry to leave.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.614" end="00:36:33.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That trick again.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.514" end="00:36:42.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sanity decreased by 10 points.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.914" end="00:36:44.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.814" end="00:36:45.916" style="s2">If you two kill each other, what&#39;s left</p>
<p begin="00:36:44.516" end="00:36:47.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for me to cash in on?</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.916" end="00:36:48.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out of here. YOU&#39;LL GET CAUGHT IN</p>
<p begin="00:36:47.416" end="00:36:49.316" style="s2">THE CROSSFIRE.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.516" end="00:36:52.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HERE I COME.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.316" end="00:36:52.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OUT OF the way.</p>
<p begin="00:36:53.716" end="00:36:56.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too close. Don&#39;t get sucked in</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.816" end="00:36:59.616" style="s2">too.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.416" end="00:36:59.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. Get back for now.</p>
<p begin="00:37:08.716" end="00:37:12.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:37:10.216" end="00:37:13.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re doomed. The rain must have angered</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.116" end="00:37:15.516" style="s2">our lord.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.016" end="00:37:17.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But it wasn&#39;t supposed to rain tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.516" end="00:37:18.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do? Will we get sucked in</p>
<p begin="00:37:17.416" end="00:37:20.916" style="s2">too?</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.016" end="00:37:24.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS IS OUR LORD&#39;S WILL.</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.916" end="00:37:24.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The high priest is here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:25.016" end="00:37:28.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It must be that one.</p>
<p begin="00:37:27.016" end="00:37:31.416" style="s2">But how?</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.116" end="00:37:33.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is revenge. They don&#39;t want our</p>
<p begin="00:37:31.416" end="00:37:35.116" style="s2">lord to awaken.</p>
<p begin="00:37:33.016" end="00:37:36.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Change of plans. Our lord dwells</p>
<p begin="00:37:35.116" end="00:37:39.216" style="s2">throughout the depths of this island.</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.716" end="00:37:40.616" style="s2">Begin the ritual now. We have plenty of</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.216" end="00:37:41.716" style="s2">spare offerings here.</p>
<p begin="00:37:40.616" end="00:37:45.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.716" end="00:37:47.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look. Lord Wang saved the sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:37:45.516" end="00:37:50.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s trying to escape.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.516" end="00:37:51.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The flow fire stone cage is gone. Could</p>
<p begin="00:37:50.216" end="00:37:53.216" style="s2">Da Hong have already?</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.516" end="00:37:54.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll catch him. You keep watch over the</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.216" end="00:37:56.216" style="s2">battlefield.</p>
<p begin="00:37:54.016" end="00:37:58.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let that envoy leave in one piece.</p>
<p begin="00:37:56.216" end="00:38:00.516" style="s2">Set up the sacrificial circle as soon as</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.216" end="00:38:02.816" style="s2">the tornado dies down.</p>
<p begin="00:38:00.516" end="00:38:04.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Understood. Obtained two tier one</p>
<p begin="00:38:02.816" end="00:38:06.716" style="s2">strength enhancement potions and two</p>
<p begin="00:38:04.916" end="00:38:09.216" style="s2">tier one constitution enhancement</p>
<p begin="00:38:06.716" end="00:38:09.216" style="s2">potions.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.916" end="00:38:14.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kill kill notification. Hold on a little</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.016" end="00:38:14.316" style="s2">longer.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.516" end="00:38:19.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have slain an elite night demon.</p>
<p begin="00:38:16.716" end="00:38:19.616" style="s2">Fire Baboon King.</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.816" end="00:38:30.916" style="s2">Rare title unlocked. Elite&#39;s Bane.</p>
<p begin="00:38:27.816" end="00:38:30.916" style="s2">Rewards issued.</p>
<p begin="00:38:43.616" end="00:38:46.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lord Wang, you can&#39;t leave. Don&#39;t we</p>
<p begin="00:38:45.816" end="00:38:47.117" style="s2">still have a ritual to</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.517" end="00:38:48.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; perform?</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.117" end="00:38:50.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s hurry, or we&#39;ll be too late.</p>
<p begin="00:38:48.817" end="00:38:51.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re holding it here now. The high</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.217" end="00:38:52.317" style="s2">priest is retrieving the escaped</p>
<p begin="00:38:51.617" end="00:38:53.117" style="s2">sacrifice.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.317" end="00:38:55.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please wait here.</p>
<p begin="00:38:53.117" end="00:38:56.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why trouble the high priest with that?</p>
<p begin="00:38:55.717" end="00:38:58.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you shouldn&#39;t have.</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.517" end="00:39:00.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go take a look.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.517" end="00:39:01.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do we do? Should we really be</p>
<p begin="00:39:00.217" end="00:39:02.717" style="s2">stopping Lord Wang?</p>
<p begin="00:39:01.317" end="00:39:05.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t beat him in a fight.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.717" end="00:39:06.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it down. At least look the part, or</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.117" end="00:39:09.117" style="s2">the high priest won&#39;t spare us.</p>
<p begin="00:39:06.917" end="00:39:11.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Demon Eye, purple gear, grants</p>
<p begin="00:39:09.117" end="00:39:12.917" style="s2">long-range vision and detects life in</p>
<p begin="00:39:11.117" end="00:39:15.517" style="s2">all directions for 1 minute.</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.917" end="00:39:19.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Petrifying Gaze costs 50 energy,</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.517" end="00:39:19.117" style="s2">cooldown 24 hours.</p>
<p begin="00:39:25.417" end="00:39:30.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hello, pearl folk.</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.417" end="00:39:32.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t expect a friendly greeting back.</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.417" end="00:39:33.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why struggle? Becoming part of our lord</p>
<p begin="00:39:32.817" end="00:39:35.517" style="s2">is an honor.</p>
<p begin="00:39:33.817" end="00:39:36.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing can stop tonight&#39;s ritual.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.517" end="00:39:38.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.417" end="00:39:39.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What brought on tonight&#39;s rain? Didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.217" end="00:39:42.262" style="s2">that seem suspicious?</p>
<p begin="00:39:39.517" end="00:39:43.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; High priest, how can you be sure he</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.262" end="00:39:44.117" style="s2">[clears throat and snorts] or they won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.317" end="00:39:46.517" style="s2">interfere again?</p>
<p begin="00:39:44.117" end="00:39:48.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The god of water, the god of the east,</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.517" end="00:39:50.717" style="s2">and the god of the north.</p>
<p begin="00:39:48.017" end="00:39:53.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That envoy Wang isn&#39;t an envoy of the</p>
<p begin="00:39:50.717" end="00:39:58.217" style="s2">lord of the abyss at all. He serves the</p>
<p begin="00:39:53.617" end="00:40:00.017" style="s2">gods of water, the east, and the north.</p>
<p begin="00:39:58.217" end="00:40:02.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like luck&#39;s on my side.</p>
<p begin="00:40:00.017" end="00:40:06.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Luck&#39;s on your side. I&#39;ll give you one</p>
<p begin="00:40:02.817" end="00:40:09.817" style="s2">last chance. Come with me to our lord.</p>
<p begin="00:40:06.517" end="00:40:12.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go to hell, you and your lord both.</p>
<p begin="00:40:09.817" end="00:40:14.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you want to do this the hard way?</p>
<p begin="00:40:12.717" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enemy of elites, more likely to draw</p>
<p begin="00:40:14.917" end="00:40:18.317" style="s2">aggro from elite creatures.</p>
<p begin="00:40:21.417" end="00:40:26.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, Lord Wang, don&#39;t make this hard</p>
<p begin="00:40:23.417" end="00:40:27.017" style="s2">for us. You really can&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="00:40:26.017" end="00:40:28.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right, Lord Wang.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.017" end="00:40:30.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The elders said even urgent matters must</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.817" end="00:40:32.017" style="s2">wait until after the ritual.</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.217" end="00:40:33.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going anywhere. Just looking</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.017" end="00:40:35.217" style="s2">around. Where&#39;s your high priest anyway?</p>
<p begin="00:40:33.817" end="00:40:36.217" style="s2">Everything&#39;s nearly ready, right?</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.217" end="00:40:37.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why isn&#39;t he here yet?</p>
<p begin="00:40:36.217" end="00:40:38.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t seen him, but he&#39;ll be back</p>
<p begin="00:40:37.617" end="00:40:39.617" style="s2">soon.</p>
<p begin="00:40:38.117" end="00:40:40.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The elders said it starts in half an</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.617" end="00:40:41.817" style="s2">hour.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.117" end="00:40:42.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you not to tell Lord Wang until</p>
<p begin="00:40:41.817" end="00:40:44.817" style="s2">it starts.</p>
<p begin="00:40:42.717" end="00:40:46.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My lord, we weren&#39;t trying to hide it.</p>
<p begin="00:40:44.817" end="00:40:48.217" style="s2">The elders gave us orders.</p>
<p begin="00:40:46.117" end="00:40:49.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the big deal? So what if I know?</p>
<p begin="00:40:48.217" end="00:40:51.818" style="s2">What, am I going to sabotage it? I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.818" end="00:40:54.618" style="s2">just another God&#39;s envoy. You think I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:40:51.818" end="00:40:56.418" style="s2">that powerful? Anyway, get back to work.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.618" end="00:40:58.918" style="s2">I&#39;ll just look around.</p>
<p begin="00:40:56.418" end="00:41:01.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trust you, sir. We&#39;ll be on our way.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.918" end="00:41:01.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on then.</p>
<p begin="00:41:18.818" end="00:41:22.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:41:20.718" end="00:41:26.118" style="s2">Envoy Wang,</p>
<p begin="00:41:22.418" end="00:41:26.118" style="s2">you have a death wish.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.618" end="00:41:32.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mole folk high priest, partially fused,</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.318" end="00:41:32.618" style="s2">tier one elite plus.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.318" end="00:41:39.918" style="s2">Before the ritual begins, I&#39;ll find a</p>
<p begin="00:41:38.418" end="00:41:42.818" style="s2">way to kill you.</p>
<p begin="00:41:39.918" end="00:41:45.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A harpoon can&#39;t kill me. You pose as an</p>
<p begin="00:41:42.818" end="00:41:48.518" style="s2">envoy of the abyss. You may have fooled</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.418" end="00:41:50.518" style="s2">those idiots, but you&#39;ll never fool me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:48.518" end="00:41:53.218" style="s2">You&#39;ve already used that storm. The</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.518" end="00:41:54.518" style="s2">ritual only requires my presence.</p>
<p begin="00:41:53.218" end="00:41:55.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you don&#39;t need to lead the ritual at</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.518" end="00:41:59.218" style="s2">all?</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.418" end="00:42:03.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re a clever one. Take another guess.</p>
<p begin="00:41:59.218" end="00:42:03.618" style="s2">Has the ritual already begun?</p>
<p begin="00:42:05.118" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you say we had half an hour?</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.718" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">You&#39;ve been stalling me all along.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.818" end="00:42:21.918" style="s2">Mama,</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.218" end="00:42:21.918" style="s2">it&#39;s that eye from my dreams again.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.418" end="00:42:35.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Return to the searing heat. Become one</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.218" end="00:42:37.718" style="s2">with it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:35.118" end="00:42:40.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was close. My spirit stats saved me</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.718" end="00:42:40.118" style="s2">again.</p>
<p begin="00:42:44.618" end="00:42:49.118" style="s2">I don&#39;t deal with Gods who demand</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.218" end="00:42:49.118" style="s2">sacrifices.</p>
<p begin="00:42:55.520" end="00:42:58.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Normal weapons won&#39;t stop it.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.420" end="00:43:01.120" style="s2">I&#39;ll have to risk using what&#39;s in the</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.720" end="00:43:04.320" style="s2">box. Even I&#39;m scared to open this. Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.120" end="00:43:04.320" style="s2">see if you can handle it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:05.020" end="00:43:08.720" style="s2">Hey, down there. Check this out.</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.320" end="00:43:20.320" style="s2">Eric&#39;s hand.</p>
<p begin="00:43:16.720" end="00:43:22.120" style="s2">An entity trapped in eternal stasis. No.</p>
<p begin="00:43:20.320" end="00:43:23.320" style="s2">He&#39;s backing away. Whatever&#39;s in that</p>
<p begin="00:43:22.120" end="00:43:26.420" style="s2">box,</p>
<p begin="00:43:23.320" end="00:43:26.420" style="s2">even he&#39;s afraid of it.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.120" end="00:43:49.520" style="s2">I can&#39;t leave you here.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.520" end="00:43:51.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, NO. OUR LORD, PLEASE DON&#39;T LEAVE US.</p>
<p begin="00:43:49.520" end="00:43:53.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT HAVE you done?</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.820" end="00:43:55.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT HAVE YOU DONE? YOU THINK YOU&#39;VE</p>
<p begin="00:43:53.820" end="00:43:57.320" style="s2">WON? YOU&#39;RE NOTHING BUT THEIR</p>
<p begin="00:43:55.620" end="00:43:59.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Insane entity detected. Your spirit</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.320" end="00:43:59.920" style="s2">staff is too low. Corrupting imagery not</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.320" end="00:44:02.820" style="s2">perceived.</p>
<p begin="00:43:59.920" end="00:44:05.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blocked now? Of all times?</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.820" end="00:44:08.520" style="s2">Where can I hide if he catches up?</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.820" end="00:44:10.320" style="s2">Bats, human hair, sulfur. I need more</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.520" end="00:44:12.620" style="s2">potion ingredients. Head for the volcano</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.320" end="00:44:12.620" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.120" end="00:44:36.720" style="s2">A few more shots. Use the mist to get</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.120" end="00:44:36.720" style="s2">away. Don&#39;t get bogged down.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.720" end="00:44:49.620" style="s2">Wait until he&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:45:12.521" end="00:45:17.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still chasing me. You are hellbent on</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.621" end="00:45:17.421" style="s2">poisoning me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:24.621" end="00:45:28.521" style="s2">There&#39;s no name here. I&#39;ll use the Star</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.921" end="00:45:32.921" style="s2">River God&#39;s heat to melt through the</p>
<p begin="00:45:28.521" end="00:45:32.921" style="s2">wall. Then I can escape underground.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.321" end="00:45:38.721" style="s2">I need him to burn me again. Hey, Star</p>
<p begin="00:45:36.021" end="00:45:40.821" style="s2">River God, burn me again if you&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.721" end="00:45:44.321" style="s2">the guts. The one who scared you off</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.821" end="00:45:44.321" style="s2">earlier is right here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.821" end="00:45:51.421" style="s2">13 stamina left. Find the way out first.</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.621" end="00:45:55.021" style="s2">Once my stamina runs out, my companions</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.421" end="00:45:55.021" style="s2">can take over. Can&#39;t stop here.</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.121" end="00:46:00.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stamina depleted. Now consuming HP.</p>
<p begin="00:46:01.621" end="00:46:06.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got to heal up first. Three hours left.</p>
<p begin="00:46:04.621" end="00:46:09.221" style="s2">No more delays.</p>
<p begin="00:46:06.321" end="00:46:09.221" style="s2">I&#39;ve got to get back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.221" end="00:46:19.521" style="s2">After all that, I&#39;ve got just over an</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.321" end="00:46:21.921" style="s2">hour left. Just across the bridge and</p>
<p begin="00:46:19.521" end="00:46:21.921" style="s2">I&#39;m home.</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.821" end="00:46:30.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dissolution trait detected. Immune to</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.321" end="00:46:31.721" style="s2">dissolution damage.</p>
<p begin="00:46:30.021" end="00:46:33.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry, pal. I&#39;ve got the terrain</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.721" end="00:46:34.521" style="s2">advantage. I&#39;m heading to the Great</p>
<p begin="00:46:33.421" end="00:46:36.821" style="s2">Eastern Sea.</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.521" end="00:46:38.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You came right to me, G. DON&#39;T BLAME ME</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.821" end="00:46:41.321" style="s2">FOR THIS. Stay away from cults in your</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.721" end="00:46:41.321" style="s2">next life.</p>
<p begin="00:46:46.121" end="00:46:50.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have slain Pan Ronghe, the Mofo High</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.321" end="00:46:51.221" style="s2">Priest. Equipment obtained. Tentacled</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.721" end="00:46:53.621" style="s2">Body.</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.221" end="00:46:56.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only recovered five points. Only 16</p>
<p begin="00:46:53.621" end="00:46:56.221" style="s2">minutes left.</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.921" end="00:47:05.122" style="s2">I I even my arms. Got to get up.</p>
<p begin="00:47:01.323" end="00:47:05.122" style="s2">I can&#39;t just lie here and die.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.523" end="00:47:09.023" style="s2">There&#39;s still time. Can&#39;t waste any more</p>
<p begin="00:47:07.523" end="00:47:13.523" style="s2">resources.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.023" end="00:47:13.523" style="s2">Come on, you useless hands, crawl.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.723" end="00:47:26.023" style="s2">Only 100 for that whole trip.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.323" end="00:47:28.823" style="s2">3-day beginner challenge complete.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.023" end="00:47:30.622" style="s2">Reward 2,000 island coins. Scheduled</p>
<p begin="00:47:28.823" end="00:47:33.023" style="s2">aberration attacks have ended. Death</p>
<p begin="00:47:30.622" end="00:47:35.523" style="s2">fungus is currently spreading at 60 m</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.023" end="00:47:35.523" style="s2">per hour.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.487" end="00:47:40.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:47:38.023" end="00:47:42.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Leaderboards unlocked.</p>
<p begin="00:47:40.922" end="00:47:46.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see where all that work over the</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.622" end="00:47:46.922" style="s2">past 3 days has put me in the rankings.</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.122" end="00:48:01.323" style="s2">Rewards aren&#39;t handed out until day 15.</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.622" end="00:48:03.523" style="s2">Someone could still catch up.</p>
<p begin="00:48:01.323" end="00:48:05.823" style="s2">First place gets a red tier reward. I</p>
<p begin="00:48:03.523" end="00:48:07.422" style="s2">better top another leaderboard.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.823" end="00:48:09.422" style="s2">These potions won&#39;t do any good sitting</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.422" end="00:48:11.323" style="s2">around. Time to get stronger. Two</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.422" end="00:48:15.823" style="s2">strength potions, two constitution</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.323" end="00:48:15.823" style="s2">potions, and one all stats potion.</p>
<p begin="00:48:20.622" end="00:48:24.223" style="s2">Hmm.</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.723" end="00:48:26.922" style="s2">If I run into another fire rhino baboon</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.223" end="00:48:28.723" style="s2">now, I could kill it with one punch.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.922" end="00:48:30.422" style="s2">First place again.</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.723" end="00:48:33.122" style="s2">Have these people never seen anything</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.422" end="00:48:33.122" style="s2">impressive?</p>
<p begin="00:48:35.422" end="00:48:39.523" style="s2">My inventory is full again. My temporary</p>
<p begin="00:48:37.523" end="00:48:41.523" style="s2">inventory is expiring soon. I&#39;ve got to</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.523" end="00:48:43.523" style="s2">move everything out. I also need a totem</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.523" end="00:48:45.523" style="s2">pole to upgrade my island to level two,</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.523" end="00:48:46.823" style="s2">but with so little stamina, I can&#39;t keep</p>
<p begin="00:48:45.523" end="00:48:48.523" style="s2">floating around. I need to make</p>
<p begin="00:48:46.823" end="00:48:52.323" style="s2">something I can lie down in. I&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.523" end="00:48:52.323" style="s2">just enough materials for a kayak frame.</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.823" end="00:49:04.024" style="s2">Add a thruster at the back. That&#39;ll save</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.724" end="00:49:06.324" style="s2">me paddling. Seal the seams so it won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:49:04.024" end="00:49:06.324" style="s2">leak.</p>
<p begin="00:49:17.324" end="00:49:20.524" style="s2">A gift from the sister.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.224" end="00:49:27.324" style="s2">Everything in storage is on this boat</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.224" end="00:49:31.024" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="00:49:27.324" end="00:49:31.024" style="s2">I&#39;d better protect it in a fight.</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.724" end="00:49:41.424" style="s2">Using elite monster bones makes better</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.624" end="00:49:41.424" style="s2">quality gear.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.024" end="00:49:57.124" style="s2">Well rested and my stamina&#39;s back. Time</p>
<p begin="00:49:54.424" end="00:49:58.624" style="s2">to search deeper.</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.124" end="00:50:00.124" style="s2">My body should be able to handle the</p>
<p begin="00:49:58.624" end="00:50:01.924" style="s2">water pressure now.</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.124" end="00:50:05.724" style="s2">Better store the boat first. Can&#39;t find</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.924" end="00:50:05.724" style="s2">the totem pole only to lose my boat.</p>
<p begin="00:50:13.124" end="00:50:18.724" style="s2">That&#39;s one huge shell. How much meat</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.724" end="00:50:18.724" style="s2">must be inside?</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.524" end="00:50:31.724" style="s2">The remains of Lan Lan&#39;s original body</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.824" end="00:50:35.324" style="s2">are still in storage.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.724" end="00:50:37.624" style="s2">Why is there another Lan Lan here?</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.324" end="00:50:39.324" style="s2">Same face, same hair, but she&#39;s not</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.624" end="00:50:41.024" style="s2">responding at all.</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.324" end="00:50:43.924" style="s2">What if a fish eats you while you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.024" end="00:50:45.024" style="s2">here? My inventory only holds non-living</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.924" end="00:50:47.624" style="s2">things.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.024" end="00:50:47.624" style="s2">Let&#39;s try it.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.824" end="00:50:51.024" style="s2">Are you dead or alive?</p>
<p begin="00:50:55.924" end="00:51:00.224" style="s2">You never warned me this totem drains</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.724" end="00:51:00.224" style="s2">sanity.</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.824" end="00:51:07.425" style="s2">Totem activated for first time. Awarded</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.525" end="00:51:10.725" style="s2">500 island coins.</p>
<p begin="00:51:07.425" end="00:51:10.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Totem functions unlocked.</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.325" end="00:51:18.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still 10 cores short.</p>
<p begin="00:51:15.225" end="00:51:18.625" style="s2">I need prey with enough erosion.</p>
<p begin="00:51:34.825" end="00:51:40.825" style="s2">They&#39;re all at 15%</p>
<p begin="00:51:36.925" end="00:51:40.825" style="s2">No wonder they only drop three cores.</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.525" end="00:51:45.225" style="s2">I&#39;ll take down these two. That should be</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.025" end="00:51:45.225" style="s2">enough.</p>
<p begin="00:51:46.725" end="00:51:51.725" style="s2">That&#39;s enough. I can use the two extra</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.725" end="00:51:51.725" style="s2">cores to recharge.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.525" end="00:52:04.025" style="s2">Your island is about to reach level two.</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.125" end="00:52:04.025" style="s2">Prepare yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.525" end="00:52:11.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is this an upgrade or the creation of</p>
<p begin="00:52:09.925" end="00:52:13.725" style="s2">the universe?</p>
<p begin="00:52:11.025" end="00:52:16.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Erosion, 3%.</p>
<p begin="00:52:13.725" end="00:52:19.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was just at 2%. The upgrade made this</p>
<p begin="00:52:16.325" end="00:52:21.125" style="s2">damn abyssal sea&#39;s erosion stronger too.</p>
<p begin="00:52:19.025" end="00:52:23.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations. Your island has reached</p>
<p begin="00:52:21.125" end="00:52:25.825" style="s2">level two. Received two enhancement</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.125" end="00:52:28.825" style="s2">stones. Purple quality item. Pendant of</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.825" end="00:52:29.625" style="s2">Frenzied Dance. Inventory expanded to 20</p>
<p begin="00:52:28.825" end="00:52:30.725" style="s2">slots.</p>
<p begin="00:52:29.625" end="00:52:32.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s bigger,</p>
<p begin="00:52:30.725" end="00:52:34.825" style="s2">but it&#39;s still all water.</p>
<p begin="00:52:32.925" end="00:52:37.025" style="s2">First, I&#39;ll retrieve the supplies I</p>
<p begin="00:52:34.825" end="00:52:40.425" style="s2">stashed in the trading tab.</p>
<p begin="00:52:37.025" end="00:52:42.425" style="s2">I&#39;ve got just enough free slots now.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.425" end="00:52:44.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Island evaluations unlocked. Pay the</p>
<p begin="00:52:42.425" end="00:52:46.225" style="s2">required island coins to invite an</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.325" end="00:52:48.425" style="s2">evaluator to your island. Meet the</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.225" end="00:52:49.625" style="s2">evaluation criteria to earn rewards</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.425" end="00:52:52.125" style="s2">based on your score.</p>
<p begin="00:52:49.625" end="00:52:53.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I use this blade the most. One stone</p>
<p begin="00:52:52.125" end="00:52:57.525" style="s2">will upgrade it to purple. I&#39;ll upgrade</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.825" end="00:52:57.525" style="s2">it first and save the other stone.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.625" end="00:53:07.327" style="s2">It It lifesteal too.</p>
<p begin="00:53:05.825" end="00:53:09.427" style="s2">That&#39;ll help me last longer and close</p>
<p begin="00:53:07.327" end="00:53:11.827" style="s2">combat. Rub to generate heat and</p>
<p begin="00:53:09.427" end="00:53:14.127" style="s2">activate. Frenzy dance reduces nearby</p>
<p begin="00:53:11.827" end="00:53:15.827" style="s2">creature&#39;s sanity by 20. Dance of sorrow</p>
<p begin="00:53:14.127" end="00:53:17.527" style="s2">immobilizes nearby creatures. Less</p>
<p begin="00:53:15.827" end="00:53:20.127" style="s2">effective against higher tier creatures.</p>
<p begin="00:53:17.527" end="00:53:21.927" style="s2">What am I? Some all powerful wizard?</p>
<p begin="00:53:20.127" end="00:53:24.427" style="s2">Another ability that sounds impressive</p>
<p begin="00:53:21.927" end="00:53:26.427" style="s2">costs 20 energy to summon tentacles. No</p>
<p begin="00:53:24.427" end="00:53:28.327" style="s2">upkeep cost. Normal tentacles won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.427" end="00:53:30.527" style="s2">dissolve objects while they remain</p>
<p begin="00:53:28.327" end="00:53:32.427" style="s2">healing. Items and skills will stay in</p>
<p begin="00:53:30.527" end="00:53:34.527" style="s2">effect. Maybe they can help me craft</p>
<p begin="00:53:32.427" end="00:53:38.427" style="s2">things. An extra pair of hands. Current</p>
<p begin="00:53:34.527" end="00:53:41.227" style="s2">balance 33,100 island coins. Inviting a</p>
<p begin="00:53:38.427" end="00:53:43.627" style="s2">level four evaluator costs 30,000 island</p>
<p begin="00:53:41.227" end="00:53:43.627" style="s2">coins.</p>
<p begin="00:53:45.227" end="00:53:51.227" style="s2">No risk, no better rewards. Fortune</p>
<p begin="00:53:48.227" end="00:53:51.227" style="s2">favors the bold.</p>
<p begin="00:53:51.627" end="00:53:55.927" style="s2">I&#39;ve paid up. I&#39;ve got three days to</p>
<p begin="00:53:53.927" end="00:53:58.327" style="s2">prepare everything I can.</p>
<p begin="00:53:55.927" end="00:54:00.827" style="s2">Brown dice, lightning. I&#39;ll keep those</p>
<p begin="00:53:58.327" end="00:54:00.827" style="s2">in mind.</p>
<p begin="00:54:01.727" end="00:54:07.127" style="s2">So these two count as rare materials. I</p>
<p begin="00:54:04.027" end="00:54:07.127" style="s2">can trade for the rest.</p>
<p begin="00:54:19.727" end="00:54:24.527" style="s2">I can still move it. I can&#39;t let the</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.727" end="00:54:26.427" style="s2">curse spread any higher.</p>
<p begin="00:54:24.527" end="00:54:29.027" style="s2">Looking to trade for women&#39;s clothes for</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.427" end="00:54:31.027" style="s2">someone about 170 cm or taller.</p>
<p begin="00:54:29.027" end="00:54:32.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DM me if you have any. I&#39;ve got sprites</p>
<p begin="00:54:31.027" end="00:54:34.127" style="s2">on my island who make clothes. Can you</p>
<p begin="00:54:32.727" end="00:54:36.527" style="s2">send me her exact height and</p>
<p begin="00:54:34.127" end="00:54:38.427" style="s2">measurements?</p>
<p begin="00:54:36.527" end="00:54:39.727" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How about a blanket for now? Once she</p>
<p begin="00:54:38.427" end="00:54:40.827" style="s2">wakes up, I&#39;ll have her tell you</p>
<p begin="00:54:39.727" end="00:54:43.127" style="s2">herself.</p>
<p begin="00:54:40.827" end="00:54:43.727" style="s2">Make me an outfit too. Just something</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.127" end="00:54:45.027" style="s2">comfy.</p>
<p begin="00:54:43.727" end="00:54:46.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure thing, Rub. I&#39;ll send the blanket</p>
<p begin="00:54:45.027" end="00:54:49.827" style="s2">first. For the deposit, three pieces of</p>
<p begin="00:54:46.927" end="00:54:49.827" style="s2">thermal ore will do.</p>
<p begin="00:54:55.127" end="00:54:58.827" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She has a pulse.</p>
<p begin="00:54:56.727" end="00:55:01.027" style="s2">Why won&#39;t she wake up?</p>
<p begin="00:54:58.827" end="00:55:02.727" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a problem. Got any info on pro</p>
<p begin="00:55:01.027" end="00:55:04.527" style="s2">folk? Apparently they can come back to</p>
<p begin="00:55:02.727" end="00:55:05.527" style="s2">life. She has a pulse, but she hasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:55:04.527" end="00:55:07.128" style="s2">fully revived.</p>
<p begin="00:55:05.527" end="00:55:10.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve asked the right person. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:55:07.128" end="00:55:10.128" style="s2">reading up on them now.</p>
<p begin="00:55:17.528" end="00:55:21.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More seafood. Thanks, buddy.</p>
<p begin="00:55:19.628" end="00:55:22.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No problem. I&#39;ll share more goodies when</p>
<p begin="00:55:21.628" end="00:55:24.128" style="s2">I get them.</p>
<p begin="00:55:22.228" end="00:55:26.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Found it. The Pearl folk worship the god</p>
<p begin="00:55:24.128" end="00:55:28.228" style="s2">of fertility. With the proper authority,</p>
<p begin="00:55:26.528" end="00:55:29.228" style="s2">you can sacrifice memories to revive</p>
<p begin="00:55:28.228" end="00:55:31.228" style="s2">within your shell.</p>
<p begin="00:55:29.228" end="00:55:33.228" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Full resurrection requires at least one</p>
<p begin="00:55:31.228" end="00:55:34.928" style="s2">item imbued with a god&#39;s power.</p>
<p begin="00:55:33.228" end="00:55:36.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A divine item.</p>
<p begin="00:55:34.928" end="00:55:39.228" style="s2">What blessing did you get today?</p>
<p begin="00:55:36.528" end="00:55:41.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Today&#39;s won&#39;t help. It only affects me.</p>
<p begin="00:55:39.228" end="00:55:43.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m saving this sip of holy water to</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.128" end="00:55:46.028" style="s2">cure curses and erosion.</p>
<p begin="00:55:43.128" end="00:55:46.028" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I get a jar.</p>
<p begin="00:55:47.528" end="00:55:51.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see if that kidnapper god will</p>
<p begin="00:55:48.928" end="00:55:51.628" style="s2">give me anything.</p>
<p begin="00:55:59.028" end="00:56:04.328" style="s2">With this ability earlier,</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.728" end="00:56:04.328" style="s2">I could have made an even better raft.</p>
<p begin="00:56:05.528" end="00:56:09.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Congratulations. You&#39;ve unlocked the</p>
<p begin="00:56:07.128" end="00:56:09.728" style="s2">realm of the god of water, winter, and</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.128" end="00:56:11.328" style="s2">the north.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.728" end="00:56:13.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I made a blaster from material left by</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.328" end="00:56:14.828" style="s2">Ice Fire Island&#39;s extreme cold storm.</p>
<p begin="00:56:13.328" end="00:56:17.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That counts as stealing.</p>
<p begin="00:56:14.828" end="00:56:17.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just borrowed it.</p>
<p begin="00:56:18.128" end="00:56:22.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing, huh?</p>
<p begin="00:56:19.528" end="00:56:23.428" style="s2">Holy water it is then.</p>
<p begin="00:56:22.128" end="00:56:24.828" style="s2">I guess I owe you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:23.428" end="00:56:26.428" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d be dead if you hadn&#39;t wounded the</p>
<p begin="00:56:24.828" end="00:56:27.928" style="s2">high priest so badly.</p>
<p begin="00:56:26.428" end="00:56:28.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just hope saving you doesn&#39;t cost me</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.928" end="00:56:30.028" style="s2">my life.</p>
<p begin="00:56:28.628" end="00:56:31.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you&#39;re a native,</p>
<p begin="00:56:30.028" end="00:56:33.928" style="s2">you must know some way to fight the</p>
<p begin="00:56:31.328" end="00:56:33.928" style="s2">curse, right?</p>
<p begin="00:56:37.928" end="00:56:41.528" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All I did was save you. Nothing else. I</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.528" end="00:56:43.228" style="s2">swear.</p>
<p begin="00:56:41.528" end="00:56:45.128" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll cover you up for now. I am ordering</p>
<p begin="00:56:43.228" end="00:56:47.128" style="s2">you clothes, too. Tell me your size when</p>
<p begin="00:56:45.128" end="00:56:48.328" style="s2">you wake up.</p>
<p begin="00:56:47.128" end="00:56:49.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who is this man?</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.328" end="00:56:50.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How does he know how to bring me back to</p>
<p begin="00:56:49.728" end="00:56:52.028" style="s2">life?</p>
<p begin="00:56:50.328" end="00:56:53.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I seem to have lost some memories again.</p>
<p begin="00:56:52.028" end="00:56:54.728" style="s2">I&#39;d better not let him notice.</p>
<p begin="00:56:53.728" end="00:56:55.728" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I see.</p>
<p begin="00:56:54.728" end="00:56:57.528" style="s2">Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.728" end="00:56:58.928" style="s2">Wrap yourself in this blanket for now.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.528" end="00:57:01.328" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tell me your size. I&#39;ll order you some</p>
<p begin="00:56:58.928" end="00:57:03.128" style="s2">clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:57:01.328" end="00:57:04.628" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hearth Island&#39;s gone. What will you do</p>
<p begin="00:57:03.128" end="00:57:06.328" style="s2">now? How will you get back to Pearl</p>
<p begin="00:57:04.628" end="00:57:08.328" style="s2">Island?</p>
<p begin="00:57:06.328" end="00:57:10.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They say only the god&#39;s chosen know how</p>
<p begin="00:57:08.328" end="00:57:11.629" style="s2">to open routes to specific islands.</p>
<p begin="00:57:10.329" end="00:57:12.529" style="s2">We&#39;re stuck here.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.629" end="00:57:14.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well,</p>
<p begin="00:57:12.529" end="00:57:15.629" style="s2">this is my home. You know this is my</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.629" end="00:57:17.729" style="s2">island, right?</p>
<p begin="00:57:15.629" end="00:57:19.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your island is pretty unusual.</p>
<p begin="00:57:17.729" end="00:57:21.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I forgot you&#39;re vegetarian. I don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.529" end="00:57:23.629" style="s2">any pearls. I&#39;ll get you some oysters.</p>
<p begin="00:57:21.429" end="00:57:25.129" style="s2">Humanoid detected. Pearl folk, allow her</p>
<p begin="00:57:23.629" end="00:57:27.229" style="s2">to join the island.</p>
<p begin="00:57:25.129" end="00:57:28.629" style="s2">Joining will alter her race and cause</p>
<p begin="00:57:27.229" end="00:57:30.329" style="s2">changes to the island.</p>
<p begin="00:57:28.629" end="00:57:34.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can join my island, but it might</p>
<p begin="00:57:30.329" end="00:57:34.329" style="s2">alter your race. Want to think it over?</p>
<p begin="00:57:45.229" end="00:57:49.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s got so many secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:57:49.729" end="00:57:53.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s with that gear of yours?</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.429" end="00:57:59.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I made it myself</p>
<p begin="00:57:56.729" end="00:58:02.129" style="s2">from a dead manatee.</p>
<p begin="00:57:59.229" end="00:58:03.829" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made it? Can all of you do that?</p>
<p begin="00:58:02.129" end="00:58:06.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s my special ability. Other people</p>
<p begin="00:58:03.829" end="00:58:09.529" style="s2">have their own. Maybe if you join,</p>
<p begin="00:58:06.629" end="00:58:09.529" style="s2">you&#39;ll get one of your own.</p>
<p begin="00:58:09.729" end="00:58:12.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll join.</p>
<p begin="00:58:11.329" end="00:58:13.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure?</p>
<p begin="00:58:12.729" end="00:58:16.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No second thoughts.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.929" end="00:58:18.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You talk too much.</p>
<p begin="00:58:16.729" end="00:58:19.329" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can&#39;t both stay crammed in this raft</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.529" end="00:58:21.029" style="s2">forever.</p>
<p begin="00:58:19.329" end="00:58:23.029" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t have any land, but we can</p>
<p begin="00:58:21.029" end="00:58:25.029" style="s2">always build our own.</p>
<p begin="00:58:23.029" end="00:58:26.929" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her join the island.</p>
<p begin="00:58:25.029" end="00:58:28.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pearl folk transformation complete. New</p>
<p begin="00:58:26.929" end="00:58:30.529" style="s2">race confirmed. Abyssal pearl folk.</p>
<p begin="00:58:28.729" end="00:58:32.529" style="s2">Island transformation underway. Race</p>
<p begin="00:58:30.529" end="00:58:34.429" style="s2">perturbed.</p>
<p begin="00:58:32.529" end="00:58:36.429" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Again?</p>
<p begin="00:58:34.429" end="00:58:37.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I nearly suffocated. A little warning</p>
<p begin="00:58:36.429" end="00:58:39.529" style="s2">next time.</p>
<p begin="00:58:37.529" end="00:58:40.729" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Island transformation complete.</p>
<p begin="00:58:39.529" end="00:58:42.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that voice?</p>
<p begin="00:58:40.729" end="00:58:45.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the system. Think of it as a</p>
<p begin="00:58:42.229" end="00:58:45.129" style="s2">robot butler.</p>
<p begin="00:58:45.629" end="00:58:50.529" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New traits. Pearl island&#39;s gift. Free</p>
<p begin="00:58:48.329" end="00:58:53.129" style="s2">breathing. Increased susceptibility to</p>
<p begin="00:58:50.529" end="00:58:55.829" style="s2">erosion. Coexistence with the abyss.</p>
<p begin="00:58:53.129" end="00:58:58.029" style="s2">Colorful world. Spend 50 energy and use</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.829" end="00:58:59.929" style="s2">a high-quality pearl to summon a random</p>
<p begin="00:58:58.029" end="00:59:01.729" style="s2">divine power.</p>
<p begin="00:58:59.929" end="00:59:04.129" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With a whole army of battle pets, I</p>
<p begin="00:59:01.729" end="00:59:06.229" style="s2">could crush anyone.</p>
<p begin="00:59:04.129" end="00:59:08.229" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The god of the abyssal sea vanished</p>
<p begin="00:59:06.229" end="00:59:10.129" style="s2">while fighting the abyssal erosion.</p>
<p begin="00:59:08.229" end="00:59:11.029" style="s2">These waters became off-limits to all</p>
<p begin="00:59:10.129" end="00:59:12.531" style="s2">land dwellers.</p>
<p begin="00:59:11.029" end="00:59:13.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful. If we run into any</p>
<p begin="00:59:12.531" end="00:59:16.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; extremist islanders,</p>
<p begin="00:59:13.931" end="00:59:18.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; they&#39;ll see us as a walking disaster.</p>
<p begin="00:59:16.131" end="00:59:19.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39; is getting dark. We&#39;re out of water</p>
<p begin="00:59:18.031" end="00:59:21.531" style="s2">again. We&#39;ll have to settle for grilled</p>
<p begin="00:59:19.531" end="00:59:23.531" style="s2">food. I&#39;ll dive for some pearls for you</p>
<p begin="00:59:21.531" end="00:59:25.231" style="s2">tomorrow. Once I&#39;ve made the sulfur</p>
<p begin="00:59:23.531" end="00:59:27.731" style="s2">soup, I&#39;ll send you a serving to settle</p>
<p begin="00:59:25.231" end="00:59:27.731" style="s2">the balance.</p>
<p begin="00:59:29.331" end="00:59:32.831" style="s2">Now this is living.</p>
<p begin="00:59:31.131" end="00:59:34.531" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We really are out of water today.</p>
<p begin="00:59:32.831" end="00:59:35.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s eat grilled food and find water</p>
<p begin="00:59:34.531" end="00:59:38.631" style="s2">tomorrow. We can prep the soup</p>
<p begin="00:59:35.931" end="00:59:38.631" style="s2">ingredients though.</p>
<p begin="00:59:49.331" end="00:59:51.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Here&#39;s everything I gathered this</p>
<p begin="00:59:50.331" end="00:59:52.931" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:59:51.331" end="00:59:55.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The shells here are hideous.</p>
<p begin="00:59:52.931" end="00:59:58.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, you don&#39;t get it. It&#39;s local charm.</p>
<p begin="00:59:55.331" end="00:59:58.731" style="s2">Maybe the pearls inside are nice.</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.331" end="01:00:05.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too noisy.</p>
<p begin="01:00:05.831" end="01:00:11.631" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Erosion is already at 8 %.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.031" end="01:00:13.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need a breeding pool to keep out</p>
<p begin="01:00:11.631" end="01:00:16.731" style="s2">seawater and sea corpses. Then I can</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.931" end="01:00:18.331" style="s2">check on them whenever I need to.</p>
<p begin="01:00:16.731" end="01:00:20.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have an idea, but I need more</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.331" end="01:00:23.031" style="s2">materials. First, I&#39;ll gather seabed</p>
<p begin="01:00:20.731" end="01:00:24.931" style="s2">sand and rocks to enclose an area. I</p>
<p begin="01:00:23.031" end="01:00:25.731" style="s2">can&#39;t chase them all over the sea every</p>
<p begin="01:00:24.931" end="01:00:27.431" style="s2">time they hatch.</p>
<p begin="01:00:25.731" end="01:00:28.931" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The recipe calls for this fur. The soup</p>
<p begin="01:00:27.431" end="01:00:30.631" style="s2">restores HP and I can trade it for</p>
<p begin="01:00:28.931" end="01:00:34.431" style="s2">materials. Here, give me a hand.</p>
<p begin="01:00:30.631" end="01:00:34.431" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You handle the fur. I&#39;ll grind the ore.</p>
<p begin="01:00:40.031" end="01:00:43.731" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All that rain on Volcano Island and I</p>
<p begin="01:00:42.331" end="01:00:45.031" style="s2">didn&#39;t collect a drop.</p>
<p begin="01:00:43.731" end="01:00:47.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The clothes are ready. I&#39;ll send them</p>
<p begin="01:00:45.031" end="01:00:47.331" style="s2">over.</p>
<p begin="01:00:47.531" end="01:00:51.131" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;d like two spare outfits and two</p>
<p begin="01:00:49.331" end="01:00:53.031" style="s2">three-piece bedding sets. Keep an eye</p>
<p begin="01:00:51.131" end="01:00:54.931" style="s2">out for water too. I&#39;ll trade a serving</p>
<p begin="01:00:53.031" end="01:00:56.231" style="s2">of fire worm sulfur soup for a liter.</p>
<p begin="01:00:54.931" end="01:00:58.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The creatures on my island say it&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:00:56.231" end="01:00:59.531" style="s2">rain here within two days. If it does,</p>
<p begin="01:00:58.331" end="01:01:01.231" style="s2">I&#39;ll save you a bucket.</p>
<p begin="01:00:59.531" end="01:01:04.831" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal. I&#39;ll start cooking when the water</p>
<p begin="01:01:01.231" end="01:01:04.831" style="s2">arrives. You&#39;ll get the first serving.</p>
<p begin="01:01:17.931" end="01:01:20.031" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Moo.</p>
<p begin="01:01:23.832" end="01:01:27.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are we under attack?</p>
<p begin="01:01:25.532" end="01:01:28.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s that thief that ate my catch</p>
<p begin="01:01:27.032" end="01:01:30.032" style="s2">before.</p>
<p begin="01:01:28.132" end="01:01:31.632" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is it coming after me this time?</p>
<p begin="01:01:30.032" end="01:01:33.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was a fisherman.</p>
<p begin="01:01:31.632" end="01:01:35.532" style="s2">But the blood he left was the wrong</p>
<p begin="01:01:33.232" end="01:01:36.732" style="s2">color. Maybe the seawater changed its</p>
<p begin="01:01:35.532" end="01:01:39.032" style="s2">color.</p>
<p begin="01:01:36.732" end="01:01:41.132" style="s2">Freshwater fishermen have blue blood.</p>
<p begin="01:01:39.032" end="01:01:42.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything it left behind is here.</p>
<p begin="01:01:41.132" end="01:01:44.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why isn&#39;t the system reacting?</p>
<p begin="01:01:42.832" end="01:01:46.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It had only seen you before.</p>
<p begin="01:01:44.732" end="01:01:48.732" style="s2">Now there&#39;s me, a living person. Maybe</p>
<p begin="01:01:46.932" end="01:01:50.832" style="s2">it thinks I&#39;m the island&#39;s owner. With</p>
<p begin="01:01:48.732" end="01:01:53.332" style="s2">that dead monkey skin on, it mistook you</p>
<p begin="01:01:50.832" end="01:01:53.332" style="s2">for prey.</p>
<p begin="01:01:54.332" end="01:01:57.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It leaves living people alone, but takes</p>
<p begin="01:01:56.332" end="01:01:59.032" style="s2">a bite out of me.</p>
<p begin="01:01:57.432" end="01:02:00.032" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So it&#39;s treating my place like a buffet.</p>
<p begin="01:01:59.032" end="01:02:02.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Most fishermen don&#39;t like eating</p>
<p begin="01:02:00.032" end="01:02:03.732" style="s2">corpses. They prefer fresh prey.</p>
<p begin="01:02:02.332" end="01:02:04.732" style="s2">What&#39;s stranger is that it&#39;s never</p>
<p begin="01:02:03.732" end="01:02:07.132" style="s2">attacked you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:04.732" end="01:02:09.232" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe that&#39;s some kind of curse, too.</p>
<p begin="01:02:07.132" end="01:02:10.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we could catch one and ask it, we</p>
<p begin="01:02:09.232" end="01:02:13.332" style="s2">might get some answers.</p>
<p begin="01:02:10.932" end="01:02:14.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we could set a trap.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.332" end="01:02:15.732" style="s2">Leave a fresh corpse here tomorrow</p>
<p begin="01:02:14.732" end="01:02:18.732" style="s2">night.</p>
<p begin="01:02:15.732" end="01:02:20.532" style="s2">Then set up a snare or a jaw trap.</p>
<p begin="01:02:18.732" end="01:02:22.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s leave it till tomorrow then. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:02:20.532" end="01:02:25.432" style="s2">running low on materials. I&#39;ll need more</p>
<p begin="01:02:22.732" end="01:02:25.432" style="s2">to build a trap.</p>
<p begin="01:02:27.832" end="01:02:30.932" style="s2">What&#39;s in there?</p>
<p begin="01:02:28.632" end="01:02:31.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, map fragments and the shellfish meat</p>
<p begin="01:02:30.932" end="01:02:33.732" style="s2">you left yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:02:31.932" end="01:02:34.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember you putting the meat away.</p>
<p begin="01:02:33.732" end="01:02:36.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought these back from Volcano</p>
<p begin="01:02:34.932" end="01:02:38.132" style="s2">Island. I&#39;ve kept them all this time.</p>
<p begin="01:02:36.932" end="01:02:40.032" style="s2">They&#39;re yours now.</p>
<p begin="01:02:38.132" end="01:02:43.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You even held on to these?</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.032" end="01:02:43.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know you&#39;d come back.</p>
<p begin="01:02:44.532" end="01:02:48.832" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Buying holy items or materials.</p>
<p begin="01:02:46.332" end="01:02:50.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone&#39;s been cursed and badly injured.</p>
<p begin="01:02:48.832" end="01:02:52.232" style="s2">They took a healing potion, but the</p>
<p begin="01:02:50.432" end="01:02:54.832" style="s2">injuries are too extensive. They&#39;re so</p>
<p begin="01:02:52.232" end="01:02:57.732" style="s2">petrified now they can&#39;t walk.</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.832" end="01:02:59.832" style="s2">By the way, I gave you a fake name. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:02:57.732" end="01:03:02.132" style="s2">means time. Then as in willful.</p>
<p begin="01:02:59.832" end="01:03:02.132" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:03:04.932" end="01:03:08.232" style="s2">Those people are like you.</p>
<p begin="01:03:06.732" end="01:03:09.732" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope they&#39;re good people.</p>
<p begin="01:03:08.232" end="01:03:11.832" style="s2">Maybe we can even trade supplies.</p>
<p begin="01:03:09.732" end="01:03:15.332" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Temporary passage to Black Soil Island</p>
<p begin="01:03:11.832" end="01:03:17.132" style="s2">created. Time remaining, 24 hours. While</p>
<p begin="01:03:15.332" end="01:03:19.133" style="s2">the passage is open, both islands will</p>
<p begin="01:03:17.132" end="01:03:20.933" style="s2">travel side by side at the same speed.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.133" end="01:03:22.733" style="s2">Return to your island before the passage</p>
<p begin="01:03:20.933" end="01:03:24.733" style="s2">closes.</p>
<p begin="01:03:22.733" end="01:03:25.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That kid&#39;s got someone else aboard.</p>
<p begin="01:03:24.733" end="01:03:28.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See?</p>
<p begin="01:03:25.533" end="01:03:30.633" style="s2">Kids these days don&#39;t play fair.</p>
<p begin="01:03:28.233" end="01:03:33.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just watch. I can handle these guys.</p>
<p begin="01:03:30.633" end="01:03:35.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop, all of you, or my big sis WILL</p>
<p begin="01:03:33.533" end="01:03:39.333" style="s2">MAKE YOU REGRET IT.</p>
<p begin="01:03:35.833" end="01:03:40.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What a coward. All that muscle, no guts.</p>
<p begin="01:03:39.333" end="01:03:42.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.233" end="01:03:44.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Xiao Mo, take the guy. The rest of you,</p>
<p begin="01:03:42.533" end="01:03:47.133" style="s2">help me tie up the girl.</p>
<p begin="01:03:44.733" end="01:03:47.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, boss.</p>
<p begin="01:03:50.633" end="01:03:54.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Think numbers make you tough? Come at me</p>
<p begin="01:03:52.633" end="01:03:57.133" style="s2">then. Leave my big sis alone.</p>
<p begin="01:03:54.833" end="01:04:01.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can use that forbidden recipe on the</p>
<p begin="01:03:57.133" end="01:04:01.133" style="s2">ones from last time too, right?</p>
<p begin="01:04:03.233" end="01:04:05.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You actually stooped to using that</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.233" end="01:04:07.533" style="s2">stuff?</p>
<p begin="01:04:05.833" end="01:04:09.033" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE&#39;S TRYING TO KILL ME.</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.533" end="01:04:12.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were just planning to turn people</p>
<p begin="01:04:09.033" end="01:04:12.933" style="s2">into red pills. Now you&#39;re scared.</p>
<p begin="01:04:13.033" end="01:04:17.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU DARE SNEAK UP ON ME?</p>
<p begin="01:04:15.833" end="01:04:18.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You ambushed us, and now you&#39;re blaming</p>
<p begin="01:04:17.733" end="01:04:19.733" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:04:18.533" end="01:04:21.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU WANT TO DIE?</p>
<p begin="01:04:19.733" end="01:04:23.833" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET MY BUDDY GO.</p>
<p begin="01:04:21.333" end="01:04:25.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; MIND PRISON.</p>
<p begin="01:04:23.833" end="01:04:27.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see what you&#39;ve got.</p>
<p begin="01:04:25.333" end="01:04:28.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your spirit is too low to perceive the</p>
<p begin="01:04:27.333" end="01:04:29.533" style="s2">mental interference.</p>
<p begin="01:04:28.733" end="01:04:32.133" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.533" end="01:04:33.733" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IMPOSSIBLE. WHY AREN&#39;T YOU AFFECTED?</p>
<p begin="01:04:32.133" end="01:04:34.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before you started robbing and hurting</p>
<p begin="01:04:33.733" end="01:04:35.733" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="01:04:34.233" end="01:04:38.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have seen this coming.</p>
<p begin="01:04:35.733" end="01:04:39.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Roaring iron fang activated. Cost, 20</p>
<p begin="01:04:38.233" end="01:04:41.629" style="s2">energy.</p>
<p begin="01:04:39.609" end="01:04:41.629" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:04:41.733" end="01:04:46.633" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Demon eye activated. Cost, 20 energy.</p>
<p begin="01:04:44.433" end="01:04:48.933" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can&#39;t hide. On the left.</p>
<p begin="01:04:46.633" end="01:04:48.933" style="s2">Found you.</p>
<p begin="01:04:49.533" end="01:04:53.233" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get back. Get back now.</p>
<p begin="01:04:56.533" end="01:04:59.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five challengers killed.</p>
<p begin="01:05:04.033" end="01:05:09.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The boat&#39;s clear.</p>
<p begin="01:05:05.633" end="01:05:09.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over. The water&#39;s boiled.</p>
<p begin="01:05:09.933" end="01:05:13.333" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The first guy who fell in survived.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.833" end="01:05:15.233" style="s2">He&#39;ll be back once he wakes up.</p>
<p begin="01:05:13.333" end="01:05:17.533" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red pill, a forbidden healing item from</p>
<p begin="01:05:15.233" end="01:05:19.433" style="s2">Black Soil Island. Restores a little HP,</p>
<p begin="01:05:17.533" end="01:05:20.735" style="s2">reduces sanity by five when consumed.</p>
<p begin="01:05:19.433" end="01:05:23.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Black clay figurine.</p>
<p begin="01:05:20.735" end="01:05:24.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; consume soil to summon a golem.</p>
<p begin="01:05:23.035" end="01:05:26.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These things have hurt people. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:05:24.935" end="01:05:29.335" style="s2">touch them yet.</p>
<p begin="01:05:26.635" end="01:05:32.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My talent tipped me off. This fern is</p>
<p begin="01:05:29.335" end="01:05:32.335" style="s2">roasting first.</p>
<p begin="01:05:34.435" end="01:05:38.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The recipe&#39;s decent, but it reeks.</p>
<p begin="01:05:36.835" end="01:05:40.635" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. The smell won&#39;t stick to</p>
<p begin="01:05:38.635" end="01:05:42.935" style="s2">you. Leave what&#39;s in the pot alone. Let</p>
<p begin="01:05:40.635" end="01:05:44.935" style="s2">it simmer a bit longer. See if it works.</p>
<p begin="01:05:42.935" end="01:05:46.735" style="s2">Scorch sulfur soup, tier one food.</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.935" end="01:05:48.535" style="s2">Regenerates HP for an hour. Side</p>
<p begin="01:05:46.735" end="01:05:50.835" style="s2">effects, yellow skin and flammable</p>
<p begin="01:05:48.535" end="01:05:50.835" style="s2">breath.</p>
<p begin="01:05:53.735" end="01:05:57.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No bowls, use shells. Perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:05:56.135" end="01:05:59.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those ingredients paid off. This will</p>
<p begin="01:05:57.935" end="01:06:01.435" style="s2">keep our HP up from now on.</p>
<p begin="01:05:59.435" end="01:06:04.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Eat first. You just used up all your</p>
<p begin="01:06:01.435" end="01:06:04.135" style="s2">energy again.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.335" end="01:06:14.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Void whale, level unknown. Only</p>
<p begin="01:06:10.735" end="01:06:15.335" style="s2">soul-based abilities can hurt it. Dive.</p>
<p begin="01:06:14.335" end="01:06:16.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="01:06:15.335" end="01:06:19.235" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s the hunter. He&#39;s hunting those</p>
<p begin="01:06:16.935" end="01:06:19.235" style="s2">whales.</p>
<p begin="01:06:32.535" end="01:06:38.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t even retrieve his own sword.</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.235" end="01:06:40.186" style="s2">He&#39;s afraid of the erosion here.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.166" end="01:06:40.186" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.435" end="01:06:46.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that? Why is everything IN THIS</p>
<p begin="01:06:43.035" end="01:06:46.335" style="s2">DAMN PLACE SO CREEPY?</p>
<p begin="01:06:47.435" end="01:06:50.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Filthy creature.</p>
<p begin="01:06:48.835" end="01:06:52.435" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Red head tried to get back to the</p>
<p begin="01:06:50.135" end="01:06:54.135" style="s2">bridge, but he spotted him, too. The</p>
<p begin="01:06:52.435" end="01:06:56.035" style="s2">boat stowed away. Stay out of sight for</p>
<p begin="01:06:54.135" end="01:06:57.935" style="s2">now. He won&#39;t find us.</p>
<p begin="01:06:56.035" end="01:06:59.035" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since you&#39;re here, why not leave us a</p>
<p begin="01:06:57.935" end="01:07:00.835" style="s2">little something?</p>
<p begin="01:06:59.035" end="01:07:02.335" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He chased those whales all this way for</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.835" end="01:07:03.735" style="s2">that bottle.</p>
<p begin="01:07:02.335" end="01:07:05.935" style="s2">It must be valuable.</p>
<p begin="01:07:03.735" end="01:07:07.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can kill with a single sword strike.</p>
<p begin="01:07:05.935" end="01:07:09.635" style="s2">Are you still provoking him?</p>
<p begin="01:07:07.535" end="01:07:13.135" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won&#39;t go near the water. The sprayer</p>
<p begin="01:07:09.635" end="01:07:15.135" style="s2">reaches 100 m. The spear gun, only 50.</p>
<p begin="01:07:13.135" end="01:07:17.735" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Knock it loose first, then snipe it with</p>
<p begin="01:07:15.135" end="01:07:19.335" style="s2">the spear gun. Don&#39;t pierce the bottle.</p>
<p begin="01:07:17.735" end="01:07:21.535" style="s2">I need him to aim here.</p>
<p begin="01:07:19.335" end="01:07:23.935" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait until it falls within range. I I</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.535" end="01:07:23.935" style="s2">hold out</p>
<p begin="01:07:24.636" end="01:07:28.836" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grab it and go.</p>
<p begin="01:07:25.836" end="01:07:28.836" style="s2">Don&#39;t let him get another look.</p>
<p begin="01:07:32.536" end="01:07:36.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The pearl can heal him. I&#39;ve still got</p>
<p begin="01:07:34.636" end="01:07:38.036" style="s2">the soup.</p>
<p begin="01:07:36.036" end="01:07:39.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brace for the recoil together. Grab it,</p>
<p begin="01:07:38.036" end="01:07:43.236" style="s2">then dive.</p>
<p begin="01:07:39.236" end="01:07:43.236" style="s2">Aim for his legs. Slow him down.</p>
<p begin="01:07:46.036" end="01:07:49.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn it.</p>
<p begin="01:07:48.336" end="01:07:51.436" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s reaching for his bow. I need to</p>
<p begin="01:07:49.936" end="01:07:52.936" style="s2">break this strap without damaging the</p>
<p begin="01:07:51.436" end="01:07:55.436" style="s2">bottle.</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.936" end="01:07:57.936" style="s2">Only one shot left. Aim for the strap.</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.436" end="01:07:59.036" style="s2">Petrifying gaze activated. Energy cost</p>
<p begin="01:07:57.936" end="01:07:59.536" style="s2">50.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.036" end="01:08:00.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO.</p>
<p begin="01:07:59.536" end="01:08:03.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HOLD ON. CATCH.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.636" end="01:08:03.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="01:08:03.636" end="01:08:05.936" style="s2">Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.936" end="01:08:09.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m out of energy.</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.236" end="01:08:11.636" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all up to her now.</p>
<p begin="01:08:09.936" end="01:08:12.836" style="s2">I can&#39;t carry the sprayer anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:08:11.636" end="01:08:15.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go deeper.</p>
<p begin="01:08:12.836" end="01:08:15.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay out of his sight.</p>
<p begin="01:08:17.336" end="01:08:20.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You vermin.</p>
<p begin="01:08:20.736" end="01:08:25.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s still charging up. Swim to the side</p>
<p begin="01:08:22.536" end="01:08:25.936" style="s2">first, then dive deeper for cover.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.936" end="01:08:38.936" style="s2">Come on. Hands. Move.</p>
<p begin="01:08:34.736" end="01:08:38.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He got swept down. I have to catch him.</p>
<p begin="01:08:42.736" end="01:08:48.036" style="s2">It won&#39;t last long.</p>
<p begin="01:08:44.736" end="01:08:48.036" style="s2">The rocks are all sinking this way.</p>
<p begin="01:08:50.336" end="01:08:53.436" style="s2">This is bad. I shouldn&#39;t have listened</p>
<p begin="01:08:52.136" end="01:08:55.136" style="s2">to him.</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.436" end="01:08:56.236" style="s2">Shuren, where are you?</p>
<p begin="01:08:55.136" end="01:08:58.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s pulling me?</p>
<p begin="01:08:56.236" end="01:09:00.236" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still have oxygen.</p>
<p begin="01:08:58.036" end="01:09:01.936" style="s2">Don&#39;t move yet.</p>
<p begin="01:09:00.236" end="01:09:03.936" style="s2">The food&#39;s on the ground.</p>
<p begin="01:09:01.936" end="01:09:05.336" style="s2">Once this guy&#39;s dead, we&#39;ll be fine.</p>
<p begin="01:09:03.936" end="01:09:07.536" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we&#39;ll check upstairs on the second</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.336" end="01:09:07.536" style="s2">floor.</p>
<p begin="01:09:14.336" end="01:09:19.736" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank goodness he&#39;s still here. At least</p>
<p begin="01:09:16.736" end="01:09:21.636" style="s2">I didn&#39;t take that punch for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:09:19.736" end="01:09:25.036" style="s2">The wound is closing, but the gray on</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.636" end="01:09:25.036" style="s2">his shoulder hasn&#39;t faded at all.</p>
<p begin="01:09:29.137" end="01:09:32.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just like the one that ambushed me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:31.137" end="01:09:34.838" style="s2">This is the fisherman&#39;s layer. They</p>
<p begin="01:09:32.938" end="01:09:37.637" style="s2">heard my heartbeat and left, so they</p>
<p begin="01:09:34.838" end="01:09:37.637" style="s2">won&#39;t eat me.</p>
<p begin="01:09:38.237" end="01:09:41.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It must be</p>
<p begin="01:09:39.438" end="01:09:44.737" style="s2">Siri too low. Mental interference went</p>
<p begin="01:09:41.938" end="01:09:44.737" style="s2">undetected.</p>
<p begin="01:09:45.538" end="01:09:50.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of all times. Don&#39;t give up yet.</p>
<p begin="01:09:47.737" end="01:09:50.438" style="s2">Someone&#39;s still here.</p>
<p begin="01:09:57.438" end="01:10:00.538" style="s2">I&#39;ll keep it for now. I&#39;ll see if I can</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.838" end="01:10:03.137" style="s2">craft with it back home. That&#39;s the one</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.538" end="01:10:04.738" style="s2">I slashed. He can get out. Something&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:10:03.137" end="01:10:06.438" style="s2">going on. That fisherman&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="01:10:04.738" end="01:10:08.738" style="s2">following him. Better not alert them</p>
<p begin="01:10:06.438" end="01:10:08.738" style="s2">yet.</p>
<p begin="01:10:10.338" end="01:10:13.738" style="s2">Only five energy left. Even escaping</p>
<p begin="01:10:12.538" end="01:10:15.538" style="s2">will be tough.</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.738" end="01:10:18.238" style="s2">I&#39;ll find Lan Lan first and check these</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.538" end="01:10:18.238" style="s2">statues later.</p>
<p begin="01:10:18.338" end="01:10:21.637" style="s2">I can&#39;t swim against this current.</p>
<p begin="01:10:20.338" end="01:10:23.637" style="s2">Aren&#39;t they hungry?</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.637" end="01:10:25.838" style="s2">I&#39;ll lure them up with food then follow</p>
<p begin="01:10:23.637" end="01:10:25.838" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.238" end="01:10:32.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.338" end="01:10:32.938" style="s2">STOP. HUNGRY. SO HUNGRY. I&#39;M GOING UP.</p>
<p begin="01:10:33.137" end="01:10:37.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHAT&#39;S HE BABBLING ABOUT? Why did they</p>
<p begin="01:10:35.038" end="01:10:39.038" style="s2">stop again? They stopped swimming up.</p>
<p begin="01:10:37.838" end="01:10:40.938" style="s2">Maybe they did see it.</p>
<p begin="01:10:39.038" end="01:10:41.637" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But they can&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="01:10:40.938" end="01:10:43.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh.</p>
<p begin="01:10:41.637" end="01:10:46.938" style="s2">That didn&#39;t work either.</p>
<p begin="01:10:43.838" end="01:10:48.738" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone stop. Break the rules again and</p>
<p begin="01:10:46.938" end="01:10:50.738" style="s2">you&#39;ll be banished.</p>
<p begin="01:10:48.738" end="01:10:53.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have 10 minutes left.</p>
<p begin="01:10:50.738" end="01:10:56.338" style="s2">It&#39;s time to choose tonight&#39;s returnee.</p>
<p begin="01:10:53.838" end="01:10:58.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Their king shows up and they forget all</p>
<p begin="01:10:56.338" end="01:11:01.338" style="s2">about food. They&#39;d rather go hungry.</p>
<p begin="01:10:58.838" end="01:11:02.838" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The misgathering at those statues.</p>
<p begin="01:11:01.338" end="01:11:05.538" style="s2">The way out</p>
<p begin="01:11:02.838" end="01:11:05.538" style="s2">must be here.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.438" end="01:11:15.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Him again.</p>
<p begin="01:11:14.038" end="01:11:17.938" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He must have attacked a living creature</p>
<p begin="01:11:15.438" end="01:11:19.838" style="s2">yesterday. I saw the goddess punish him.</p>
<p begin="01:11:17.938" end="01:11:22.137" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have two hours.</p>
<p begin="01:11:19.838" end="01:11:22.137" style="s2">Go.</p>
<p begin="01:11:27.137" end="01:11:31.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t control it. Why won&#39;t he fight</p>
<p begin="01:11:29.139" end="01:11:31.439" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="01:11:35.539" end="01:11:38.239" style="s2">Leave me alone.</p>
<p begin="01:11:48.539" end="01:11:54.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Consider this my thanks. As for what</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.739" end="01:11:54.439" style="s2">happened before, we&#39;re even.</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.839" end="01:12:00.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good thing you knew to wait here.</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.039" end="01:12:01.439" style="s2">Otherwise, I wouldn&#39;t have known where</p>
<p begin="01:12:00.739" end="01:12:03.739" style="s2">to look.</p>
<p begin="01:12:01.439" end="01:12:05.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look pretty full of life. I looked</p>
<p begin="01:12:03.739" end="01:12:06.339" style="s2">everywhere for you.</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.239" end="01:12:08.139" style="s2">Where did you end up?</p>
<p begin="01:12:06.339" end="01:12:10.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An undercurrent swept me into a fishman</p>
<p begin="01:12:08.139" end="01:12:11.839" style="s2">den. My wounds are healed now. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:12:10.439" end="01:12:14.039" style="s2">worry.</p>
<p begin="01:12:11.839" end="01:12:15.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that you&#39;re holding?</p>
<p begin="01:12:14.039" end="01:12:16.239" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s still alive.</p>
<p begin="01:12:15.339" end="01:12:18.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s going on?</p>
<p begin="01:12:16.239" end="01:12:21.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No idea. I think it mutated. I have</p>
<p begin="01:12:18.739" end="01:12:23.539" style="s2">creature affinity. It insisted on coming</p>
<p begin="01:12:21.139" end="01:12:23.539" style="s2">with me.</p>
<p begin="01:12:24.839" end="01:12:28.639" style="s2">I tried my breeding ability while I was</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.639" end="01:12:31.239" style="s2">waiting for you. I used it in an octopus</p>
<p begin="01:12:28.639" end="01:12:31.239" style="s2">swimming past.</p>
<p begin="01:12:32.339" end="01:12:36.139" style="s2">It&#39;s very loyal. The system wasn&#39;t lying</p>
<p begin="01:12:34.839" end="01:12:38.739" style="s2">about that.</p>
<p begin="01:12:36.139" end="01:12:40.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m starving. My energy&#39;s completely</p>
<p begin="01:12:38.739" end="01:12:45.539" style="s2">drained.</p>
<p begin="01:12:40.939" end="01:12:45.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dig in. You really will eat anything.</p>
<p begin="01:12:47.139" end="01:12:52.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. You&#39;ll just pass out. Think</p>
<p begin="01:12:49.539" end="01:12:52.339" style="s2">of it as a nap.</p>
<p begin="01:12:52.939" end="01:12:56.639" style="s2">You&#39;re probably allergic to its venom.</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.939" end="01:12:58.739" style="s2">With your constitution, it should wear</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.639" end="01:13:00.339" style="s2">off in a few hours. A fishman tossed</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.739" end="01:13:02.239" style="s2">something up here last night. One with</p>
<p begin="01:13:00.339" end="01:13:04.639" style="s2">extra arms. Was it that thief from</p>
<p begin="01:13:02.239" end="01:13:04.639" style="s2">before?</p>
<p begin="01:13:05.139" end="01:13:09.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Place it in your ear to understand other</p>
<p begin="01:13:07.039" end="01:13:11.439" style="s2">creatures. For creatures with unusual</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.139" end="01:13:12.639" style="s2">speech, hold it in your mouth. Prolonged</p>
<p begin="01:13:11.439" end="01:13:14.439" style="s2">use causes erosion.</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.639" end="01:13:15.539" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A living translator. Now I can get</p>
<p begin="01:13:14.439" end="01:13:17.239" style="s2">answers about the fishmen.</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.539" end="01:13:18.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get more and sell them in the channel.</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.239" end="01:13:20.439" style="s2">They&#39;d sell like crazy.</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.639" end="01:13:21.939" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did he give you this?</p>
<p begin="01:13:20.439" end="01:13:23.539" style="s2">Did you two make up?</p>
<p begin="01:13:21.939" end="01:13:25.039" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make us sound like squabbling</p>
<p begin="01:13:23.539" end="01:13:26.939" style="s2">preschoolers.</p>
<p begin="01:13:25.039" end="01:13:28.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are your two little brats?</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.939" end="01:13:30.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Off playing in the water.</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.339" end="01:13:31.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are three more statues down there.</p>
<p begin="01:13:30.339" end="01:13:32.840" style="s2">I want to go back</p>
<p begin="01:13:31.540" end="01:13:33.840" style="s2">and look for materials for a breeding</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.840" end="01:13:36.040" style="s2">pool while I&#39;m there.</p>
<p begin="01:13:33.840" end="01:13:37.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dare you go again. You nearly died for</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.040" end="01:13:39.740" style="s2">that bottle yesterday.</p>
<p begin="01:13:37.740" end="01:13:41.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But I didn&#39;t die, did I? Avoid</p>
<p begin="01:13:39.740" end="01:13:43.340" style="s2">troublemaker&#39;s soul core, an</p>
<p begin="01:13:41.240" end="01:13:45.540" style="s2">exceptionally rare material. The little</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.340" end="01:13:47.440" style="s2">angels are paying a fortune for these.</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.540" end="01:13:50.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Would you really trade that away?</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.440" end="01:13:52.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trade? If they&#39;re offering good stuff in</p>
<p begin="01:13:50.040" end="01:13:53.940" style="s2">exchange, this must be worth even more.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.940" end="01:13:55.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; True.</p>
<p begin="01:13:53.940" end="01:13:58.140" style="s2">Plenty of creatures would fight over</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.640" end="01:14:00.340" style="s2">this. Hop here, boy.</p>
<p begin="01:13:58.140" end="01:14:02.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Level four examiner has arrived.</p>
<p begin="01:14:00.340" end="01:14:04.140" style="s2">Identity, Cyclops.</p>
<p begin="01:14:02.140" end="01:14:05.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t give me that skeptical look, you</p>
<p begin="01:14:04.140" end="01:14:08.540" style="s2">impudent brat.</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.940" end="01:14:09.440" style="s2">If I appeared in my true form, you&#39;d die</p>
<p begin="01:14:08.540" end="01:14:12.340" style="s2">instantly.</p>
<p begin="01:14:09.440" end="01:14:13.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The system charged me 30,000 island</p>
<p begin="01:14:12.340" end="01:14:14.940" style="s2">coins.</p>
<p begin="01:14:13.440" end="01:14:17.240" style="s2">Quite an appearance fee.</p>
<p begin="01:14:14.940" end="01:14:19.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me what&#39;s in that bottle</p>
<p begin="01:14:17.240" end="01:14:23.740" style="s2">and I might bend the rules for you.</p>
<p begin="01:14:19.540" end="01:14:26.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously? Even you need this stuff?</p>
<p begin="01:14:23.740" end="01:14:28.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your craftsmanship is impressive, still</p>
<p begin="01:14:26.040" end="01:14:30.840" style="s2">unpolished but inspired. And boldness is</p>
<p begin="01:14:28.940" end="01:14:33.240" style="s2">good. You&#39;re the first to qualify for a</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.840" end="01:14:35.640" style="s2">level four examiner on your first try.</p>
<p begin="01:14:33.240" end="01:14:38.340" style="s2">And dare to choose one, I can waive the</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.640" end="01:14:40.940" style="s2">personal evaluation task. But you must</p>
<p begin="01:14:38.340" end="01:14:43.240" style="s2">still meet my other three requirements.</p>
<p begin="01:14:40.940" end="01:14:45.140" style="s2">The island currently linked to yours</p>
<p begin="01:14:43.240" end="01:14:48.340" style="s2">hides a blood curse planted by an earth</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.140" end="01:14:51.440" style="s2">demon. Find it and destroy it</p>
<p begin="01:14:48.340" end="01:14:52.340" style="s2">and bring me whatever is inside.</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.440" end="01:14:54.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the second?</p>
<p begin="01:14:52.340" end="01:14:57.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finish the first one, then we&#39;ll talk,</p>
<p begin="01:14:54.340" end="01:14:58.440" style="s2">boy. Remember, you only have four hours</p>
<p begin="01:14:57.240" end="01:14:59.440" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.440" end="01:15:01.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s already one.</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.440" end="01:15:05.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The passage closes at five.</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.340" end="01:15:05.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No time. Get those two up here, quick.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.540" end="01:15:12.040" style="s2">He used to own the island. He&#39;ll know</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.140" end="01:15:15.140" style="s2">the way. Stay here with the examiner.</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.040" end="01:15:15.140" style="s2">I&#39;ll be back as fast as I can.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.940" end="01:15:19.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I want my share of the new red pills.</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.340" end="01:15:22.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m always the one processing those</p>
<p begin="01:15:19.640" end="01:15:22.340" style="s2">materials for you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:22.940" end="01:15:27.540" style="s2">Impossible. Why aren&#39;t you affected?</p>
<p begin="01:15:25.740" end="01:15:28.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run. GET THE BOSS AND THE OTHERS BACK</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.540" end="01:15:29.740" style="s2">HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:15:28.140" end="01:15:31.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO. I&#39;m not leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:15:29.740" end="01:15:34.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t just watch him kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.740" end="01:15:35.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Playing the devoted brothers, huh?</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.140" end="01:15:37.942" style="s2">I&#39;ll your precious big brother deal with</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.842" end="01:15:37.942" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.042" end="01:15:44.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boss.</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.742" end="01:15:44.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut him up, but don&#39;t kill him yet.</p>
<p begin="01:15:45.642" end="01:15:49.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Earth Demon left a blood curse on</p>
<p begin="01:15:48.042" end="01:15:50.142" style="s2">this island.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.042" end="01:15:52.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Know anything about it?</p>
<p begin="01:15:50.142" end="01:15:54.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To the southwest, four trees joined</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.942" end="01:15:55.642" style="s2">together. The red pill recipe came from</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.942" end="01:15:57.042" style="s2">there too.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.642" end="01:15:59.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.042" end="01:15:59.942" style="s2">Glad I asked.</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.742" end="01:16:07.442" style="s2">It&#39;s safe here for now. Leave if you</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.642" end="01:16:07.442" style="s2">can. Don&#39;t stick around.</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.942" end="01:16:11.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve still got their boss.</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.442" end="01:16:13.442" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You better leave at the next island.</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.442" end="01:16:16.642" style="s2">Take the supplies back too. Don&#39;t wander</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.442" end="01:16:16.642" style="s2">off. Stay close.</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.342" end="01:16:21.342" style="s2">Under the roots.</p>
<p begin="01:16:26.042" end="01:16:29.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blood creature sighted. Sanity decreased</p>
<p begin="01:16:28.842" end="01:16:32.342" style="s2">by three.</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.642" end="01:16:32.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take this.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.942" end="01:16:41.442" style="s2">Oh, you&#39;re slippery</p>
<p begin="01:16:45.742" end="01:16:51.342" style="s2">I double every time I miss. Those four</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.142" end="01:16:51.342" style="s2">trees must be the key.</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.142" end="01:16:57.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Earth Demon&#39;s blood curse dispelled.</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.042" end="01:16:59.342" style="s2">Reward, 10,000 island coins. Further</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.542" end="01:17:00.142" style="s2">rewards are exclusive to this island&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.342" end="01:17:02.042" style="s2">challenger.</p>
<p begin="01:17:00.142" end="01:17:03.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Earth Demon has cursed you. Dark</p>
<p begin="01:17:02.042" end="01:17:05.242" style="s2">creatures are now permanently more</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.542" end="01:17:08.342" style="s2">likely to detect and attack you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:05.242" end="01:17:08.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Another curse.</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.642" end="01:17:13.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dig this up.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.442" end="01:17:15.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t store it. Something alive inside.</p>
<p begin="01:17:13.742" end="01:17:16.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are what the examiner wanted.</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.642" end="01:17:18.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t make the jars though.</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.942" end="01:17:19.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jia Rong, can you carry these?</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.842" end="01:17:21.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.542" end="01:17:23.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take that as a yes. Grab all three</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.342" end="01:17:24.642" style="s2">and follow me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.242" end="01:17:26.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He really can carry them.</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.642" end="01:17:28.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go while the bridge is still</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.042" end="01:17:28.542" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.742" end="01:17:32.642" style="s2">Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:17:30.842" end="01:17:34.842" style="s2">You&#39;re feasting without me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.642" end="01:17:37.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like you actually helped. Barely</p>
<p begin="01:17:34.842" end="01:17:39.943" style="s2">hurt. Done in three and a half hours.</p>
<p begin="01:17:37.443" end="01:17:39.943" style="s2">You pass.</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.943" end="01:17:45.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So what&#39;s actually in the?</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.343" end="01:17:46.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re that island&#39;s earth spirits. If</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.243" end="01:17:48.643" style="s2">the island&#39;s original challenger had</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.743" end="01:17:49.943" style="s2">broken the earth demon&#39;s blood curse,</p>
<p begin="01:17:48.643" end="01:17:51.443" style="s2">they could have transformed the whole</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.943" end="01:17:53.343" style="s2">island with these spirits&#39; help.</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.443" end="01:17:55.043" style="s2">Unfortunately, they all fell under the</p>
<p begin="01:17:53.343" end="01:17:56.843" style="s2">earth demon&#39;s spell. Then they ran into</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.043" end="01:17:59.043" style="s2">you and lost their lives.</p>
<p begin="01:17:56.843" end="01:18:01.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least they can&#39;t hurt anyone else, so</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.043" end="01:18:02.843" style="s2">the trip wasn&#39;t a waste.</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.143" end="01:18:04.743" style="s2">Where did those pangolins go?</p>
<p begin="01:18:02.843" end="01:18:06.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The system has taken them back. They&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:18:04.743" end="01:18:08.643" style="s2">be reassigned to other islands later.</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.743" end="01:18:10.743" style="s2">You&#39;ve met my first requirement. Well</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.643" end="01:18:12.943" style="s2">done. I&#39;m in a good mood, so I&#39;ll let</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.743" end="01:18:15.243" style="s2">you in on something. The system says you</p>
<p begin="01:18:12.943" end="01:18:17.443" style="s2">can start another evaluation after 15</p>
<p begin="01:18:15.243" end="01:18:19.443" style="s2">days. Actually, those 15 days start when</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.443" end="01:18:21.343" style="s2">the evaluation begins. That&#39;s also your</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.443" end="01:18:23.043" style="s2">deadline for completing it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.343" end="01:18:23.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you haven&#39;t finished the tasks by</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.043" end="01:18:25.943" style="s2">then.</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.643" end="01:18:27.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You know what happens. Relax. This isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.943" end="01:18:28.743" style="s2">meant to target you. It&#39;s there to</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.543" end="01:18:30.743" style="s2">protect you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:28.743" end="01:18:31.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I pay you to come then get punished</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.743" end="01:18:33.643" style="s2">if I don&#39;t finish.</p>
<p begin="01:18:31.843" end="01:18:35.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should know that cowardice here is</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.643" end="01:18:37.743" style="s2">far worse than punishment. Don&#39;t assume</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.743" end="01:18:39.543" style="s2">you have all the time in the world. Now</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.743" end="01:18:41.043" style="s2">for my second requirement. I want you to</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.543" end="01:18:42.843" style="s2">dive down to the edge of the sea&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.043" end="01:18:44.443" style="s2">central region. That&#39;s where the abyss</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.843" end="01:18:46.943" style="s2">first began its encroachment. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.443" end="01:18:49.143" style="s2">worry. Just stay outside for 1 second,</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.943" end="01:18:51.343" style="s2">then you can leave. Dive down, then come</p>
<p begin="01:18:49.143" end="01:18:53.843" style="s2">back up. It&#39;s that simple. One more</p>
<p begin="01:18:51.343" end="01:18:56.143" style="s2">thing. Your total completion time also</p>
<p begin="01:18:53.843" end="01:18:58.643" style="s2">affects your score. For every 24 hours</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.143" end="01:19:01.243" style="s2">that pass, your final score drops by 1</p>
<p begin="01:18:58.643" end="01:19:02.943" style="s2">point. The maximum is 15 points.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.243" end="01:19:05.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you tell me that sooner?</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.943" end="01:19:08.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One last warning. You&#39;d better not bring</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.243" end="01:19:08.743" style="s2">any living creatures along.</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.143" end="01:19:12.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lan Lan lives on my island, too. Can she</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.143" end="01:19:15.143" style="s2">go?</p>
<p begin="01:19:12.743" end="01:19:16.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dream on. She doesn&#39;t even qualify as a</p>
<p begin="01:19:15.143" end="01:19:18.343" style="s2">challenger in her own right.</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.843" end="01:19:19.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if I just swim around and come back</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.343" end="01:19:21.443" style="s2">up? What could you do?</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.643" end="01:19:22.843" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Kid, you can&#39;t trick your way through</p>
<p begin="01:19:21.443" end="01:19:24.843" style="s2">this mission.</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.843" end="01:19:27.543" style="s2">Your word alone won&#39;t prove you entered</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.843" end="01:19:29.043" style="s2">the abyss.</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.543" end="01:19:30.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All living creatures stay here. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:19:29.043" end="01:19:32.443" style="s2">going alone. Don&#39;t follow me.</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.943" end="01:19:34.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stock up before I go.</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.443" end="01:19:37.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Light, warmth, healing, all set.</p>
<p begin="01:19:34.543" end="01:19:40.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even after dark, I have to go. Can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.143" end="01:19:40.644" style="s2">lose evaluation for nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:19:41.744" end="01:19:45.744" style="s2">Strange creature sighted. Sanity</p>
<p begin="01:19:43.744" end="01:19:47.744" style="s2">decreased by five. Just because I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.744" end="01:19:49.545" style="s2">see it doesn&#39;t mean nothing&#39;s there.</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.744" end="01:19:52.344" style="s2">Demon Eyes X-ray vision costs 20</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.545" end="01:19:54.445" style="s2">stamina. No idea how deep I need to go.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.344" end="01:19:57.144" style="s2">Better conserve it. My ears can&#39;t take</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.445" end="01:19:59.844" style="s2">it anymore. With 18 constitution, this</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.144" end="01:19:59.844" style="s2">is my limit.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.945" end="01:20:03.644" style="s2">The soup only lasts an hour. The</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.545" end="01:20:05.445" style="s2">pressure keeps damaging my body. I need</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.644" end="01:20:07.344" style="s2">another dose before this one wears off.</p>
<p begin="01:20:05.445" end="01:20:08.545" style="s2">I&#39;ve already spent 30,000.</p>
<p begin="01:20:07.344" end="01:20:10.445" style="s2">I can&#39;t turn back now.</p>
<p begin="01:20:08.545" end="01:20:12.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Abnormal sight detected. Sanity</p>
<p begin="01:20:10.445" end="01:20:14.344" style="s2">decreased by five.</p>
<p begin="01:20:12.344" end="01:20:15.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re trying to force me down.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.344" end="01:20:18.244" style="s2">Better find something to anchor myself</p>
<p begin="01:20:15.945" end="01:20:18.244" style="s2">to.</p>
<p begin="01:20:18.545" end="01:20:22.945" style="s2">The high priest melted the barbs off. It</p>
<p begin="01:20:20.744" end="01:20:24.844" style="s2">won&#39;t grip the rock. I&#39;ll have to tie it</p>
<p begin="01:20:22.945" end="01:20:28.144" style="s2">tight.</p>
<p begin="01:20:24.844" end="01:20:28.144" style="s2">It&#39;s my only weight bike.</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.545" end="01:20:33.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The eyeballs dispersed.</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.344" end="01:20:35.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those last 300 m took almost two hours.</p>
<p begin="01:20:33.045" end="01:20:37.744" style="s2">The edge of the core is just below.</p>
<p begin="01:20:35.844" end="01:20:40.344" style="s2">These fish are all stuck together. The</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.744" end="01:20:41.545" style="s2">damaged parts are growing back. I can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.344" end="01:20:44.045" style="s2">go any farther.</p>
<p begin="01:20:41.545" end="01:20:47.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Incomprehensible sight detected. Sanity</p>
<p begin="01:20:44.045" end="01:20:47.344" style="s2">continuously decreasing.</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.945" end="01:20:51.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You saw it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.045" end="01:20:55.844" style="s2">Why isn&#39;t it responding? The computer</p>
<p begin="01:20:54.045" end="01:20:58.445" style="s2">just fried.</p>
<p begin="01:20:55.844" end="01:21:00.844" style="s2">No, that&#39;s not right. Can&#39;t let go.</p>
<p begin="01:20:58.445" end="01:21:02.545" style="s2">Blocking the blocking. Spirit stat too</p>
<p begin="01:21:00.844" end="01:21:05.144" style="s2">low. Mental interference went</p>
<p begin="01:21:02.545" end="01:21:07.045" style="s2">unperceived. Illusion blocked. I almost</p>
<p begin="01:21:05.144" end="01:21:10.045" style="s2">tossed my spear gun, thinking it was a</p>
<p begin="01:21:07.045" end="01:21:12.344" style="s2">mouse. If I let go, I&#39;ll fall right into</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.045" end="01:21:13.744" style="s2">those monsters below.</p>
<p begin="01:21:12.344" end="01:21:15.445" style="s2">It&#39;s been five hours since I went</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.744" end="01:21:17.144" style="s2">underwater. The dive down didn&#39;t take</p>
<p begin="01:21:15.445" end="01:21:19.445" style="s2">that long. I must have lost some time in</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.144" end="01:21:21.045" style="s2">that illusion. Even the system froze. I</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.445" end="01:21:22.744" style="s2">can&#39;t look at that eye again.</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.045" end="01:21:24.945" style="s2">The dose I just took is already wearing</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.744" end="01:21:25.945" style="s2">off. The quest only required a 1-second</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.945" end="01:21:27.644" style="s2">stay.</p>
<p begin="01:21:25.945" end="01:21:30.144" style="s2">I&#39;ve done enough. Why is my back still</p>
<p begin="01:21:27.644" end="01:21:30.144" style="s2">so itchy?</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.744" end="01:21:38.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing down here?</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.045" end="01:21:40.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t come down here just for you. So</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.144" end="01:21:41.045" style="s2">does been gone a while. I I to see if</p>
<p begin="01:21:40.045" end="01:21:41.146" style="s2">she was lost.</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.045" end="01:21:42.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did</p>
<p begin="01:21:41.146" end="01:21:44.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; you find the little rascal?</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.446" end="01:21:46.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve searched all around here. She won&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.245" end="01:21:47.946" style="s2">even answer my whistle. Help me look for</p>
<p begin="01:21:46.046" end="01:21:50.845" style="s2">her. You can still move, right?</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.946" end="01:21:52.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, all right. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="01:21:50.845" end="01:21:54.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you going deeper? The water</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.345" end="01:21:55.446" style="s2">pressure&#39;s too high down there. There&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.046" end="01:21:57.146" style="s2">no way she could get down there.</p>
<p begin="01:21:55.446" end="01:21:58.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s always getting into trouble. I</p>
<p begin="01:21:57.146" end="01:22:00.646" style="s2">have to check.</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.245" end="01:22:01.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you&#39;re having second thoughts, leave.</p>
<p begin="01:22:00.646" end="01:22:03.546" style="s2">I&#39;ll look myself.</p>
<p begin="01:22:01.946" end="01:22:04.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something&#39;s really wrong with my back.</p>
<p begin="01:22:03.546" end="01:22:07.046" style="s2">Take a look for me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.446" end="01:22:10.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nothing there. It looks fine. If</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.046" end="01:22:12.345" style="s2">it&#39;s that itchy, use this to scratch it.</p>
<p begin="01:22:10.546" end="01:22:14.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re on the ocean floor. Yeah, we can</p>
<p begin="01:22:12.345" end="01:22:17.845" style="s2">talk just fine. Look, I&#39;m laughing my</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.845" end="01:22:19.546" style="s2">head off without choking. Unbelievable.</p>
<p begin="01:22:17.845" end="01:22:22.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My immunity didn&#39;t kick in this time.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.546" end="01:22:22.146" style="s2">Problems with me.</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.146" end="01:22:27.245" style="s2">It&#39;s that slime. Once the wound closes,</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.845" end="01:22:30.546" style="s2">it&#39;ll be harder to get rid of.</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.245" end="01:22:30.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have to get it all out at once.</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.446" end="01:22:34.646" style="s2">My heat resistance is holding up. I need</p>
<p begin="01:22:33.345" end="01:22:35.646" style="s2">to get back up fast.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.646" end="01:22:36.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seriously?</p>
<p begin="01:22:35.646" end="01:22:38.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh dear.</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.646" end="01:22:40.345" style="s2">Didn&#39;t I break out of the illusion?</p>
<p begin="01:22:38.446" end="01:22:42.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back, demon.</p>
<p begin="01:22:40.345" end="01:22:43.345" style="s2">Crawl back into the abyss.</p>
<p begin="01:22:42.345" end="01:22:45.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the one who gave me the</p>
<p begin="01:22:43.345" end="01:22:47.046" style="s2">translation orb. Does it think I&#39;m a</p>
<p begin="01:22:45.245" end="01:22:47.845" style="s2">monster?</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.046" end="01:22:48.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.845" end="01:22:50.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Human,</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.845" end="01:22:52.845" style="s2">how did you get out of the abyss?</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.646" end="01:22:55.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No living thing could escape from there.</p>
<p begin="01:22:52.845" end="01:22:56.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The jellyfish orb only translates. I</p>
<p begin="01:22:55.446" end="01:22:58.546" style="s2">still can&#39;t speak.</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.845" end="01:23:00.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll have him take me up first.</p>
<p begin="01:22:58.546" end="01:23:02.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before the potion wears off.</p>
<p begin="01:23:00.546" end="01:23:04.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I understand now. You&#39;ve come to save</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.446" end="01:23:05.345" style="s2">us. You must have.</p>
<p begin="01:23:04.046" end="01:23:06.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Praise the goddess.</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.345" end="01:23:10.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s been a thousand years.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.845" end="01:23:10.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The goddess has finally forgiven us.</p>
<p begin="01:23:15.345" end="01:23:19.546" style="s2">You look like an underwater fighter jet.</p>
<p begin="01:23:18.046" end="01:23:21.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long has he been asleep?</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.546" end="01:23:23.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 hours later.</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.446" end="01:23:25.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The assessor&#39;s still keeping time. I</p>
<p begin="01:23:23.546" end="01:23:28.646" style="s2">nearly died down there, and he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:23:25.345" end="01:23:28.646" style="s2">sleeping like a baby.</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.046" end="01:23:36.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hm?</p>
<p begin="01:23:31.946" end="01:23:36.345" style="s2">What time is it? Is it morning already?</p>
<p begin="01:23:36.546" end="01:23:39.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quit sniffing. Log my time first. How</p>
<p begin="01:23:38.446" end="01:23:40.345" style="s2">about 8 hours?</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.446" end="01:23:41.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:23:40.345" end="01:23:42.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 8 hours?</p>
<p begin="01:23:41.646" end="01:23:43.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is 8 hours that long?</p>
<p begin="01:23:42.946" end="01:23:44.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really made</p>
<p begin="01:23:43.847" end="01:23:47.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; outside the center.</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.947" end="01:23:48.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A giant eye was staring at me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:47.347" end="01:23:50.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even your system froze.</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.947" end="01:23:52.647" style="s2">Need to go down and check.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.347" end="01:23:54.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your erosion resistance is so high. Yet</p>
<p begin="01:23:52.647" end="01:23:56.547" style="s2">the system didn&#39;t list it as a talent.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.647" end="01:23:57.847" style="s2">The abyss must have affected it deeply,</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.547" end="01:23:58.747" style="s2">enough to throw off its assessment of</p>
<p begin="01:23:57.847" end="01:24:01.247" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:23:58.747" end="01:24:03.647" style="s2">8 hours. I admit, you&#39;ve exceeded my</p>
<p begin="01:24:01.247" end="01:24:05.747" style="s2">expectations. Fool. Your affairs are</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.647" end="01:24:07.347" style="s2">beyond my authority, and I shouldn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:24:05.747" end="01:24:09.947" style="s2">interfere. But while you&#39;re on this</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.347" end="01:24:11.747" style="s2">island, your fates are bound to it.</p>
<p begin="01:24:09.947" end="01:24:13.047" style="s2">Challenger, are the fish folk in these</p>
<p begin="01:24:11.747" end="01:24:14.947" style="s2">waters worth saving?</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.047" end="01:24:16.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll save them. This is my island. They</p>
<p begin="01:24:14.947" end="01:24:17.347" style="s2">live on my island, so I&#39;ll look out for</p>
<p begin="01:24:16.547" end="01:24:19.247" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:24:17.347" end="01:24:21.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well said. You&#39;ve met all three</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.247" end="01:24:23.247" style="s2">requirements, so my work here is done.</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.547" end="01:24:25.147" style="s2">The system will announce your score.</p>
<p begin="01:24:23.247" end="01:24:27.847" style="s2">Hope we meet again, kid. But don&#39;t rush</p>
<p begin="01:24:25.147" end="01:24:29.547" style="s2">things. With assessors above level 5,</p>
<p begin="01:24:27.847" end="01:24:31.347" style="s2">you may afford to summon them, but</p>
<p begin="01:24:29.547" end="01:24:33.147" style="s2">getting rid of them is another matter.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.347" end="01:24:36.147" style="s2">By then, it&#39;ll be too late.</p>
<p begin="01:24:33.147" end="01:24:37.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Individual assessment, 13 points. Tasks,</p>
<p begin="01:24:36.147" end="01:24:39.947" style="s2">12 points.</p>
<p begin="01:24:37.047" end="01:24:43.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Task two, 4 points. Task three, 5</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.947" end="01:24:45.047" style="s2">points. Final score, 13.5 points.</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.147" end="01:24:46.747" style="s2">Challenger, Evil&#39;s Bane, Maker of</p>
<p begin="01:24:45.047" end="01:24:48.847" style="s2">Justice, has passed the level 4</p>
<p begin="01:24:46.747" end="01:24:51.747" style="s2">assessment. Rewards, a dragon bone</p>
<p begin="01:24:48.847" end="01:24:54.347" style="s2">blade, genetic secret arts volume one,</p>
<p begin="01:24:51.747" end="01:24:56.547" style="s2">one tier two all stat potion, and 50</p>
<p begin="01:24:54.347" end="01:24:59.047" style="s2">million island coins. New level 4</p>
<p begin="01:24:56.547" end="01:25:00.147" style="s2">assessment speed record. Bonus reward,</p>
<p begin="01:24:59.047" end="01:25:01.647" style="s2">madness furnace.</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.147" end="01:25:03.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 10 islands have now passed their</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.647" end="01:25:05.447" style="s2">assessments. The Dream Realm is</p>
<p begin="01:25:03.547" end="01:25:07.647" style="s2">unlocked. Preparations for the Myriad</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.447" end="01:25:10.147" style="s2">Islands market are underway. The portal</p>
<p begin="01:25:07.647" end="01:25:13.547" style="s2">will open after 10:00 p.m. tonight.</p>
<p begin="01:25:10.147" end="01:25:15.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? A level 4 assessor? That&#39;s insane.</p>
<p begin="01:25:13.547" end="01:25:17.447" style="s2">Where did they get that kind of money?</p>
<p begin="01:25:15.347" end="01:25:19.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He Zheng, are you reading this?</p>
<p begin="01:25:17.447" end="01:25:19.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you share any info on the level 4</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.047" end="01:25:21.947" style="s2">assessor?</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.747" end="01:25:23.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; White Wolf, second on the kill</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.947" end="01:25:25.747" style="s2">leaderboard. Even my island&#39;s name is</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.847" end="01:25:26.547" style="s2">public now. I still don&#39;t know what the</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.747" end="01:25:27.947" style="s2">others can do.</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.547" end="01:25:29.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Better keep a low profile for now.</p>
<p begin="01:25:27.947" end="01:25:32.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, White Wolf, what level assessment</p>
<p begin="01:25:29.847" end="01:25:35.047" style="s2">did you guys pass? I spent everything to</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.347" end="01:25:37.247" style="s2">start mine, and now I&#39;m stuck.</p>
<p begin="01:25:35.047" end="01:25:38.947" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We chose level two. It tests two things,</p>
<p begin="01:25:37.247" end="01:25:40.847" style="s2">as far as we know. The challenger&#39;s own</p>
<p begin="01:25:38.947" end="01:25:41.647" style="s2">abilities and how well they work with</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.847" end="01:25:43.147" style="s2">their island.</p>
<p begin="01:25:41.647" end="01:25:44.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; On shared islands, everyone&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:25:43.147" end="01:25:47.047" style="s2">performance counts toward the score.</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.847" end="01:25:48.549" style="s2">Exploring, hunting, solving problems on</p>
<p begin="01:25:47.047" end="01:25:50.849" style="s2">the island. Any of those could be a</p>
<p begin="01:25:48.549" end="01:25:52.349" style="s2">task. The faster you finish, the better.</p>
<p begin="01:25:50.849" end="01:25:54.849" style="s2">The two scores are averaged with a</p>
<p begin="01:25:52.349" end="01:25:57.049" style="s2">maximum of 15 points. Besides the items,</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.849" end="01:25:58.549" style="s2">we got 5,000 island coins. As long as</p>
<p begin="01:25:57.049" end="01:25:59.948" style="s2">you score high enough, you&#39;ll earn more</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.549" end="01:26:02.448" style="s2">coins than you spent to start the</p>
<p begin="01:25:59.948" end="01:26:02.448" style="s2">assessment.</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.649" end="01:26:06.049" style="s2">Pretty generous of him to share. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:26:04.349" end="01:26:08.448" style="s2">give them a heads up, too. No need to</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.049" end="01:26:10.649" style="s2">say who I am. I chose level two, too.</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.448" end="01:26:12.448" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a tip to share with everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:26:10.649" end="01:26:14.149" style="s2">Please pay close attention. The system</p>
<p begin="01:26:12.448" end="01:26:17.349" style="s2">said we could start another assessment</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.149" end="01:26:18.948" style="s2">in 15 days. There&#39;s a catch.</p>
<p begin="01:26:17.349" end="01:26:21.049" style="s2">Those 15 days start when you begin the</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.948" end="01:26:22.149" style="s2">assessment. That&#39;s also your deadline to</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.049" end="01:26:24.049" style="s2">finish it.</p>
<p begin="01:26:22.149" end="01:26:25.849" style="s2">Miss the deadline and your assessor will</p>
<p begin="01:26:24.049" end="01:26:27.249" style="s2">punish you. The higher the rating, the</p>
<p begin="01:26:25.849" end="01:26:29.149" style="s2">harsher the punishment. If you&#39;ve been</p>
<p begin="01:26:27.249" end="01:26:29.749" style="s2">putting off your quest, you&#39;d better get</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.149" end="01:26:31.948" style="s2">moving.</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.749" end="01:26:33.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I just asked my assessor. He&#39;s telling</p>
<p begin="01:26:31.948" end="01:26:35.649" style="s2">the truth. The assessors kept that from</p>
<p begin="01:26:33.749" end="01:26:37.849" style="s2">us on purpose.</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.649" end="01:26:40.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did his assessor tell him?</p>
<p begin="01:26:37.849" end="01:26:42.749" style="s2">Isn&#39;t that suspicious?</p>
<p begin="01:26:40.549" end="01:26:44.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust Ma. He&#39;s never had a bad trading</p>
<p begin="01:26:42.749" end="01:26:45.849" style="s2">review. Everyone, keep track of your</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.549" end="01:26:47.349" style="s2">assessment deadline.</p>
<p begin="01:26:45.849" end="01:26:49.249" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe he&#39;s trying to make us rush our</p>
<p begin="01:26:47.349" end="01:26:51.749" style="s2">quests and get lower scores.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.249" end="01:26:52.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s just trying to help. Believe him or</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.749" end="01:26:54.649" style="s2">don&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:26:52.349" end="01:26:56.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to stick together. Who knows how</p>
<p begin="01:26:54.649" end="01:26:57.849" style="s2">many of us are left? The system doesn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:26:56.649" end="01:26:59.749" style="s2">even announce it anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:26:57.849" end="01:27:01.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for the tip, Ma. You&#39;ve saved a</p>
<p begin="01:26:59.749" end="01:27:03.249" style="s2">lot of lives. Based on our analysis, the</p>
<p begin="01:27:01.948" end="01:27:04.948" style="s2">Dream Realm and the Thousand Isles</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.249" end="01:27:06.149" style="s2">market may be places where challengers</p>
<p begin="01:27:04.948" end="01:27:07.849" style="s2">gather in large numbers.</p>
<p begin="01:27:06.149" end="01:27:11.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope we can all get along</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.849" end="01:27:11.149" style="s2">and work together to survive.</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.749" end="01:27:17.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great this, great that. Just call me</p>
<p begin="01:27:16.249" end="01:27:18.149" style="s2">Omen.</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.049" end="01:27:19.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Great Lord Omen, tonight?</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.149" end="01:27:21.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not tonight. I&#39;m checking out the Dream</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.549" end="01:27:24.049" style="s2">Realm. Whatever it is, it can wait. Lord</p>
<p begin="01:27:21.749" end="01:27:25.448" style="s2">Omen, the way down is hard to find. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:27:24.049" end="01:27:29.349" style="s2">leave markers along the way for you to</p>
<p begin="01:27:25.448" end="01:27:29.349" style="s2">follow. I&#39;ll go report to the king now.</p>
<p begin="01:27:36.749" end="01:27:41.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, no more sleeping on hard</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.349" end="01:27:43.448" style="s2">planks.</p>
<p begin="01:27:41.549" end="01:27:45.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After paying off the clothes, I had nine</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.448" end="01:27:47.149" style="s2">doses of the medicine left. I made 60</p>
<p begin="01:27:45.448" end="01:27:48.950" style="s2">more with stored rainwater, bringing the</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.149" end="01:27:50.450" style="s2">total to 69. I&#39;m almost out of</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.950" end="01:27:52.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; mole folk fur.</p>
<p begin="01:27:50.450" end="01:27:53.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going down to look for shells. Leave</p>
<p begin="01:27:52.050" end="01:27:54.150" style="s2">some room on the boat for whatever you</p>
<p begin="01:27:53.450" end="01:27:56.150" style="s2">bring back.</p>
<p begin="01:27:54.150" end="01:27:57.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just keep looking. We can squeeze more</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.150" end="01:27:58.550" style="s2">in.</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.150" end="01:28:00.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Catch some fish, too. We&#39;re running low</p>
<p begin="01:27:58.550" end="01:28:02.950" style="s2">on food.</p>
<p begin="01:28:00.150" end="01:28:05.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tier two, all stat boost potion. Taste</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.950" end="01:28:07.150" style="s2">sweet. Boosts all stats, offering a more</p>
<p begin="01:28:05.450" end="01:28:07.950" style="s2">intense experience than the tier one</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.150" end="01:28:11.750" style="s2">potion.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.950" end="01:28:11.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see just how intense it is.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.950" end="01:28:18.050" style="s2">It wasn&#39;t lying this time.</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.550" end="01:28:22.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s what it meant by intense.</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.050" end="01:28:23.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sweetness was just to lure me in.</p>
<p begin="01:28:22.150" end="01:28:25.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That stuff really packs a punch, and I</p>
<p begin="01:28:23.950" end="01:28:30.050" style="s2">got the full experience. All right.</p>
<p begin="01:28:25.850" end="01:28:34.150" style="s2">Strength 26, cap 50, constitution 24,</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.050" end="01:28:37.050" style="s2">cap 50, intelligence 18, cap 50. Life</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.150" end="01:28:40.350" style="s2">tier, superhuman. Status, cursed.</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.050" end="01:28:42.250" style="s2">Erosion, 9%.</p>
<p begin="01:28:40.350" end="01:28:44.750" style="s2">It was only 3% before I went into the</p>
<p begin="01:28:42.250" end="01:28:46.750" style="s2">abyss. Now it&#39;s already at 9%.</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.750" end="01:28:48.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tier two, all stat potion effects.</p>
<p begin="01:28:46.750" end="01:28:51.550" style="s2">Strength, constitution, and intelligence</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.750" end="01:28:53.650" style="s2">increased by six each. Spirit, sanity,</p>
<p begin="01:28:51.550" end="01:28:54.550" style="s2">stamina, and maximum HP remain</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.650" end="01:28:56.750" style="s2">unchanged.</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.550" end="01:29:00.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you call that all stats? Why didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.750" end="01:29:00.450" style="s2">my stamina or HP go up at all?</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.950" end="01:29:06.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your brain is not developed enough to</p>
<p begin="01:29:04.650" end="01:29:06.850" style="s2">learn this secret art.</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.050" end="01:29:07.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:29:06.850" end="01:29:12.450" style="s2">I&#39;ll let Lemon try it.</p>
<p begin="01:29:07.950" end="01:29:14.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dragon bone blade. Length, 124 cm. Only</p>
<p begin="01:29:12.450" end="01:29:16.250" style="s2">superhumans can wield it. Attack deal</p>
<p begin="01:29:14.350" end="01:29:18.350" style="s2">bonus dark damage. Wounds resist</p>
<p begin="01:29:16.250" end="01:29:20.050" style="s2">healing. Damage doubles in darkness.</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.350" end="01:29:22.350" style="s2">Charge to launch a ranged slash.</p>
<p begin="01:29:20.050" end="01:29:23.950" style="s2">Destruction slash costs 30 stamina.</p>
<p begin="01:29:22.350" end="01:29:26.150" style="s2">Charge for two seconds to unleash a</p>
<p begin="01:29:23.950" end="01:29:28.050" style="s2">destructive gale. If the life it devours</p>
<p begin="01:29:26.150" end="01:29:30.550" style="s2">includes plants, it can turn half their</p>
<p begin="01:29:28.050" end="01:29:32.750" style="s2">life force into stamina restoring orbs.</p>
<p begin="01:29:30.550" end="01:29:35.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 stamina per slash. Got to make it</p>
<p begin="01:29:32.750" end="01:29:35.150" style="s2">count.</p>
<p begin="01:29:35.350" end="01:29:39.550" style="s2">Nice blade. But before upgrading it, I</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.850" end="01:29:41.650" style="s2">need to subdue whatever&#39;s inside.</p>
<p begin="01:29:39.550" end="01:29:43.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Furnace of madness, purple plus grade.</p>
<p begin="01:29:41.650" end="01:29:45.550" style="s2">Burns with Ghost Island flames. Feed it</p>
<p begin="01:29:43.550" end="01:29:47.650" style="s2">fire to recharge. Ghosts interfere</p>
<p begin="01:29:45.550" end="01:29:49.850" style="s2">during use. Boosts the soul power in</p>
<p begin="01:29:47.650" end="01:29:52.251" style="s2">weapons and nourishes and restores</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.850" end="01:29:54.552" style="s2">spirit forms. Crafted bonus, ghost&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.251" end="01:29:57.552" style="s2">gift. Continuously drains sanity while</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.552" end="01:30:00.351" style="s2">active. Grants +5 strength, +5 mental</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.552" end="01:30:02.251" style="s2">resistance, and +20 max stamina. Bonuses</p>
<p begin="01:30:00.351" end="01:30:04.451" style="s2">end when deactivated. Adding the</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.251" end="01:30:08.151" style="s2">dagger&#39;s effects might make it even</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.451" end="01:30:08.151" style="s2">better. Cannot place here.</p>
<p begin="01:30:08.351" end="01:30:11.751" style="s2">I can&#39;t even fit a furnace here. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.052" end="01:30:13.251" style="s2">need some land first. I&#39;ll mix black</p>
<p begin="01:30:11.751" end="01:30:15.451" style="s2">sand with sea stones to fill in the</p>
<p begin="01:30:13.251" end="01:30:17.552" style="s2">island. Lay the foundation first.</p>
<p begin="01:30:15.451" end="01:30:19.451" style="s2">Then plant trees and build a house with</p>
<p begin="01:30:17.552" end="01:30:21.651" style="s2">room for Landland&#39;s experiments. It&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:30:19.451" end="01:30:23.751" style="s2">go faster if the fishermen would help. 6</p>
<p begin="01:30:21.651" end="01:30:25.951" style="s2">and 1/2 days in, and the Death Army is</p>
<p begin="01:30:23.751" end="01:30:27.851" style="s2">already at 6,840</p>
<p begin="01:30:25.951" end="01:30:30.052" style="s2">m. Is that guy on Skull Island still</p>
<p begin="01:30:27.851" end="01:30:34.151" style="s2">alive? They are right on my ass. I&#39;m at</p>
<p begin="01:30:30.052" end="01:30:36.552" style="s2">7,120 m. My island only rises 40 m an</p>
<p begin="01:30:34.151" end="01:30:38.851" style="s2">hour. The Death Army is rising 60 m an</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.552" end="01:30:41.951" style="s2">hour now. At this rate, they&#39;ll catch me</p>
<p begin="01:30:38.851" end="01:30:41.951" style="s2">in less than a day.</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.451" end="01:30:47.451" style="s2">I need at least one set of tier 2 elite</p>
<p begin="01:30:44.651" end="01:30:49.552" style="s2">remains. A tier 2 elite. I haven&#39;t even</p>
<p begin="01:30:47.451" end="01:30:51.151" style="s2">survived my current trial yet. Level 2</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.552" end="01:30:54.751" style="s2">trial. Enter the Skull Monitor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:30:51.151" end="01:30:56.951" style="s2">territory and survive for over 10 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:30:54.751" end="01:30:58.851" style="s2">Does anyone know a way to go faster</p>
<p begin="01:30:56.951" end="01:31:00.451" style="s2">besides upgrading the island? Before you</p>
<p begin="01:30:58.851" end="01:31:02.751" style="s2">die, share what you learned about the</p>
<p begin="01:31:00.451" end="01:31:05.451" style="s2">Death Army. Don&#39;t be so cold.</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.751" end="01:31:07.751" style="s2">You could be next.</p>
<p begin="01:31:05.451" end="01:31:09.351" style="s2">I have a theory. The Myriad Isles market</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.751" end="01:31:11.151" style="s2">might sell items that let you set an</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.351" end="01:31:12.052" style="s2">island&#39;s location or move it somewhere</p>
<p begin="01:31:11.151" end="01:31:13.851" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="01:31:12.052" end="01:31:15.951" style="s2">I have no hard evidence, though. It&#39;s up</p>
<p begin="01:31:13.851" end="01:31:16.951" style="s2">to you to take the gamble. Got to lead,</p>
<p begin="01:31:15.951" end="01:31:19.351" style="s2">Ma.</p>
<p begin="01:31:16.951" end="01:31:21.851" style="s2">Ma, what do you think our chances are?</p>
<p begin="01:31:19.351" end="01:31:24.151" style="s2">I&#39;d say about 70 %.</p>
<p begin="01:31:21.851" end="01:31:26.251" style="s2">Got any island coins left? Yeah. The</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.151" end="01:31:28.251" style="s2">level 2 assessment cost a lot, but I</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.251" end="01:31:30.151" style="s2">still have some. Can we use island coins</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.251" end="01:31:31.851" style="s2">in the Dream Realm? So far, they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:31:30.151" end="01:31:33.751" style="s2">barely used for anything besides</p>
<p begin="01:31:31.851" end="01:31:35.552" style="s2">assessments. Maybe the markets where we</p>
<p begin="01:31:33.751" end="01:31:39.951" style="s2">can spend them. We&#39;ll find out inside.</p>
<p begin="01:31:35.552" end="01:31:42.351" style="s2">You&#39;ll die next time Pearl Island will.</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.951" end="01:31:45.052" style="s2">Dream on. Pearl Island will never cross</p>
<p begin="01:31:42.351" end="01:31:47.552" style="s2">your path again. The great emissary has</p>
<p begin="01:31:45.052" end="01:31:49.151" style="s2">plenty of ways to make it happen. If</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.552" end="01:31:51.151" style="s2">islands can cross paths again, there</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.151" end="01:31:54.052" style="s2">might be a way to steer them.</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.151" end="01:31:54.052" style="s2">I hope I can find it.</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.151" end="01:31:58.153" style="s2">Ma, my name&#39;s Jing He. If I survive</p>
<p begin="01:31:56.352" end="01:31:59.052" style="s2">tonight, just ask if you ever need</p>
<p begin="01:31:58.153" end="01:32:01.552" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.052" end="01:32:03.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No big deal. If you make it,</p>
<p begin="01:32:01.552" end="01:32:05.052" style="s2">I&#39;ve got a trade in mind for you.</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.952" end="01:32:07.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve got it.</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.052" end="01:32:07.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll be in touch.</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.852" end="01:32:11.952" style="s2">Put a dock here for now.</p>
<p begin="01:32:10.352" end="01:32:14.653" style="s2">With the island here now, it&#39;s not as</p>
<p begin="01:32:11.952" end="01:32:14.653" style="s2">convenient.</p>
<p begin="01:32:15.952" end="01:32:21.252" style="s2">Three erosion cores added. Nearly 1,500</p>
<p begin="01:32:18.752" end="01:32:24.552" style="s2">energy restored. Abyssal island energy,</p>
<p begin="01:32:21.252" end="01:32:27.153" style="s2">3,500 out of 8,000. About 2,000 energy</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.552" end="01:32:28.752" style="s2">used in three days and only 1,500</p>
<p begin="01:32:27.153" end="01:32:30.852" style="s2">restored. I&#39;m using more than I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:32:28.752" end="01:32:34.352" style="s2">restoring.</p>
<p begin="01:32:30.852" end="01:32:34.352" style="s2">Can&#39;t let my reserves run dry.</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.153" end="01:32:41.552" style="s2">Why are you still here? The sand</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.153" end="01:32:41.552" style="s2">underneath is moving too.</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.952" end="01:32:51.653" style="s2">So it&#39;s a whole nest of decoys, pretty</p>
<p begin="01:32:49.052" end="01:32:54.153" style="s2">well hidden. Too bad I can see every one</p>
<p begin="01:32:51.653" end="01:32:56.052" style="s2">of you. Digimon I, spend 20 stamina to</p>
<p begin="01:32:54.153" end="01:33:00.153" style="s2">detect life in all directions, even</p>
<p begin="01:32:56.052" end="01:33:00.153" style="s2">through obstacles. Lasts one minute.</p>
<p begin="01:33:03.952" end="01:33:09.153" style="s2">Queen mimic, erosion 20%.</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.952" end="01:33:12.153" style="s2">An expert at camouflage and incredibly</p>
<p begin="01:33:09.153" end="01:33:13.552" style="s2">fast. Its tender, sweet flesh is called</p>
<p begin="01:33:12.153" end="01:33:15.653" style="s2">butter meat.</p>
<p begin="01:33:13.552" end="01:33:18.352" style="s2">Trying to pull it out. Those hands are</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.653" end="01:33:20.452" style="s2">just what I&#39;ve been waiting for.</p>
<p begin="01:33:18.352" end="01:33:24.153" style="s2">You have slain the whispering mimic,</p>
<p begin="01:33:20.452" end="01:33:24.153" style="s2">obtained five erosion cores.</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.352" end="01:33:29.153" style="s2">Five cores with 20% erosion. Drops might</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.153" end="01:33:31.252" style="s2">depend on accumulated erosion, not just</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.153" end="01:33:33.752" style="s2">strength. Stay sharp.</p>
<p begin="01:33:31.252" end="01:33:37.252" style="s2">Let&#39;s test that bell of its first.</p>
<p begin="01:33:33.752" end="01:33:39.052" style="s2">Spring cap jellyfish, erosion 25%. Tier</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.252" end="01:33:40.552" style="s2">one elite. The brain-like growth beneath</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.052" end="01:33:42.752" style="s2">its float handles reproduction,</p>
<p begin="01:33:40.552" end="01:33:44.952" style="s2">digestion, and toxin secretion. Its</p>
<p begin="01:33:42.752" end="01:33:48.052" style="s2">tentacle tips inject prey with toxins</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.952" end="01:33:48.052" style="s2">and fertilized eggs.</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.052" end="01:33:54.653" style="s2">Can&#39;t hit the enemy, but you&#39;re great at</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.952" end="01:33:54.653" style="s2">hitting yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.052" end="01:34:01.554" style="s2">An underwater storm would suck me too.</p>
<p begin="01:33:58.654" end="01:34:01.554" style="s2">Ice shots it is.</p>
<p begin="01:34:04.554" end="01:34:10.354" style="s2">It swallowed the ice shot.</p>
<p begin="01:34:06.154" end="01:34:10.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. WHY IS IT STILL CHARGING?</p>
<p begin="01:34:12.054" end="01:34:15.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M SURROUNDED.</p>
<p begin="01:34:13.154" end="01:34:15.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Activate tentacle form. Give me a way</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.054" end="01:34:17.554" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.554" end="01:34:19.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The searing heat sends Shuren&#39;s HP</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.554" end="01:34:20.554" style="s2">plummeting, but his skill remains</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.854" end="01:34:22.754" style="s2">active.</p>
<p begin="01:34:20.554" end="01:34:25.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His tentacles keep regenerating, and the</p>
<p begin="01:34:22.754" end="01:34:27.554" style="s2">fiery sulfur soup keeps restoring his</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.054" end="01:34:27.554" style="s2">HP.</p>
<p begin="01:34:29.354" end="01:34:32.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m down here.</p>
<p begin="01:34:30.754" end="01:34:35.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What just fired was my ice shot. All</p>
<p begin="01:34:32.954" end="01:34:36.554" style="s2">right. That didn&#39;t kill it?</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.054" end="01:34:38.454" style="s2">And it can repair itself?</p>
<p begin="01:34:36.554" end="01:34:40.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It can regenerate, too.</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.454" end="01:34:42.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither of us managed to finish the</p>
<p begin="01:34:40.554" end="01:34:43.754" style="s2">other off.</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.154" end="01:34:46.154" style="s2">I&#39;ve already burned through two bowls of</p>
<p begin="01:34:43.754" end="01:34:47.254" style="s2">soup. I&#39;m taking you down today,</p>
<p begin="01:34:46.154" end="01:34:49.154" style="s2">whatever it takes.</p>
<p begin="01:34:47.254" end="01:34:51.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Current energy, 68.</p>
<p begin="01:34:49.154" end="01:34:52.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Petrification spreads too slowly.</p>
<p begin="01:34:51.154" end="01:34:54.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It could block it with its tendrils.</p>
<p begin="01:34:52.654" end="01:34:56.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It might not immobilize its body, and</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.554" end="01:34:58.154" style="s2">the harpoon can&#39;t pierce it.</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.354" end="01:34:59.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s try a psychic attack. Black</p>
<p begin="01:34:58.154" end="01:35:02.154" style="s2">shark should come in handy.</p>
<p begin="01:34:59.954" end="01:35:06.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your spirit is too low. Psychic</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.154" end="01:35:06.054" style="s2">interference went undetected.</p>
<p begin="01:35:15.354" end="01:35:18.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sandworm&#39;s mind control takes hold,</p>
<p begin="01:35:17.454" end="01:35:19.754" style="s2">halting the brain cap jellyfish&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:35:18.954" end="01:35:23.954" style="s2">regeneration.</p>
<p begin="01:35:19.754" end="01:35:23.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t patch yourself up now, can you?</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.354" end="01:35:35.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have slain the brain cap jellyfish,</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.654" end="01:35:36.654" style="s2">obtained 15 erosion cores, and rapid</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.054" end="01:35:38.354" style="s2">repair spray.</p>
<p begin="01:35:36.654" end="01:35:40.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Rapid repair spray,</p>
<p begin="01:35:38.354" end="01:35:43.054" style="s2">a purple tier tool that sprays powder to</p>
<p begin="01:35:40.654" end="01:35:45.154" style="s2">heal wounds. The worse the injury, the</p>
<p begin="01:35:43.054" end="01:35:47.654" style="s2">more powder it takes, and the slower it</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.154" end="01:35:47.654" style="s2">heals.</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.554" end="01:36:00.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still won&#39;t let me go? Why are you</p>
<p begin="01:35:59.156" end="01:36:02.856" style="s2">shaking your head?</p>
<p begin="01:36:00.055" end="01:36:07.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want jellyfish samples?</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.856" end="01:36:07.356" style="s2">Fine, you can have two. I need the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.455" end="01:36:19.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What brings you here?</p>
<p begin="01:36:17.656" end="01:36:22.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard an explosion.</p>
<p begin="01:36:19.455" end="01:36:24.756" style="s2">What did you run into down there?</p>
<p begin="01:36:22.256" end="01:36:26.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An elite jellyfish. It put up a bit of a</p>
<p begin="01:36:24.756" end="01:36:28.256" style="s2">fight. You&#39;ll definitely want to see the</p>
<p begin="01:36:26.455" end="01:36:29.356" style="s2">samples I took. I&#39;ll show you on the</p>
<p begin="01:36:28.256" end="01:36:31.356" style="s2">boat.</p>
<p begin="01:36:29.356" end="01:36:31.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A bit? Didn&#39;t sound like it from the</p>
<p begin="01:36:31.356" end="01:36:34.256" style="s2">boat.</p>
<p begin="01:36:31.856" end="01:36:37.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I won. That&#39;s what counts. Come aboard.</p>
<p begin="01:36:34.256" end="01:36:38.656" style="s2">I&#39;ll show you my loot.</p>
<p begin="01:36:37.156" end="01:36:40.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Uh.</p>
<p begin="01:36:38.656" end="01:36:40.955" style="s2">Uh.</p>
<p begin="01:36:41.555" end="01:36:44.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t you say something?</p>
<p begin="01:36:43.156" end="01:36:45.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I thought you felt more comfortable that</p>
<p begin="01:36:44.555" end="01:36:47.256" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="01:36:45.256" end="01:36:49.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Comfortable? I have some dignity, you</p>
<p begin="01:36:47.256" end="01:36:49.555" style="s2">know?</p>
<p begin="01:36:57.756" end="01:37:01.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are those samples? Let me see</p>
<p begin="01:36:59.356" end="01:37:01.555" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:37:03.756" end="01:37:08.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My last quest reward, Genetic Arts Part</p>
<p begin="01:37:06.356" end="01:37:09.856" style="s2">One. I can&#39;t learn it. See if you can</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.455" end="01:37:12.455" style="s2">use it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:09.856" end="01:37:14.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Scholar Watson. His genetic research</p>
<p begin="01:37:12.455" end="01:37:16.555" style="s2">actually worked. Jenny Watson, a</p>
<p begin="01:37:14.955" end="01:37:18.656" style="s2">geneticist from before the floating</p>
<p begin="01:37:16.555" end="01:37:20.455" style="s2">island era. I admired his research back</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.656" end="01:37:22.555" style="s2">on Pearl Island. He conducted secret</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.455" end="01:37:24.856" style="s2">experiments on Meteor Island. Then he</p>
<p begin="01:37:22.555" end="01:37:27.756" style="s2">and his student Mario both vanished.</p>
<p begin="01:37:24.856" end="01:37:29.856" style="s2">Some say the experiments failed and even</p>
<p begin="01:37:27.756" end="01:37:31.955" style="s2">Meteor Island sank. Reshuffling and</p>
<p begin="01:37:29.856" end="01:37:34.756" style="s2">fusing genes, even completely altering</p>
<p begin="01:37:31.955" end="01:37:35.856" style="s2">cell structure. He actually did it.</p>
<p begin="01:37:34.756" end="01:37:37.555" style="s2">Sadly,</p>
<p begin="01:37:35.856" end="01:37:39.756" style="s2">it&#39;s been so many years. He was an</p>
<p begin="01:37:37.555" end="01:37:40.555" style="s2">ordinary human. He must have died long</p>
<p begin="01:37:39.756" end="01:37:41.555" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="01:37:40.555" end="01:37:43.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about Mario?</p>
<p begin="01:37:41.555" end="01:37:44.256" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The letter was just an invitation.</p>
<p begin="01:37:43.256" end="01:37:45.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did he ever go?</p>
<p begin="01:37:44.256" end="01:37:46.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t he publish his mentor&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:37:45.555" end="01:37:48.555" style="s2">research?</p>
<p begin="01:37:46.555" end="01:37:49.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was never seen again either. Want to</p>
<p begin="01:37:48.555" end="01:37:50.955" style="s2">know what really happened?</p>
<p begin="01:37:49.555" end="01:37:52.856" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll probably have to find Meteor</p>
<p begin="01:37:50.955" end="01:37:54.856" style="s2">Island or the next volume of the Secret</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.856" end="01:37:57.756" style="s2">Genetic Arts. It might have records of</p>
<p begin="01:37:54.856" end="01:37:57.756" style="s2">what happened next.</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.156" end="01:38:06.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a look. What&#39;s wrong with my back?</p>
<p begin="01:38:04.757" end="01:38:08.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did it start?</p>
<p begin="01:38:06.257" end="01:38:10.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; After I went into the abyss. Those</p>
<p begin="01:38:08.156" end="01:38:12.156" style="s2">eyeballs latched onto me, but I got rid</p>
<p begin="01:38:10.457" end="01:38:13.957" style="s2">of them. It&#39;s been itching ever since I</p>
<p begin="01:38:12.156" end="01:38:15.957" style="s2">got back.</p>
<p begin="01:38:13.957" end="01:38:17.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s your erosion level now?</p>
<p begin="01:38:15.957" end="01:38:18.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 9%.</p>
<p begin="01:38:17.357" end="01:38:22.056" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:38:18.656" end="01:38:22.056" style="s2">How is it at 10 already?</p>
<p begin="01:38:23.556" end="01:38:26.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just tell me what it looks like.</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.457" end="01:38:28.757" style="s2">I can take it.</p>
<p begin="01:38:26.357" end="01:38:30.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something seems to be growing out from</p>
<p begin="01:38:28.757" end="01:38:32.757" style="s2">beneath both shoulder blades. Look on</p>
<p begin="01:38:30.857" end="01:38:33.357" style="s2">the bright side. Maybe it&#39;s a pair of</p>
<p begin="01:38:32.757" end="01:38:34.957" style="s2">wings.</p>
<p begin="01:38:33.357" end="01:38:36.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How many things in this sea have you</p>
<p begin="01:38:34.957" end="01:38:38.156" style="s2">seen with wings?</p>
<p begin="01:38:36.357" end="01:38:40.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then pray you don&#39;t grow anything too</p>
<p begin="01:38:38.156" end="01:38:40.556" style="s2">weird.</p>
<p begin="01:38:41.757" end="01:38:44.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m still cursed, and now my erosion&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:38:44.257" end="01:38:46.957" style="s2">going up.</p>
<p begin="01:38:44.957" end="01:38:47.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can someone cast greater purification on</p>
<p begin="01:38:46.957" end="01:38:49.357" style="s2">me?</p>
<p begin="01:38:47.457" end="01:38:51.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With a body that corrupted, wouldn&#39;t it</p>
<p begin="01:38:49.357" end="01:38:52.257" style="s2">purify you out of existence?</p>
<p begin="01:38:51.257" end="01:38:55.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:38:52.257" end="01:38:55.156" style="s2">Just give me a minute.</p>
<p begin="01:38:56.357" end="01:38:59.957" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re well preserved.</p>
<p begin="01:38:57.957" end="01:39:03.156" style="s2">With enough nutrients, they might grow</p>
<p begin="01:38:59.957" end="01:39:03.156" style="s2">into giant jellyfish.</p>
<p begin="01:39:06.257" end="01:39:09.457" style="s2">We can&#39;t afford to raise this many yet.</p>
<p begin="01:39:08.257" end="01:39:12.757" style="s2">Once we can,</p>
<p begin="01:39:09.457" end="01:39:12.757" style="s2">we&#39;ll start with one or two.</p>
<p begin="01:39:15.257" end="01:39:18.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smells amazing.</p>
<p begin="01:39:16.556" end="01:39:19.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Butter meat really is the right name.</p>
<p begin="01:39:18.156" end="01:39:20.757" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Aren&#39;t you worried eating it will raise</p>
<p begin="01:39:19.656" end="01:39:24.857" style="s2">your erosion again?</p>
<p begin="01:39:20.757" end="01:39:24.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Food first. I&#39;ll worry about that later.</p>
<p begin="01:39:29.257" end="01:39:33.257" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re almost out of rainwater. Just that</p>
<p begin="01:39:31.257" end="01:39:35.357" style="s2">bucket of fresh water left.</p>
<p begin="01:39:33.257" end="01:39:37.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then water comes first tonight. We&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="01:39:35.357" end="01:39:38.857" style="s2">got to keep ourselves fed.</p>
<p begin="01:39:37.156" end="01:39:40.556" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 2 hours left.</p>
<p begin="01:39:38.857" end="01:39:42.857" style="s2">We&#39;ll have to look in there for water</p>
<p begin="01:39:40.556" end="01:39:45.857" style="s2">and island building materials.</p>
<p begin="01:39:42.857" end="01:39:48.357" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t have athlete&#39;s foot, do you?</p>
<p begin="01:39:45.857" end="01:39:51.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up and sleep, or I&#39;ll kill you in</p>
<p begin="01:39:48.357" end="01:39:51.156" style="s2">your dreams.</p>
<p begin="01:39:51.257" end="01:39:54.857" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll clear four inventory slots. You</p>
<p begin="01:39:53.257" end="01:39:56.457" style="s2">clear six.</p>
<p begin="01:39:54.857" end="01:39:57.457" style="s2">We need room for any good loot we find</p>
<p begin="01:39:56.457" end="01:39:58.556" style="s2">in there.</p>
<p begin="01:39:57.457" end="01:40:01.457" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="01:39:58.556" end="01:40:04.656" style="s2">Let&#39;s find a way in first.</p>
<p begin="01:40:01.457" end="01:40:04.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see if we can get in</p>
<p begin="01:40:13.058" end="01:40:15.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; where you used to live?</p>
<p begin="01:40:14.658" end="01:40:17.858" style="s2">It&#39;s pretty small.</p>
<p begin="01:40:15.858" end="01:40:20.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lan Lan, smaller means cheaper.</p>
<p begin="01:40:17.858" end="01:40:23.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, are you part of my dream or real?</p>
<p begin="01:40:20.958" end="01:40:23.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you think?</p>
<p begin="01:40:26.258" end="01:40:29.258" style="s2">Why don&#39;t your parents have faces in</p>
<p begin="01:40:27.958" end="01:40:32.258" style="s2">your dream?</p>
<p begin="01:40:29.258" end="01:40:33.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe because it&#39;s a dream.</p>
<p begin="01:40:32.258" end="01:40:35.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:40:33.258" end="01:40:36.658" style="s2">Why did the door open in the floor?</p>
<p begin="01:40:35.358" end="01:40:38.858" style="s2">Couldn&#39;t it be on the wall?</p>
<p begin="01:40:36.658" end="01:40:41.258" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s your dream. Just tilt the floor</p>
<p begin="01:40:38.858" end="01:40:41.258" style="s2">upright.</p>
<p begin="01:40:48.758" end="01:40:52.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Woah, I barely touched it.</p>
<p begin="01:40:54.458" end="01:40:57.658" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like they&#39;re messing with you.</p>
<p begin="01:41:02.058" end="01:41:05.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Surely the dream realm is more than an</p>
<p begin="01:41:04.258" end="01:41:07.158" style="s2">empty well.</p>
<p begin="01:41:05.358" end="01:41:09.358" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too deep to see anything down</p>
<p begin="01:41:07.158" end="01:41:09.358" style="s2">there.</p>
<p begin="01:41:12.058" end="01:41:17.658" style="s2">Something&#39;s moving. Stand back.</p>
<p begin="01:41:15.358" end="01:41:18.858" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome to the dream realm. Enter under</p>
<p begin="01:41:17.658" end="01:41:21.058" style="s2">your existing name.</p>
<p begin="01:41:18.858" end="01:41:21.058" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:41:22.058" end="01:41:27.258" style="s2">It really did split us up. I&#39;ll use a</p>
<p begin="01:41:24.358" end="01:41:27.258" style="s2">different name to get in.</p>
<p begin="01:41:27.958" end="01:41:33.858" style="s2">You selected the username Broma.</p>
<p begin="01:41:30.658" end="01:41:33.858" style="s2">Welcome, challenger.</p>
<p begin="01:41:38.958" end="01:41:43.958" style="s2">This batch is pretty weird too.</p>
<p begin="01:41:41.558" end="01:41:45.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I barely stocked up today.</p>
<p begin="01:41:43.958" end="01:41:46.758" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There wasn&#39;t enough time.</p>
<p begin="01:41:45.458" end="01:41:48.958" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s Arnold from next door?</p>
<p begin="01:41:46.758" end="01:41:50.558" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His shop&#39;s been closed this whole time.</p>
<p begin="01:41:48.958" end="01:41:52.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows?</p>
<p begin="01:41:50.558" end="01:41:54.358" style="s2">They don&#39;t seem like challengers.</p>
<p begin="01:41:52.458" end="01:41:57.458" style="s2">Opening this early probably threw off</p>
<p begin="01:41:54.358" end="01:41:57.458" style="s2">their restocking plans.</p>
<p begin="01:42:05.358" end="01:42:07.458" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Broma.</p>
<p begin="01:42:06.458" end="01:42:07.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you talking to me?</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.458" end="01:42:11.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sorry</p>
<p begin="01:42:07.759" end="01:42:11.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; in advance if I&#39;ve got the wrong person.</p>
<p begin="01:42:12.059" end="01:42:15.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which Broma are you looking for?</p>
<p begin="01:42:14.259" end="01:42:16.159" style="s2">Luo Luo?</p>
<p begin="01:42:15.359" end="01:42:17.959" style="s2">Is that you?</p>
<p begin="01:42:16.159" end="01:42:19.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is you. I thought I&#39;d got the wrong</p>
<p begin="01:42:17.959" end="01:42:19.659" style="s2">person again.</p>
<p begin="01:42:19.059" end="01:42:22.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Broma.</p>
<p begin="01:42:19.659" end="01:42:25.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yep, it&#39;s me. I ran into a few people</p>
<p begin="01:42:22.159" end="01:42:27.259" style="s2">called Big Broma and Old Broma. I kept</p>
<p begin="01:42:25.259" end="01:42:28.559" style="s2">saying hi to the wrong people. So</p>
<p begin="01:42:27.259" end="01:42:30.459" style="s2">embarrassing.</p>
<p begin="01:42:28.559" end="01:42:32.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the way, know any good places to eat</p>
<p begin="01:42:30.459" end="01:42:33.459" style="s2">around here? Where&#39;s that older girl</p>
<p begin="01:42:32.359" end="01:42:34.959" style="s2">from your island?</p>
<p begin="01:42:33.459" end="01:42:37.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or is she younger than me?</p>
<p begin="01:42:34.959" end="01:42:39.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lan Lan? She&#39;s probably older than you.</p>
<p begin="01:42:37.659" end="01:42:40.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The system split us up. I still don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:42:39.759" end="01:42:42.659" style="s2">know where he is.</p>
<p begin="01:42:40.759" end="01:42:45.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mind if I help you look for Lan?</p>
<p begin="01:42:42.659" end="01:42:46.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sure. Come along.</p>
<p begin="01:42:45.359" end="01:42:48.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By the way,</p>
<p begin="01:42:46.559" end="01:42:50.159" style="s2">what&#39;s that long line for?</p>
<p begin="01:42:48.059" end="01:42:52.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the exchange. You trade items for</p>
<p begin="01:42:50.159" end="01:42:56.959" style="s2">island coins. The local shops only take</p>
<p begin="01:42:52.759" end="01:42:58.759" style="s2">island coins, not our items or supplies.</p>
<p begin="01:42:56.959" end="01:43:00.759" style="s2">Short on coins? They&#39;ll appraise your</p>
<p begin="01:42:58.759" end="01:43:02.959" style="s2">items and pay you. Here, let me show</p>
<p begin="01:43:00.759" end="01:43:02.959" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:43:06.359" end="01:43:09.459" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:43:07.359" end="01:43:10.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not happy to see me?</p>
<p begin="01:43:09.459" end="01:43:11.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Why?</p>
<p begin="01:43:10.859" end="01:43:14.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I</p>
<p begin="01:43:11.859" end="01:43:15.759" style="s2">You must be Lan. Wow, you&#39;re just as</p>
<p begin="01:43:14.559" end="01:43:16.559" style="s2">pretty as I imagined.</p>
<p begin="01:43:15.759" end="01:43:19.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister-in-law.</p>
<p begin="01:43:16.559" end="01:43:20.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sorry. Lan, I&#39;m Luo Luo. I made all</p>
<p begin="01:43:19.559" end="01:43:22.859" style="s2">your clothes.</p>
<p begin="01:43:20.959" end="01:43:25.659" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Could you let go first?</p>
<p begin="01:43:22.859" end="01:43:27.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, sorry. I got carried away.</p>
<p begin="01:43:25.659" end="01:43:29.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for the clothes.</p>
<p begin="01:43:27.359" end="01:43:30.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s all go together then.</p>
<p begin="01:43:29.359" end="01:43:33.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right. We were going to the exchange.</p>
<p begin="01:43:30.959" end="01:43:33.559" style="s2">Come with us.</p>
<p begin="01:43:34.259" end="01:43:37.459" style="s2">Someone tried to steal the money.</p>
<p begin="01:43:35.759" end="01:43:39.759" style="s2">They&#39;re still locked up over there. This</p>
<p begin="01:43:37.459" end="01:43:41.359" style="s2">is Dream Taper territory. Robbing them</p>
<p begin="01:43:39.759" end="01:43:42.659" style="s2">is no easy feat.</p>
<p begin="01:43:41.359" end="01:43:44.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re so cute.</p>
<p begin="01:43:42.659" end="01:43:46.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re spirit creatures too, right?</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.759" end="01:43:47.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t you need any island coins?</p>
<p begin="01:43:46.359" end="01:43:49.359" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s a long wait.</p>
<p begin="01:43:47.859" end="01:43:51.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve got enough for now.</p>
<p begin="01:43:49.359" end="01:43:53.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are all nine streets the same? Have you</p>
<p begin="01:43:51.859" end="01:43:55.559" style="s2">checked out the others?</p>
<p begin="01:43:53.559" end="01:43:57.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. I came from Third Street and stopped</p>
<p begin="01:43:55.559" end="01:43:58.459" style="s2">here for a rest. You?</p>
<p begin="01:43:57.059" end="01:43:59.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came from Fifth Street.</p>
<p begin="01:43:58.459" end="01:44:02.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sixth Street.</p>
<p begin="01:43:59.759" end="01:44:03.059" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s check out First Street then.</p>
<p begin="01:44:02.059" end="01:44:05.159" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, right.</p>
<p begin="01:44:03.059" end="01:44:07.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How&#39;d you end up in East Square too?</p>
<p begin="01:44:05.159" end="01:44:09.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came looking for you. Recognize this?</p>
<p begin="01:44:07.759" end="01:44:11.361" style="s2">The star you threw into the well. When I</p>
<p begin="01:44:09.559" end="01:44:13.261" style="s2">got here, it appeared in my hand and</p>
<p begin="01:44:11.361" end="01:44:14.861" style="s2">became a tracker. I followed it and</p>
<p begin="01:44:13.261" end="01:44:16.161" style="s2">found you guys in the square.</p>
<p begin="01:44:14.861" end="01:44:18.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I guess getting hit wasn&#39;t for</p>
<p begin="01:44:16.161" end="01:44:18.561" style="s2">nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:44:21.161" end="01:44:23.661" style="s2">Do you have any rare soil or ingredients</p>
<p begin="01:44:23.061" end="01:44:25.961" style="s2">here?</p>
<p begin="01:44:23.661" end="01:44:28.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honey, do we have much in stock?</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.961" end="01:44:30.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course we do. Do you have any idea</p>
<p begin="01:44:28.361" end="01:44:33.061" style="s2">how long I&#39;ve been working today?</p>
<p begin="01:44:30.761" end="01:44:34.761" style="s2">Clay has a strong adhesive quality, so</p>
<p begin="01:44:33.061" end="01:44:37.061" style="s2">it&#39;s good for molding things. Gray</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.761" end="01:44:40.061" style="s2">fungus mud is rich in fungi and consists</p>
<p begin="01:44:37.061" end="01:44:41.261" style="s2">entirely of rare soil. Moon rock can be</p>
<p begin="01:44:40.061" end="01:44:42.961" style="s2">used to make special items or</p>
<p begin="01:44:41.261" end="01:44:44.761" style="s2">decorations. Hantosite contains the</p>
<p begin="01:44:42.961" end="01:44:46.561" style="s2">essences of five different creatures.</p>
<p begin="01:44:44.761" end="01:44:47.861" style="s2">They&#39;re all rare ingredients. Pick</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.561" end="01:44:48.961" style="s2">whatever you like.</p>
<p begin="01:44:47.861" end="01:44:50.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you buying?</p>
<p begin="01:44:48.961" end="01:44:52.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t really need soil, but I&#39;d like</p>
<p begin="01:44:50.861" end="01:44:55.361" style="s2">to buy the stones.</p>
<p begin="01:44:52.761" end="01:44:57.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much for everything?</p>
<p begin="01:44:55.361" end="01:45:00.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;ll be 3,000 Dow coins.</p>
<p begin="01:44:57.461" end="01:45:00.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take them all.</p>
<p begin="01:45:01.961" end="01:45:06.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How decisive. What about you, miss?</p>
<p begin="01:45:05.061" end="01:45:09.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll take another batch of these four</p>
<p begin="01:45:06.461" end="01:45:09.261" style="s2">kinds of stone.</p>
<p begin="01:45:09.687" end="01:45:11.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:45:09.961" end="01:45:12.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You need all four kinds to reach level</p>
<p begin="01:45:11.461" end="01:45:14.261" style="s2">three too, right?</p>
<p begin="01:45:12.561" end="01:45:16.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Huh?</p>
<p begin="01:45:14.261" end="01:45:17.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he your brother? He&#39;s really good to</p>
<p begin="01:45:16.061" end="01:45:19.361" style="s2">you. That&#39;s my brother-in-law, and the</p>
<p begin="01:45:17.761" end="01:45:20.961" style="s2">woman behind him is my sister.</p>
<p begin="01:45:19.361" end="01:45:21.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s talking nonsense. We&#39;re just</p>
<p begin="01:45:20.961" end="01:45:23.161" style="s2">friends.</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.561" end="01:45:24.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it. Got it. Here&#39;s our family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:45:23.161" end="01:45:26.361" style="s2">trade certificate. Come visit Iron</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.961" end="01:45:27.461" style="s2">Shield Island sometime, bro.</p>
<p begin="01:45:26.361" end="01:45:29.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll give you something in exchange for</p>
<p begin="01:45:27.461" end="01:45:32.261" style="s2">those 1,200 Island coins from earlier.</p>
<p begin="01:45:29.861" end="01:45:32.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:45:36.361" end="01:45:41.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have to stake body parts.</p>
<p begin="01:45:38.261" end="01:45:43.461" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cancel it. Cancel the trade.</p>
<p begin="01:45:41.061" end="01:45:44.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know. I&#39;ll choose first. Hurry,</p>
<p begin="01:45:43.461" end="01:45:45.861" style="s2">just one finger.</p>
<p begin="01:45:44.661" end="01:45:48.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I picked one first.</p>
<p begin="01:45:45.861" end="01:45:52.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; System, I stake my left hand.</p>
<p begin="01:45:48.261" end="01:45:52.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; System, I&#39;ll stake my left hand too.</p>
<p begin="01:45:54.461" end="01:45:58.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Randomly lose one hand.</p>
<p begin="01:45:56.261" end="01:45:59.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All attributes reduced. Three, offer</p>
<p begin="01:45:58.561" end="01:46:01.861" style="s2">everything you have.</p>
<p begin="01:45:59.661" end="01:46:05.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re literally gambling with our lives.</p>
<p begin="01:46:01.861" end="01:46:06.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sister Lan, Lolo, what&#39;s your luck stat?</p>
<p begin="01:46:05.361" end="01:46:08.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 20. Why?</p>
<p begin="01:46:06.861" end="01:46:11.161" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 20.</p>
<p begin="01:46:08.061" end="01:46:12.061" style="s2">Mine&#39;s only 1.6. His is almost 13 times</p>
<p begin="01:46:11.161" end="01:46:12.962" style="s2">higher than mine.</p>
<p begin="01:46:12.061" end="01:46:13.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your luck stat is</p>
<p begin="01:46:12.962" end="01:46:14.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; high.</p>
<p begin="01:46:13.462" end="01:46:17.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep it together for now.</p>
<p begin="01:46:14.863" end="01:46:17.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait for him to stop.</p>
<p begin="01:46:18.863" end="01:46:24.462" style="s2">Yes. Great.</p>
<p begin="01:46:20.863" end="01:46:24.462" style="s2">All right, let&#39;s see what you won.</p>
<p begin="01:46:27.562" end="01:46:29.962" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:46:30.162" end="01:46:33.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly was drained from them?</p>
<p begin="01:46:31.962" end="01:46:34.363" style="s2">Those aren&#39;t their real bodies. This is</p>
<p begin="01:46:33.562" end="01:46:35.662" style="s2">a dream.</p>
<p begin="01:46:34.363" end="01:46:37.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How could they have physical bodies</p>
<p begin="01:46:35.662" end="01:46:39.162" style="s2">here? Part of his soul was drained away.</p>
<p begin="01:46:37.562" end="01:46:41.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there any way to heal a soul?</p>
<p begin="01:46:39.162" end="01:46:42.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know much about it. Maybe we can</p>
<p begin="01:46:41.162" end="01:46:45.062" style="s2">find something here. The shopkeepers</p>
<p begin="01:46:42.962" end="01:46:47.262" style="s2">must see this all the time. They surely</p>
<p begin="01:46:45.062" end="01:46:49.262" style="s2">cash in by selling soul remedies.</p>
<p begin="01:46:47.262" end="01:46:50.662" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got any medicine that heals souls?</p>
<p begin="01:46:49.262" end="01:46:52.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was here first.</p>
<p begin="01:46:50.662" end="01:46:53.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t you see I got here first?</p>
<p begin="01:46:52.363" end="01:46:56.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="01:46:53.562" end="01:46:57.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, don&#39;t fight. I&#39;ve got more.</p>
<p begin="01:46:56.162" end="01:46:58.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, whoops. Looks like there&#39;s only one</p>
<p begin="01:46:57.962" end="01:47:00.162" style="s2">of these left.</p>
<p begin="01:46:58.762" end="01:47:02.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:47:00.162" end="01:47:04.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brawl detected. Thousand Hand Master and</p>
<p begin="01:47:02.462" end="01:47:06.262" style="s2">Giant Bull will enter the arena in 10</p>
<p begin="01:47:04.363" end="01:47:08.662" style="s2">minutes and force truce until the match</p>
<p begin="01:47:06.262" end="01:47:11.162" style="s2">begins. Betting is now open. Each vote</p>
<p begin="01:47:08.662" end="01:47:13.062" style="s2">costs 100 Island coins. If the favorite</p>
<p begin="01:47:11.162" end="01:47:15.762" style="s2">wins, bets on them only return the</p>
<p begin="01:47:13.062" end="01:47:17.962" style="s2">stake. If the underdog wins, every 100</p>
<p begin="01:47:15.762" end="01:47:20.062" style="s2">vote gap pays an extra multiple of your</p>
<p begin="01:47:17.962" end="01:47:21.863" style="s2">stake. Losing bets are forfeited.</p>
<p begin="01:47:20.062" end="01:47:23.762" style="s2">Betting closes when the match starts.</p>
<p begin="01:47:21.863" end="01:47:25.062" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His soul is damaged. He needs medicine</p>
<p begin="01:47:23.762" end="01:47:26.962" style="s2">now. Do you have any?</p>
<p begin="01:47:25.062" end="01:47:29.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the rush? Wait until the match is</p>
<p begin="01:47:26.962" end="01:47:30.562" style="s2">over. I know where to get it.</p>
<p begin="01:47:29.262" end="01:47:32.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You expect us to wait?</p>
<p begin="01:47:30.562" end="01:47:34.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll ask my contacts. Watch Luo Luo.</p>
<p begin="01:47:32.863" end="01:47:36.863" style="s2">Don&#39;t let her make any more trades.</p>
<p begin="01:47:34.562" end="01:47:38.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Urgently need medicine to heal a soul.</p>
<p begin="01:47:36.863" end="01:47:39.962" style="s2">Message me with any leads.</p>
<p begin="01:47:38.262" end="01:47:41.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Giant Bull is clearly the better</p>
<p begin="01:47:39.962" end="01:47:42.662" style="s2">fighter. Why is anyone betting on</p>
<p begin="01:47:41.462" end="01:47:43.863" style="s2">Thousand Hand Master?</p>
<p begin="01:47:42.662" end="01:47:45.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the point if everyone bets on</p>
<p begin="01:47:43.863" end="01:47:47.363" style="s2">Giant Bull? You&#39;d only get your stake</p>
<p begin="01:47:45.562" end="01:47:47.762" style="s2">back. Isn&#39;t that the same as having no</p>
<p begin="01:47:47.363" end="01:47:50.062" style="s2">head?</p>
<p begin="01:47:47.762" end="01:47:51.962" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bro, I haven&#39;t voted yet. That Giant</p>
<p begin="01:47:50.062" end="01:47:53.562" style="s2">Bull looks like a real powerhouse. Vote</p>
<p begin="01:47:51.962" end="01:47:54.462" style="s2">for him. He&#39;s a sure bet.</p>
<p begin="01:47:53.562" end="01:47:56.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:47:54.462" end="01:47:59.062" style="s2">So did you vote for him?</p>
<p begin="01:47:56.162" end="01:48:01.562" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? I voted for Giant Bull, too. Would</p>
<p begin="01:47:59.062" end="01:48:03.363" style="s2">I lie to you, bro?</p>
<p begin="01:48:01.562" end="01:48:04.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Navigate me to Taiwan Road.</p>
<p begin="01:48:03.363" end="01:48:05.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It should be fine if I don&#39;t vote,</p>
<p begin="01:48:04.762" end="01:48:06.562" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="01:48:05.162" end="01:48:07.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe there&#39;ll be a penalty for not</p>
<p begin="01:48:06.562" end="01:48:09.462" style="s2">voting.</p>
<p begin="01:48:07.162" end="01:48:11.262" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100 Island coins buys one vote. You</p>
<p begin="01:48:09.462" end="01:48:12.363" style="s2">might as well vote for Giant Bull.</p>
<p begin="01:48:11.262" end="01:48:14.462" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should I vote or not?</p>
<p begin="01:48:12.363" end="01:48:16.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make that decision for me. You can</p>
<p begin="01:48:14.462" end="01:48:18.364" style="s2">wait for your own punishment.</p>
<p begin="01:48:16.063" end="01:48:20.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Voting is about to close.</p>
<p begin="01:48:18.364" end="01:48:22.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Master Senju, one vote per person.</p>
<p begin="01:48:20.964" end="01:48:22.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like you&#39;re sure Master Senju will</p>
<p begin="01:48:22.364" end="01:48:24.763" style="s2">win.</p>
<p begin="01:48:22.964" end="01:48:26.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only our shall side stands to gain.</p>
<p begin="01:48:24.763" end="01:48:28.263" style="s2">They&#39;ll find a way to help. Give each of</p>
<p begin="01:48:26.364" end="01:48:29.663" style="s2">the three contestants one vote first,</p>
<p begin="01:48:28.263" end="01:48:31.163" style="s2">just in case there really is a penalty.</p>
<p begin="01:48:29.663" end="01:48:33.364" style="s2">If you want to take it from me, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="01:48:31.163" end="01:48:35.263" style="s2">keep it. Voting is closed. Master Senju</p>
<p begin="01:48:33.364" end="01:48:38.163" style="s2">received 7,678</p>
<p begin="01:48:35.263" end="01:48:40.063" style="s2">votes, and Giant Bull received 10,990</p>
<p begin="01:48:38.163" end="01:48:41.964" style="s2">This is a death match. It ends only when</p>
<p begin="01:48:40.063" end="01:48:43.663" style="s2">one side dies. There are no restrictions</p>
<p begin="01:48:41.964" end="01:48:44.063" style="s2">on items or skills, and outside help is</p>
<p begin="01:48:43.663" end="01:48:46.364" style="s2">allowed.</p>
<p begin="01:48:44.063" end="01:48:48.263" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A death match? Even in a dream, you</p>
<p begin="01:48:46.364" end="01:48:49.464" style="s2">still have to risk your life.</p>
<p begin="01:48:48.263" end="01:48:51.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WAIT, HOLD ON.</p>
<p begin="01:48:49.464" end="01:48:53.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; OUT OF the way, not</p>
<p begin="01:48:51.464" end="01:48:55.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Giant Bull&#39;s HP is 91 out of 100.</p>
<p begin="01:48:53.864" end="01:48:56.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those hands are just after images. He&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:48:55.763" end="01:49:00.563" style="s2">moving too fast.</p>
<p begin="01:48:56.964" end="01:49:00.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GET YOUR ASS DOWN HERE.</p>
<p begin="01:49:00.763" end="01:49:07.263" style="s2">ALL YOU CAN DO IS PULL CHEAP TRICKS.</p>
<p begin="01:49:03.864" end="01:49:09.763" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TAKE THIS FROG SWORD.</p>
<p begin="01:49:07.263" end="01:49:10.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP RIGHT THERE. GIANT BULL&#39;S HP is 69</p>
<p begin="01:49:09.763" end="01:49:12.964" style="s2">out of 100.</p>
<p begin="01:49:10.663" end="01:49:12.964" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:49:14.005" end="01:49:16.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:49:16.163" end="01:49:19.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stacy from Pearl Island.</p>
<p begin="01:49:17.364" end="01:49:20.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He must have been to Pearl Island.</p>
<p begin="01:49:19.163" end="01:49:21.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the point of that background?</p>
<p begin="01:49:20.563" end="01:49:23.964" style="s2">Damn it.</p>
<p begin="01:49:21.464" end="01:49:26.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh no, Master Senju is immobilized. That</p>
<p begin="01:49:23.964" end="01:49:28.063" style="s2">control skill can even drain his HP.</p>
<p begin="01:49:26.063" end="01:49:29.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, how do we use outside help?</p>
<p begin="01:49:28.063" end="01:49:31.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, guys over there.</p>
<p begin="01:49:29.663" end="01:49:33.864" style="s2">I can use outside assistance on your</p>
<p begin="01:49:31.464" end="01:49:34.864" style="s2">behalf.</p>
<p begin="01:49:33.864" end="01:49:36.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the catch?</p>
<p begin="01:49:34.864" end="01:49:38.663" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just have to buy one thing from me.</p>
<p begin="01:49:36.864" end="01:49:39.464" style="s2">Then I&#39;ll throw the item to Master</p>
<p begin="01:49:38.663" end="01:49:41.364" style="s2">Senju.</p>
<p begin="01:49:39.464" end="01:49:42.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have to pay to help him too.</p>
<p begin="01:49:41.364" end="01:49:44.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve [clears throat] already invested</p>
<p begin="01:49:42.464" end="01:49:45.163" style="s2">quite a bit, haven&#39;t you? He&#39;s about to</p>
<p begin="01:49:44.364" end="01:49:47.163" style="s2">lose.</p>
<p begin="01:49:45.163" end="01:49:48.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want to help, buy something</p>
<p begin="01:49:47.163" end="01:49:49.964" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="01:49:48.563" end="01:49:52.563" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want us to buy?</p>
<p begin="01:49:49.964" end="01:49:54.864" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t worry. I won&#39;t rip you off. It&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:49:52.563" end="01:49:56.964" style="s2">only 3,000. There are five of you.</p>
<p begin="01:49:54.864" end="01:50:00.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s only 600 each.</p>
<p begin="01:49:56.964" end="01:50:00.464" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quite a bargain, right?</p>
<p begin="01:50:00.763" end="01:50:06.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you sure the item will help him win?</p>
<p begin="01:50:02.763" end="01:50:06.364" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never cheat my customers.</p>
<p begin="01:50:10.364" end="01:50:16.063" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right, just wait and see. Can one</p>
<p begin="01:50:12.563" end="01:50:16.063" style="s2">helmet really turn the tide?</p>
<p begin="01:50:21.465" end="01:50:26.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the hell OUT OF MY WAY.</p>
<p begin="01:50:24.365" end="01:50:29.265" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flying insects are what Bai Qing fears</p>
<p begin="01:50:26.765" end="01:50:31.865" style="s2">most. This item was practically made to</p>
<p begin="01:50:29.265" end="01:50:31.865" style="s2">counter it.</p>
<p begin="01:50:34.165" end="01:50:37.365" style="s2">Bai Qing will abandon him.</p>
<p begin="01:50:42.165" end="01:50:45.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He can win. What if someone else helps</p>
<p begin="01:50:44.465" end="01:50:48.265" style="s2">the giant bull too?</p>
<p begin="01:50:45.765" end="01:50:49.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who would waste money on the giant bull?</p>
<p begin="01:50:48.265" end="01:50:52.165" style="s2">Even if he wins, there won&#39;t be any</p>
<p begin="01:50:49.965" end="01:50:53.565" style="s2">profit. Spending money on him would just</p>
<p begin="01:50:52.165" end="01:50:57.865" style="s2">be throwing it away.</p>
<p begin="01:50:53.565" end="01:50:57.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The voting payouts are being calculated.</p>
<p begin="01:51:00.465" end="01:51:03.065" style="s2">What about your side?</p>
<p begin="01:51:01.365" end="01:51:05.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who who knows whether he stole that Bai</p>
<p begin="01:51:03.065" end="01:51:06.665" style="s2">Qing or took it by force. If he took it</p>
<p begin="01:51:05.465" end="01:51:08.365" style="s2">by force,</p>
<p begin="01:51:06.665" end="01:51:11.265" style="s2">I only regret that I wasn&#39;t the one</p>
<p begin="01:51:08.365" end="01:51:11.265" style="s2">fighting him up there.</p>
<p begin="01:51:11.865" end="01:51:14.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, weren&#39;t you looking to buy</p>
<p begin="01:51:13.365" end="01:51:17.365" style="s2">something earlier? Before the match</p>
<p begin="01:51:14.965" end="01:51:17.365" style="s2">started.</p>
<p begin="01:51:21.165" end="01:51:25.565" style="s2">Here you go. It&#39;s yours now.</p>
<p begin="01:51:23.965" end="01:51:28.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember when he was competing against</p>
<p begin="01:51:25.565" end="01:51:30.365" style="s2">that giant bull earlier. He clearly</p>
<p begin="01:51:28.765" end="01:51:31.465" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you trying to get yourself killed?</p>
<p begin="01:51:30.365" end="01:51:32.865" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shut up.</p>
<p begin="01:51:31.465" end="01:51:34.365" style="s2">Let&#39;s go to another street.</p>
<p begin="01:51:32.865" end="01:51:35.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The helmet&#39;s off, but he&#39;s still under</p>
<p begin="01:51:34.365" end="01:51:37.765" style="s2">control. That thing may have had another</p>
<p begin="01:51:35.765" end="01:51:38.965" style="s2">trick up its sleeve. It even drained the</p>
<p begin="01:51:37.765" end="01:51:40.865" style="s2">money he just won.</p>
<p begin="01:51:38.965" end="01:51:42.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sir, are you still looking for a soul</p>
<p begin="01:51:40.865" end="01:51:43.565" style="s2">healing potion?</p>
<p begin="01:51:42.165" end="01:51:45.565" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh?</p>
<p begin="01:51:43.565" end="01:51:47.365" style="s2">You really look just like a friend of</p>
<p begin="01:51:45.565" end="01:51:49.365" style="s2">mine.</p>
<p begin="01:51:47.365" end="01:51:51.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You sure we&#39;re friends?</p>
<p begin="01:51:49.365" end="01:51:54.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You made quite a bit. At least tens of</p>
<p begin="01:51:51.765" end="01:51:55.765" style="s2">thousands in one night, right? Or maybe</p>
<p begin="01:51:54.165" end="01:51:58.165" style="s2">hundreds of thousands.</p>
<p begin="01:51:55.765" end="01:52:00.265" style="s2">Or did you put all your money into it?</p>
<p begin="01:51:58.165" end="01:52:01.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you talking about? I just run a</p>
<p begin="01:52:00.265" end="01:52:04.165" style="s2">shop on this island.</p>
<p begin="01:52:01.965" end="01:52:05.965" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How respectable. So many votes suddenly</p>
<p begin="01:52:04.165" end="01:52:07.265" style="s2">appeared in the final minute. Some of</p>
<p begin="01:52:05.965" end="01:52:09.065" style="s2">those must have come from honest</p>
<p begin="01:52:07.265" end="01:52:12.765" style="s2">businessmen like you. How many did you</p>
<p begin="01:52:09.065" end="01:52:15.365" style="s2">put in? 200? 500? Or 1,000?</p>
<p begin="01:52:12.765" end="01:52:16.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, business is all about money coming</p>
<p begin="01:52:15.365" end="01:52:18.765" style="s2">in and going out.</p>
<p begin="01:52:16.765" end="01:52:20.165" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I haven&#39;t seen you put anything in yet.</p>
<p begin="01:52:18.765" end="01:52:20.966" style="s2">Show me that soul healing medicine of</p>
<p begin="01:52:20.165" end="01:52:22.366" style="s2">yours.</p>
<p begin="01:52:20.966" end="01:52:24.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That thousand-hand master didn&#39;t look</p>
<p begin="01:52:22.366" end="01:52:25.566" style="s2">very strong, but he won and even got</p>
<p begin="01:52:24.766" end="01:52:26.966" style="s2">purple gear.</p>
<p begin="01:52:25.566" end="01:52:28.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I could fight around too.</p>
<p begin="01:52:26.966" end="01:52:32.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Didn&#39;t you see him still taking orders</p>
<p begin="01:52:28.666" end="01:52:32.466" style="s2">from that shopkeeper after he came out?</p>
<p begin="01:52:32.766" end="01:52:36.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; fun&#39;s just getting started. not stick</p>
<p begin="01:52:35.366" end="01:52:38.466" style="s2">around and watch?</p>
<p begin="01:52:36.766" end="01:52:39.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; not here to watch the show with you.</p>
<p begin="01:52:38.466" end="01:52:40.566" style="s2">Sell me the medicine or tell me where to</p>
<p begin="01:52:39.966" end="01:52:42.466" style="s2">buy it.</p>
<p begin="01:52:40.566" end="01:52:44.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you afraid of? Didn&#39;t you see</p>
<p begin="01:52:42.466" end="01:52:46.366" style="s2">how the thousand-hand master got helped</p>
<p begin="01:52:44.166" end="01:52:47.166" style="s2">too? If you win, do you know how much we</p>
<p begin="01:52:46.366" end="01:52:47.966" style="s2">could make?</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.166" end="01:52:49.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why me?</p>
<p begin="01:52:47.966" end="01:52:51.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look weaker than he did. No one will</p>
<p begin="01:52:49.666" end="01:52:52.766" style="s2">bet on you to win. Then when you win,</p>
<p begin="01:52:51.666" end="01:52:54.366" style="s2">our bet will double.</p>
<p begin="01:52:52.766" end="01:52:55.466" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t do it now, someone else</p>
<p begin="01:52:54.366" end="01:52:56.866" style="s2">will get there first.</p>
<p begin="01:52:55.466" end="01:52:58.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, hey, hey.</p>
<p begin="01:52:56.866" end="01:53:00.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Damn. You didn&#39;t even manage to bump</p>
<p begin="01:52:58.866" end="01:53:02.166" style="s2">into him. What a rookie.</p>
<p begin="01:53:00.966" end="01:53:04.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop hiding.</p>
<p begin="01:53:02.166" end="01:53:05.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pretty good at staging accidents.</p>
<p begin="01:53:04.066" end="01:53:06.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yo.</p>
<p begin="01:53:05.166" end="01:53:08.966" style="s2">Where do you think you&#39;re going?</p>
<p begin="01:53:06.766" end="01:53:11.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not buying anything anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:53:08.966" end="01:53:13.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m so sorry. Our companion didn&#39;t mean</p>
<p begin="01:53:11.266" end="01:53:14.066" style="s2">to do that. He&#39;s got a bit of a problem</p>
<p begin="01:53:13.366" end="01:53:15.766" style="s2">up here.</p>
<p begin="01:53:14.066" end="01:53:16.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You pervert. HOW CAN YOU JUST TOUCH ME</p>
<p begin="01:53:15.766" end="01:53:17.366" style="s2">LIKE THAT?</p>
<p begin="01:53:16.366" end="01:53:17.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I CAME OVER TO TALK to you in good</p>
<p begin="01:53:17.366" end="01:53:19.566" style="s2">faith.</p>
<p begin="01:53:17.766" end="01:53:20.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You talk a good game, but your hands</p>
<p begin="01:53:19.566" end="01:53:22.166" style="s2">never stopped.</p>
<p begin="01:53:20.366" end="01:53:22.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to keep going?</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.166" end="01:53:24.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was wrong.</p>
<p begin="01:53:22.666" end="01:53:24.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They didn&#39;t fight back, so the arena</p>
<p begin="01:53:24.166" end="01:53:26.066" style="s2">wasn&#39;t triggered.</p>
<p begin="01:53:24.866" end="01:53:26.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trying to drag me into the arena by</p>
<p begin="01:53:26.066" end="01:53:29.166" style="s2">sending others at me.</p>
<p begin="01:53:26.866" end="01:53:30.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re strong, but don&#39;t underestimate</p>
<p begin="01:53:29.166" end="01:53:31.866" style="s2">human greed.</p>
<p begin="01:53:30.066" end="01:53:33.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the greediest one here. You don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:53:31.866" end="01:53:35.066" style="s2">even sell soul-healing medicine, do you?</p>
<p begin="01:53:33.966" end="01:53:37.966" style="s2">You just scamming us.</p>
<p begin="01:53:35.066" end="01:53:38.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An honest merchant like me scam you?</p>
<p begin="01:53:37.966" end="01:53:40.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the medicine?</p>
<p begin="01:53:38.666" end="01:53:40.766" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know which shop on this street sells</p>
<p begin="01:53:40.266" end="01:53:42.066" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:53:40.766" end="01:53:44.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You crook.</p>
<p begin="01:53:42.066" end="01:53:46.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bad information isn&#39;t free.</p>
<p begin="01:53:44.066" end="01:53:47.466" style="s2">My terms are simple. Leave it with me as</p>
<p begin="01:53:46.566" end="01:53:48.766" style="s2">collateral.</p>
<p begin="01:53:47.466" end="01:53:50.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re all waiting for me to strike so</p>
<p begin="01:53:48.766" end="01:53:51.966" style="s2">they can drag us into the arena.</p>
<p begin="01:53:50.066" end="01:53:52.666" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go. I message my friends. We try</p>
<p begin="01:53:51.966" end="01:53:54.266" style="s2">another shop.</p>
<p begin="01:53:52.666" end="01:53:56.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Challenger&#39;s Gun God and Little Bun will</p>
<p begin="01:53:54.266" end="01:53:57.766" style="s2">enter the arena. Voting is now open.</p>
<p begin="01:53:56.266" end="01:53:58.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That Little Bun from earlier found</p>
<p begin="01:53:57.766" end="01:54:00.666" style="s2">another target already.</p>
<p begin="01:53:58.566" end="01:54:02.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t go. Leave him here and I&#39;ll tell</p>
<p begin="01:54:00.666" end="01:54:03.966" style="s2">you where to find the medicine.</p>
<p begin="01:54:02.166" end="01:54:05.566" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really know how to work the rules.</p>
<p begin="01:54:03.966" end="01:54:08.166" style="s2">No wonder you keep blocking us.</p>
<p begin="01:54:05.566" end="01:54:09.166" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, Ma. Do we have a deal or not?</p>
<p begin="01:54:08.166" end="01:54:10.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="01:54:09.166" end="01:54:11.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop blocking our way.</p>
<p begin="01:54:10.366" end="01:54:13.366" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Violent assault detected against First</p>
<p begin="01:54:11.966" end="01:54:15.866" style="s2">Street shopkeeper Hua Die. Is</p>
<p begin="01:54:13.366" end="01:54:17.566" style="s2">intervention required?</p>
<p begin="01:54:15.866" end="01:54:18.966" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still won&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="01:54:17.566" end="01:54:21.066" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you knock it off?</p>
<p begin="01:54:18.966" end="01:54:22.866" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally fought back. Fight detected</p>
<p begin="01:54:21.066" end="01:54:24.768" style="s2">between a challenger and a shopkeeper.</p>
<p begin="01:54:22.866" end="01:54:26.268" style="s2">Challenger Ma and shopkeeper Hua Die</p>
<p begin="01:54:24.768" end="01:54:28.268" style="s2">will now enter the arena.</p>
<p begin="01:54:26.268" end="01:54:29.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re insane. You actually hit them?</p>
<p begin="01:54:28.268" end="01:54:32.768" style="s2">THINK YOU&#39;RE THAT STRONG?</p>
<p begin="01:54:29.568" end="01:54:34.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stronger than you, at least.</p>
<p begin="01:54:32.768" end="01:54:36.568" style="s2">Take this. While I&#39;m in there, take Luo</p>
<p begin="01:54:34.768" end="01:54:38.367" style="s2">to find the medicine. Don&#39;t just watch</p>
<p begin="01:54:36.568" end="01:54:39.168" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:54:38.367" end="01:54:40.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that Ma?</p>
<p begin="01:54:39.168" end="01:54:43.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hua Die finally got himself into trouble</p>
<p begin="01:54:40.968" end="01:54:44.968" style="s2">for once.</p>
<p begin="01:54:43.068" end="01:54:46.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re surprisingly direct.</p>
<p begin="01:54:44.968" end="01:54:47.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Flash Believer, I don&#39;t think I know</p>
<p begin="01:54:46.768" end="01:54:49.568" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:54:47.367" end="01:54:52.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know me, but I know you.</p>
<p begin="01:54:49.568" end="01:54:54.668" style="s2">Diamond Body, Skull Island. Do you</p>
<p begin="01:54:52.268" end="01:54:56.668" style="s2">really think this is Brother Ma?</p>
<p begin="01:54:54.668" end="01:54:58.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Honestly, I&#39;m not sure either. I think</p>
<p begin="01:54:56.668" end="01:55:00.568" style="s2">Brother Ma must be a top-ranked expert.</p>
<p begin="01:54:58.768" end="01:55:02.268" style="s2">The amount of information he has means</p>
<p begin="01:55:00.568" end="01:55:02.867" style="s2">he dares to take risks and that he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:55:02.268" end="01:55:04.168" style="s2">powerful.</p>
<p begin="01:55:02.867" end="01:55:04.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hua Die doesn&#39;t have a good reputation</p>
<p begin="01:55:04.168" end="01:55:06.367" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="01:55:04.668" end="01:55:08.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I think Ma was dragged into this so</p>
<p begin="01:55:06.367" end="01:55:10.768" style="s2">someone could teach Hua Die a lesson.</p>
<p begin="01:55:08.768" end="01:55:12.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re pretty sharp, kid. Just don&#39;t let</p>
<p begin="01:55:10.768" end="01:55:14.168" style="s2">the dead army kill you.</p>
<p begin="01:55:12.568" end="01:55:16.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve already found something that can</p>
<p begin="01:55:14.168" end="01:55:18.968" style="s2">deal with the dead army. The problem is</p>
<p begin="01:55:16.367" end="01:55:19.867" style="s2">they want a lot for it. It costs 10,000</p>
<p begin="01:55:18.968" end="01:55:21.568" style="s2">Island Coins.</p>
<p begin="01:55:19.867" end="01:55:22.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why did you only put 1,000 on</p>
<p begin="01:55:21.568" end="01:55:24.367" style="s2">Brother Ma?</p>
<p begin="01:55:22.468" end="01:55:25.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I can&#39;t afford the full price,</p>
<p begin="01:55:24.367" end="01:55:27.268" style="s2">obviously.</p>
<p begin="01:55:25.168" end="01:55:28.568" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s worth taking the gamble. We might</p>
<p begin="01:55:27.268" end="01:55:30.568" style="s2">still have a chance.</p>
<p begin="01:55:28.568" end="01:55:31.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it doesn&#39;t work out, I&#39;m dead either</p>
<p begin="01:55:30.568" end="01:55:32.168" style="s2">way.</p>
<p begin="01:55:31.068" end="01:55:33.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s just consider the money a</p>
<p begin="01:55:32.168" end="01:55:35.268" style="s2">donation.</p>
<p begin="01:55:33.068" end="01:55:37.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Ma and I go way back.</p>
<p begin="01:55:35.268" end="01:55:38.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So I&#39;m afraid he isn&#39;t Ma,</p>
<p begin="01:55:37.068" end="01:55:40.468" style="s2">and I&#39;m also afraid he is.</p>
<p begin="01:55:38.968" end="01:55:41.468" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t overthink it. Why don&#39;t we check</p>
<p begin="01:55:40.468" end="01:55:43.867" style="s2">the votes first?</p>
<p begin="01:55:41.468" end="01:55:45.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma has only a little over 300 votes,</p>
<p begin="01:55:43.867" end="01:55:48.168" style="s2">while Hua Die has more than 10,000.</p>
<p begin="01:55:45.968" end="01:55:49.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those shopkeepers are what worry me.</p>
<p begin="01:55:48.168" end="01:55:51.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did the item given to Master Senju</p>
<p begin="01:55:49.968" end="01:55:53.168" style="s2">last round come from?</p>
<p begin="01:55:51.268" end="01:55:53.968" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The system said outside assistance was</p>
<p begin="01:55:53.168" end="01:55:55.367" style="s2">allowed.</p>
<p begin="01:55:53.968" end="01:55:56.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why can&#39;t the challenger send</p>
<p begin="01:55:55.367" end="01:55:58.168" style="s2">anything?</p>
<p begin="01:55:56.268" end="01:55:59.768" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let&#39;s bribe them to send an item to</p>
<p begin="01:55:58.168" end="01:56:01.568" style="s2">Ma.</p>
<p begin="01:55:59.768" end="01:56:04.068" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That might work in other circumstances,</p>
<p begin="01:56:01.568" end="01:56:05.968" style="s2">but Ma&#39;s opponent is another shopkeeper.</p>
<p begin="01:56:04.068" end="01:56:07.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you don&#39;t help me today, how can I</p>
<p begin="01:56:05.968" end="01:56:09.468" style="s2">help you tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="01:56:07.867" end="01:56:11.168" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So they&#39;re all in cahoots.</p>
<p begin="01:56:09.468" end="01:56:12.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma just sent a message. He&#39;s urgently</p>
<p begin="01:56:11.168" end="01:56:14.068" style="s2">looking for the Soul Repair Song. Which</p>
<p begin="01:56:12.867" end="01:56:15.367" style="s2">street is Hua Die on?</p>
<p begin="01:56:14.068" end="01:56:18.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go find him first.</p>
<p begin="01:56:15.367" end="01:56:18.367" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s see how I can help.</p>
<p begin="01:56:19.568" end="01:56:23.668" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. 1,000 to make a friend. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="01:56:22.367" end="01:56:24.867" style="s2">betting on you.</p>
<p begin="01:56:23.668" end="01:56:26.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Say no more.</p>
<p begin="01:56:24.867" end="01:56:27.969" style="s2">Add me as a friend.</p>
<p begin="01:56:26.169" end="01:56:31.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Voting is closed.</p>
<p begin="01:56:27.969" end="01:56:31.169" style="s2">382 votes.</p>
<p begin="01:56:34.469" end="01:56:38.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why go this far?</p>
<p begin="01:56:36.769" end="01:56:39.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was just a deal between willing</p>
<p begin="01:56:38.969" end="01:56:41.969" style="s2">parties.</p>
<p begin="01:56:39.969" end="01:56:44.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You could have just walked away.</p>
<p begin="01:56:41.969" end="01:56:46.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you had to make a scene.</p>
<p begin="01:56:44.169" end="01:56:48.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now look. I gained nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:56:46.869" end="01:56:51.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you lose your life.</p>
<p begin="01:56:48.769" end="01:56:51.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the point?</p>
<p begin="01:56:53.769" end="01:56:56.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The way you&#39;re acting.</p>
<p begin="01:56:55.469" end="01:56:58.469" style="s2">You&#39;re as annoying as that brain</p>
<p begin="01:56:56.869" end="01:57:01.869" style="s2">scorpion on my boat.</p>
<p begin="01:56:58.469" end="01:57:01.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have a death wish.</p>
<p begin="01:57:07.169" end="01:57:09.769" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These bugs are like the ones in the worm</p>
<p begin="01:57:08.669" end="01:57:12.869" style="s2">hole.</p>
<p begin="01:57:09.769" end="01:57:12.869" style="s2">So he was behind it.</p>
<p begin="01:57:23.469" end="01:57:26.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got high heat resistance.</p>
<p begin="01:57:24.969" end="01:57:29.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll burn this bug with my dagger&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:57:26.469" end="01:57:29.069" style="s2">flames first.</p>
<p begin="01:57:30.769" end="01:57:34.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire. That damn fire.</p>
<p begin="01:57:39.269" end="01:57:41.869" style="s2">Pretty strong.</p>
<p begin="01:57:43.769" end="01:57:47.269" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The dragon bone blade was in a</p>
<p begin="01:57:45.369" end="01:57:48.369" style="s2">server-wide announcement.</p>
<p begin="01:57:47.269" end="01:57:51.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Using it</p>
<p begin="01:57:48.369" end="01:57:51.069" style="s2">would give me away.</p>
<p begin="01:57:51.569" end="01:57:55.569" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="01:57:52.569" end="01:57:55.569" style="s2">You asked for this.</p>
<p begin="01:57:57.169" end="01:57:59.969" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re stalling.</p>
<p begin="01:57:58.269" end="01:58:01.469" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, you caught me.</p>
<p begin="01:57:59.969" end="01:58:03.569" style="s2">There&#39;s plenty more where those came</p>
<p begin="01:58:01.469" end="01:58:05.469" style="s2">from. My little darlings left them</p>
<p begin="01:58:03.569" end="01:58:07.169" style="s2">plenty of nutrients.</p>
<p begin="01:58:05.469" end="01:58:09.169" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t let them keep growing.</p>
<p begin="01:58:07.169" end="01:58:11.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Berserk costs 100 stamina. I&#39;ll start</p>
<p begin="01:58:09.169" end="01:58:13.669" style="s2">with searing body and tentacle form.</p>
<p begin="01:58:11.869" end="01:58:16.669" style="s2">The heat will trigger melting and flush</p>
<p begin="01:58:13.669" end="01:58:16.669" style="s2">out the buried bugs.</p>
<p begin="01:58:18.069" end="01:58:21.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It didn&#39;t take over my mouth this time.</p>
<p begin="01:58:19.869" end="01:58:22.869" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it because I&#39;m in a dream?</p>
<p begin="01:58:21.069" end="01:58:25.069" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that?</p>
<p begin="01:58:22.869" end="01:58:27.669" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s an assimilated form reserved for</p>
<p begin="01:58:25.069" end="01:58:28.769" style="s2">that god&#39;s priests and above.</p>
<p begin="01:58:27.669" end="01:58:29.170" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A challenger.</p>
<p begin="01:58:28.769" end="01:58:31.170" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He</p>
<p begin="01:58:29.170" end="01:58:32.370" style="s2">&gt;&gt; being assimilated by that god.</p>
<p begin="01:58:31.170" end="01:58:33.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go on, keep dodging.</p>
<p begin="01:58:32.370" end="01:58:34.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the system bugged? Why is it all</p>
<p begin="01:58:33.970" end="01:58:37.370" style="s2">pixelated?</p>
<p begin="01:58:34.870" end="01:58:38.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I get it. He&#39;s the real deal. That&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="01:58:37.370" end="01:58:40.470" style="s2">real Ma.</p>
<p begin="01:58:38.270" end="01:58:41.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should have said so. If I&#39;d known it</p>
<p begin="01:58:40.470" end="01:58:44.770" style="s2">was really Ma, I&#39;d have given him a</p>
<p begin="01:58:41.870" end="01:58:44.770" style="s2">couple of votes.</p>
<p begin="01:58:46.270" end="01:58:48.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is he out of his mind?</p>
<p begin="01:58:47.970" end="01:58:50.570" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Shooting</p>
<p begin="01:58:48.970" end="01:58:51.370" style="s2">against the challenger without even tier</p>
<p begin="01:58:50.570" end="01:58:52.870" style="s2">three armor.</p>
<p begin="01:58:51.370" end="01:58:53.470" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s really paying through the nose for</p>
<p begin="01:58:52.870" end="01:58:55.470" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="01:58:53.470" end="01:58:57.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a hefty price to pay.</p>
<p begin="01:58:55.470" end="01:58:59.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s no way he can lose now.</p>
<p begin="01:58:57.070" end="01:59:02.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. Let those challengers learn who</p>
<p begin="01:58:59.270" end="01:59:02.270" style="s2">makes the rules here.</p>
<p begin="01:59:02.970" end="01:59:05.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s that sound?</p>
<p begin="01:59:04.370" end="01:59:07.170" style="s2">&gt;&gt; An area-wide psychic attack.</p>
<p begin="01:59:05.970" end="01:59:07.670" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why didn&#39;t the system block it this</p>
<p begin="01:59:07.170" end="01:59:10.170" style="s2">time?</p>
<p begin="01:59:07.670" end="01:59:13.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Even if it&#39;s blocked out here, that kid</p>
<p begin="01:59:10.170" end="01:59:13.870" style="s2">inside can still hear it.</p>
<p begin="01:59:18.370" end="01:59:20.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="01:59:24.070" end="01:59:27.570" style="s2">His armor keeps regenerating. My</p>
<p begin="01:59:25.770" end="01:59:29.370" style="s2">tentacles can&#39;t hold him. My vision&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:59:27.570" end="01:59:30.870" style="s2">split, too. I can&#39;t see how far he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="01:59:29.370" end="01:59:33.570" style="s2">gotten.</p>
<p begin="01:59:30.870" end="01:59:33.570" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m already here.</p>
<p begin="01:59:35.270" end="01:59:37.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get off me.</p>
<p begin="01:59:36.170" end="01:59:42.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Under attack by an elite A-rank</p>
<p begin="01:59:37.770" end="01:59:42.270" style="s2">creature. Hito activated. Foe&#39;s might.</p>
<p begin="01:59:51.770" end="01:59:55.570" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still dropping. This title burns through</p>
<p begin="01:59:54.170" end="01:59:59.170" style="s2">way too much HP.</p>
<p begin="01:59:55.570" end="01:59:59.170" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least my HP and energy are back up.</p>
<p begin="02:00:02.070" end="02:00:05.970" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now&#39;s the perfect time to use that</p>
<p begin="02:00:03.670" end="02:00:07.170" style="s2">skill. My superheated body will explode</p>
<p begin="02:00:05.970" end="02:00:08.870" style="s2">near an open flame.</p>
<p begin="02:00:07.170" end="02:00:10.770" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t use the dagger to light a fire</p>
<p begin="02:00:08.870" end="02:00:12.270" style="s2">again. How are the tentacles breathing</p>
<p begin="02:00:10.770" end="02:00:14.770" style="s2">in this dark red mist?</p>
<p begin="02:00:12.270" end="02:00:16.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This mist. The hotter the body, the</p>
<p begin="02:00:14.770" end="02:00:17.870" style="s2">faster it kicks in.</p>
<p begin="02:00:16.070" end="02:00:19.070" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The closer the abyssal Ma gets, the</p>
<p begin="02:00:17.870" end="02:00:22.270" style="s2">better it&#39;ll work.</p>
<p begin="02:00:19.070" end="02:00:22.270" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to get close to his head.</p>
<p begin="02:00:24.070" end="02:00:27.870" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why is the sensor blur stopped moving</p>
<p begin="02:00:25.670" end="02:00:28.970" style="s2">again? And why is yellow liquid dripping</p>
<p begin="02:00:27.870" end="02:00:31.270" style="s2">out?</p>
<p begin="02:00:28.970" end="02:00:32.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The The cells still hold some oxygen.</p>
<p begin="02:00:31.270" end="02:00:34.772" style="s2">I&#39;ll heat up first, then slice through</p>
<p begin="02:00:32.472" end="02:00:34.772" style="s2">the shell.</p>
<p begin="02:00:35.372" end="02:00:39.372" style="s2">He actually planted insect eggs inside</p>
<p begin="02:00:37.372" end="02:00:41.672" style="s2">me. Just hot enough.</p>
<p begin="02:00:39.372" end="02:00:41.672" style="s2">Now.</p>
<p begin="02:00:50.872" end="02:00:55.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got him. That should finish him. Right.</p>
<p begin="02:00:53.572" end="02:00:57.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My tentacles are sealed off. I can&#39;t see</p>
<p begin="02:00:55.972" end="02:00:59.572" style="s2">outside. Good thing that title gave me</p>
<p begin="02:00:57.772" end="02:01:01.072" style="s2">30% more stamina.</p>
<p begin="02:00:59.572" end="02:01:03.572" style="s2">I&#39;ve got enough left to use scorching</p>
<p begin="02:01:01.072" end="02:01:06.172" style="s2">body again. First, melt the amber and</p>
<p begin="02:01:03.572" end="02:01:08.272" style="s2">burn out the eggs inside me.</p>
<p begin="02:01:06.172" end="02:01:11.072" style="s2">My HP is still dropping. The title is</p>
<p begin="02:01:08.272" end="02:01:13.172" style="s2">still draining it. The insect king isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:01:11.072" end="02:01:15.572" style="s2">dead. What&#39;s this?</p>
<p begin="02:01:13.172" end="02:01:17.472" style="s2">What&#39;s with him?</p>
<p begin="02:01:15.572" end="02:01:19.372" style="s2">Pretty tough. Freezing the shells might</p>
<p begin="02:01:17.472" end="02:01:21.172" style="s2">not kill them. I can&#39;t wait for them to</p>
<p begin="02:01:19.372" end="02:01:23.472" style="s2">hatch.</p>
<p begin="02:01:21.172" end="02:01:26.072" style="s2">Plenty of room and solid ground.</p>
<p begin="02:01:23.472" end="02:01:26.072" style="s2">Perfect.</p>
<p begin="02:01:29.172" end="02:01:33.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FREEDOM. YOU CAN&#39;T CONTROL US.</p>
<p begin="02:01:32.072" end="02:01:36.783" style="s2">&gt;&gt; BURN THEM.</p>
<p begin="02:01:33.672" end="02:01:38.472" style="s2">BUGS. I HATE BUGS.</p>
<p begin="02:01:36.783" end="02:01:40.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="02:01:38.472" end="02:01:42.372" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HEY, THAT&#39;S GOING TOO FAR. WHY can&#39;t I</p>
<p begin="02:01:40.772" end="02:01:43.172" style="s2">see anything on the screen?</p>
<p begin="02:01:42.372" end="02:01:45.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Refund.</p>
<p begin="02:01:43.172" end="02:01:46.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Refund. The event not over.</p>
<p begin="02:01:45.072" end="02:01:49.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Needs more firepower.</p>
<p begin="02:01:46.972" end="02:01:49.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve got fuel.</p>
<p begin="02:01:51.572" end="02:01:53.972" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="02:01:55.572" end="02:01:58.672" style="s2">One more.</p>
<p begin="02:01:56.672" end="02:02:01.072" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now we&#39;re getting a reaction.</p>
<p begin="02:01:58.672" end="02:02:01.772" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When you get to Insect Island, I&#39;ll make</p>
<p begin="02:02:01.072" end="02:02:04.272" style="s2">you pay.</p>
<p begin="02:02:01.772" end="02:02:07.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That voice sounds familiar.</p>
<p begin="02:02:04.272" end="02:02:07.572" style="s2">Oh, it&#39;s him.</p>
<p begin="02:02:17.872" end="02:02:20.772" style="s2">Nalan could use this.</p>
<p begin="02:02:24.772" end="02:02:29.572" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He won. HE ACTUALLY PULLED IT OFF.</p>
<p begin="02:02:27.472" end="02:02:30.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M SCREWED. Nalan has been sent back to</p>
<p begin="02:02:29.572" end="02:02:33.072" style="s2">Insect Island.</p>
<p begin="02:02:30.472" end="02:02:34.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He still owes me 20,000. Do I have to go</p>
<p begin="02:02:33.072" end="02:02:36.173" style="s2">to Insect Island to collect?</p>
<p begin="02:02:34.573" end="02:02:38.173" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you to make it back alive. You</p>
<p begin="02:02:36.173" end="02:02:39.773" style="s2">think he&#39;d actually pay you back?</p>
<p begin="02:02:38.173" end="02:02:41.873" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s still alive.</p>
<p begin="02:02:39.773" end="02:02:43.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All that for nothing.</p>
<p begin="02:02:41.873" end="02:02:45.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least the arena payout came through.</p>
<p begin="02:02:43.673" end="02:02:47.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So much for killing the insect king.</p>
<p begin="02:02:45.373" end="02:02:51.173" style="s2">Another stupid quest.</p>
<p begin="02:02:47.273" end="02:02:51.173" style="s2">This shop&#39;s in a good spot though.</p>
<p begin="02:02:54.730" end="02:02:58.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="02:02:55.473" end="02:02:58.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come with me. Hurry, hurry.</p>
<p begin="02:02:59.273" end="02:03:03.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s wrong? What&#39;s the rush?</p>
<p begin="02:03:01.173" end="02:03:06.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No time TO EXPLAIN. EVERYONE, COME ON.</p>
<p begin="02:03:03.273" end="02:03:06.573" style="s2">HURRY. WE&#39;RE [screaming] OUT OF TIME.</p>
<p begin="02:03:12.673" end="02:03:18.573" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THE LEASE IS SETTLED. The shop is yours.</p>
<p begin="02:03:16.473" end="02:03:19.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I guess it counts as loot. You&#39;ve got</p>
<p begin="02:03:18.573" end="02:03:20.273" style="s2">money on you, right? Just rent it for</p>
<p begin="02:03:19.973" end="02:03:22.373" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="02:03:20.273" end="02:03:24.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I bet 100 on Luo Luo and the other</p>
<p begin="02:03:22.373" end="02:03:25.573" style="s2">13,200 on you. Now I&#39;ve got over 3</p>
<p begin="02:03:24.973" end="02:03:27.373" style="s2">million.</p>
<p begin="02:03:25.573" end="02:03:28.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough. Hurry.</p>
<p begin="02:03:27.373" end="02:03:31.173" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll rent it.</p>
<p begin="02:03:28.773" end="02:03:34.473" style="s2">Wow, this place is gorgeous.</p>
<p begin="02:03:31.173" end="02:03:34.473" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lan, is this place yours now?</p>
<p begin="02:03:35.473" end="02:03:38.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go take a look inside.</p>
<p begin="02:03:39.773" end="02:03:42.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What now?</p>
<p begin="02:03:40.573" end="02:03:43.173" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re from the same place. Do I really</p>
<p begin="02:03:42.273" end="02:03:45.573" style="s2">need permission?</p>
<p begin="02:03:43.173" end="02:03:46.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Go on in.</p>
<p begin="02:03:45.573" end="02:03:47.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks for earlier. Where&#39;d you get the</p>
<p begin="02:03:46.973" end="02:03:49.773" style="s2">soul remedy?</p>
<p begin="02:03:47.973" end="02:03:52.073" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lan took me to find medicine and we ran</p>
<p begin="02:03:49.773" end="02:03:53.873" style="s2">into them on their way over.</p>
<p begin="02:03:52.073" end="02:03:54.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t do much. Ye deserves all the</p>
<p begin="02:03:53.873" end="02:03:56.673" style="s2">credit.</p>
<p begin="02:03:54.673" end="02:03:58.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw your message. I&#39;d seen injuries</p>
<p begin="02:03:56.673" end="02:04:00.673" style="s2">like this before, so I stocked up on two</p>
<p begin="02:03:58.773" end="02:04:02.773" style="s2">soul repair items. We heard you were on</p>
<p begin="02:04:00.673" end="02:04:03.573" style="s2">First Street, so we rushed over and used</p>
<p begin="02:04:02.773" end="02:04:04.973" style="s2">one.</p>
<p begin="02:04:03.573" end="02:04:07.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thanks, man. I&#39;ll pay you back once</p>
<p begin="02:04:04.973" end="02:04:07.373" style="s2">we&#39;re out.</p>
<p begin="02:04:08.373" end="02:04:11.773" style="s2">Where&#39;d all this extra money come from?</p>
<p begin="02:04:10.073" end="02:04:13.373" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I forgot to tell you.</p>
<p begin="02:04:11.773" end="02:04:16.873" style="s2">It&#39;s the betting payout.</p>
<p begin="02:04:13.373" end="02:04:16.873" style="s2">Transfer 1,126,400</p>
<p begin="02:04:17.373" end="02:04:21.273" style="s2">to Ma.</p>
<p begin="02:04:18.373" end="02:04:24.273" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was one hell of a risky payday.</p>
<p begin="02:04:21.273" end="02:04:26.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put it away. No more betting.</p>
<p begin="02:04:24.273" end="02:04:28.173" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We made over 200,000.</p>
<p begin="02:04:26.773" end="02:04:28.773" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we shouldn&#39;t ask him to pay us</p>
<p begin="02:04:28.173" end="02:04:30.273" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="02:04:28.773" end="02:04:31.673" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t going to.</p>
<p begin="02:04:30.273" end="02:04:33.273" style="s2">We&#39;re all Ma&#39;s friends.</p>
<p begin="02:04:31.673" end="02:04:34.973" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve made so much thanks to Ma. I&#39;d</p>
<p begin="02:04:33.273" end="02:04:37.374" style="s2">feel bad taking it. The old owner&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:04:34.973" end="02:04:38.374" style="s2">gone. Who opened a new shop here? Could</p>
<p begin="02:04:37.374" end="02:04:40.374" style="s2">it be Ma?</p>
<p begin="02:04:38.374" end="02:04:42.675" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GIRL, THIS SHOP&#39;S OWNER IS TOTALLY MY</p>
<p begin="02:04:40.374" end="02:04:42.675" style="s2">TYPE.</p>
<p begin="02:04:46.874" end="02:04:50.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;LL STAY WITH LAN. You guys go ahead.</p>
<p begin="02:05:00.974" end="02:05:03.874" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="02:05:04.874" end="02:05:07.474" style="s2">Let&#39;s stop at the shop you wanted to buy</p>
<p begin="02:05:06.374" end="02:05:09.074" style="s2">items from first.</p>
<p begin="02:05:07.474" end="02:05:10.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;d you buy those soul repair items?</p>
<p begin="02:05:09.074" end="02:05:12.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That shop on Third Street. The owner</p>
<p begin="02:05:10.974" end="02:05:13.574" style="s2">says he&#39;s the only seller in the dream</p>
<p begin="02:05:12.974" end="02:05:15.775" style="s2">realm.</p>
<p begin="02:05:13.574" end="02:05:17.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That bastard Huadi. He lied and told me</p>
<p begin="02:05:15.775" end="02:05:18.574" style="s2">they sold them on First Street. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="02:05:17.275" end="02:05:19.574" style="s2">settle that score later.</p>
<p begin="02:05:18.574" end="02:05:22.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You again.</p>
<p begin="02:05:19.574" end="02:05:23.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? We pooled our money and came here.</p>
<p begin="02:05:22.175" end="02:05:25.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring out the random jump knob and the</p>
<p begin="02:05:23.775" end="02:05:27.675" style="s2">designated maps you showed me before.</p>
<p begin="02:05:25.974" end="02:05:30.175" style="s2">I&#39;LL TAKE THEM ALL.</p>
<p begin="02:05:27.675" end="02:05:32.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Humans really have no shame. You&#39;d even</p>
<p begin="02:05:30.175" end="02:05:34.874" style="s2">sell your own body.</p>
<p begin="02:05:32.275" end="02:05:35.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can call me poor, but don&#39;t insult</p>
<p begin="02:05:34.874" end="02:05:39.074" style="s2">my dignity.</p>
<p begin="02:05:35.974" end="02:05:43.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; New accusation recorded. Xiao, accused.</p>
<p begin="02:05:39.074" end="02:05:43.275" style="s2">Vajra body, record complete.</p>
<p begin="02:05:43.374" end="02:05:45.974" style="s2">That works too.</p>
<p begin="02:05:44.474" end="02:05:47.275" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ma, what are you looking at?</p>
<p begin="02:05:45.974" end="02:05:49.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry up and use the item.</p>
<p begin="02:05:47.275" end="02:05:50.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Purple random jump knob. It moves the</p>
<p begin="02:05:49.175" end="02:05:52.574" style="s2">island in a random direction by</p>
<p begin="02:05:50.374" end="02:05:55.775" style="s2">teleportation. It needs at least 15 days</p>
<p begin="02:05:52.574" end="02:05:55.775" style="s2">to recharge after use.</p>
<p begin="02:05:55.974" end="02:05:59.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The death army is catching up. We&#39;ll use</p>
<p begin="02:05:57.675" end="02:06:01.775" style="s2">this to escape.</p>
<p begin="02:05:59.775" end="02:06:04.175" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three conditions must be met. The</p>
<p begin="02:06:01.775" end="02:06:06.275" style="s2">islander must be correct. The target</p>
<p begin="02:06:04.175" end="02:06:07.775" style="s2">must be above your island, and you must</p>
<p begin="02:06:06.275" end="02:06:09.175" style="s2">have had contact with someone or</p>
<p begin="02:06:07.775" end="02:06:10.874" style="s2">something on that island.</p>
<p begin="02:06:09.175" end="02:06:12.775" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What kind of metal is this made of?</p>
<p begin="02:06:10.874" end="02:06:13.675" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The metal isn&#39;t for sale. You can only</p>
<p begin="02:06:12.775" end="02:06:16.574" style="s2">buy the item.</p>
<p begin="02:06:13.675" end="02:06:18.974" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The knob is 10,000. The map is 15,000.</p>
<p begin="02:06:16.574" end="02:06:20.775" style="s2">25,000 total. Here you go.</p>
<p begin="02:06:18.974" end="02:06:22.874" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Looks like you made quite a profit.</p>
<p begin="02:06:20.775" end="02:06:24.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If it doesn&#39;t work, press this.</p>
<p begin="02:06:22.874" end="02:06:26.474" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you knew. So you were</p>
<p begin="02:06:24.374" end="02:06:27.775" style="s2">deliberately humiliating me earlier.</p>
<p begin="02:06:26.474" end="02:06:29.374" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Ma, I&#39;ll give this to you once</p>
<p begin="02:06:27.775" end="02:06:29.974" style="s2">we&#39;re out. But whatever you do, don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:06:29.374" end="02:06:31.974" style="s2">give it away.</p>
<p begin="02:06:29.974" end="02:06:32.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be so formal. We&#39;ll talk once</p>
<p begin="02:06:31.974" end="02:06:33.775" style="s2">we&#39;re out.</p>
<p begin="02:06:32.574" end="02:06:35.574" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t let it count as a transaction</p>
<p begin="02:06:33.775" end="02:06:38.275" style="s2">here. I don&#39;t want to spin the wheel of</p>
<p begin="02:06:35.574" end="02:06:38.275" style="s2">fate again.</p>
<p begin="02:06:38.474" end="02:06:42.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now that Xiao Jin&#39;s problem is settled,</p>
<p begin="02:06:40.376" end="02:06:44.676" style="s2">come with me. We&#39;re going somewhere that</p>
<p begin="02:06:42.075" end="02:06:45.475" style="s2">sells soul repair items. Let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="02:06:44.676" end="02:06:48.376" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="02:06:45.475" end="02:06:48.376" style="s2">No way. Wait.</p>
<p begin="02:07:08.276" end="02:07:14.376" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The people who didn&#39;t vote,</p>
<p begin="02:07:11.276" end="02:07:16.876" style="s2">their soul fragments were taken at this</p>
<p begin="02:07:14.376" end="02:07:16.876" style="s2">moment.</p>
<p begin="02:07:18.376" end="02:07:22.176" style="s2">Only 15 minutes have passed.</p>
<p begin="02:07:20.676" end="02:07:22.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s finally over.</p>
<p begin="02:07:22.176" end="02:07:24.676" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you okay?</p>
<p begin="02:07:22.975" end="02:07:27.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. There were just too many</p>
<p begin="02:07:24.676" end="02:07:28.876" style="s2">people. It was so noisy. Next time, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="02:07:27.176" end="02:07:29.975" style="s2">make something to sell. There&#39;s also the</p>
<p begin="02:07:28.876" end="02:07:31.376" style="s2">shopkeeper&#39;s contact list at the</p>
<p begin="02:07:29.975" end="02:07:33.376" style="s2">counter. I didn&#39;t have time to look</p>
<p begin="02:07:31.376" end="02:07:35.075" style="s2">closely.</p>
<p begin="02:07:33.376" end="02:07:36.776" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The death fungus is right on our heels.</p>
<p begin="02:07:35.075" end="02:07:37.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll teleport with the item now. I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="02:07:36.776" end="02:07:39.575" style="s2">tell you more once we reach the new</p>
<p begin="02:07:37.975" end="02:07:41.276" style="s2">place.</p>
<p begin="02:07:39.575" end="02:07:43.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ll talk once you&#39;re safe. See you in</p>
<p begin="02:07:41.276" end="02:07:44.876" style="s2">the dream realm in 5 days.</p>
<p begin="02:07:43.075" end="02:07:46.876" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Jing He gave me this. It&#39;ll come in</p>
<p begin="02:07:44.876" end="02:07:47.575" style="s2">handy. But first, I need to go check on</p>
<p begin="02:07:46.876" end="02:07:48.676" style="s2">the fool.</p>
<p begin="02:07:47.575" end="02:07:49.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll go after I deal with their</p>
<p begin="02:07:48.676" end="02:07:51.575" style="s2">situation.</p>
<p begin="02:07:49.975" end="02:07:52.276" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really are going to look for Insect</p>
<p begin="02:07:51.575" end="02:07:53.776" style="s2">Island?</p>
<p begin="02:07:52.276" end="02:07:55.776" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I also want to check out Iron Shield</p>
<p begin="02:07:53.776" end="02:07:59.176" style="s2">Island and the Matrix Archipelago.</p>
<p begin="02:07:55.776" end="02:07:59.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But Insect Island comes first.</p>
<p begin="02:07:59.975" end="02:08:02.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I extracted this from the big bug&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:08:01.276" end="02:08:03.376" style="s2">pupa.</p>
<p begin="02:08:02.176" end="02:08:05.176" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead and use it.</p>
<p begin="02:08:03.376" end="02:08:06.975" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is enough energy to raise several</p>
<p begin="02:08:05.176" end="02:08:08.075" style="s2">Portuguese Man o&#39; War jellyfish.</p>
<p begin="02:08:06.975" end="02:08:10.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too bad we still haven&#39;t solved the</p>
<p begin="02:08:08.075" end="02:08:11.276" style="s2">freshwater problem. We better conserve</p>
<p begin="02:08:10.075" end="02:08:13.176" style="s2">what&#39;s left.</p>
<p begin="02:08:11.276" end="02:08:16.075" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Brother Ma, I didn&#39;t have time to find</p>
<p begin="02:08:13.176" end="02:08:19.376" style="s2">you anything else. Take this.</p>
<p begin="02:08:16.075" end="02:08:19.376" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Soul repair fluid.</p>
<p begin="02:08:21.276" end="02:08:24.276" style="s2">Thanks, Brother Ye.</p>
<p begin="02:08:29.975" end="02:08:35.075" style="s2">It hasn&#39;t spread.</p>
<p begin="02:08:31.575" end="02:08:35.075" style="s2">I better save this reward for now.</p>
<p begin="02:08:38.676" end="02:08:41.077" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How did it get this bad overnight?</p>
<p begin="02:08:40.776" end="02:08:42.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It looks</p>
<p begin="02:08:41.077" end="02:08:44.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; like it suddenly flared up. The</p>
<p begin="02:08:42.677" end="02:08:45.477" style="s2">increasing constitution must have</p>
<p begin="02:08:44.177" end="02:08:47.477" style="s2">suppressed it for a while. This is</p>
<p begin="02:08:45.477" end="02:08:49.477" style="s2">probably how bad it should be by now.</p>
<p begin="02:08:47.477" end="02:08:51.377" style="s2">Once the heart and brain are petrified,</p>
<p begin="02:08:49.477" end="02:08:52.877" style="s2">it&#39;s as good as being dead.</p>
<p begin="02:08:51.377" end="02:08:55.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Navigate to the Dawn Park for me.</p>
<p begin="02:08:52.877" end="02:08:56.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop saying it so calmly. Help me</p>
<p begin="02:08:55.177" end="02:08:58.377" style="s2">think of something. If I go into the</p>
<p begin="02:08:56.577" end="02:09:00.577" style="s2">water like this, I&#39;ll lose the use of</p>
<p begin="02:08:58.377" end="02:09:02.277" style="s2">one hand. And my left side is too heavy.</p>
<p begin="02:09:00.577" end="02:09:03.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t get these bugs to leave, no</p>
<p begin="02:09:02.277" end="02:09:04.877" style="s2">matter what I do.</p>
<p begin="02:09:03.377" end="02:09:05.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch them. They&#39;ll attack you</p>
<p begin="02:09:04.877" end="02:09:08.177" style="s2">mentally.</p>
<p begin="02:09:05.577" end="02:09:10.477" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then how come you&#39;re fine?</p>
<p begin="02:09:08.177" end="02:09:11.677" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You may not know this, but my sanity is</p>
<p begin="02:09:10.477" end="02:09:14.077" style="s2">pretty low.</p>
<p begin="02:09:11.677" end="02:09:16.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Boy, it&#39;s urgent. Can you help?</p>
<p begin="02:09:14.077" end="02:09:17.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, how do I put this? Take them if</p>
<p begin="02:09:16.777" end="02:09:19.777" style="s2">they&#39;ll help.</p>
<p begin="02:09:17.877" end="02:09:23.177" style="s2">I glanced through these pages earlier.</p>
<p begin="02:09:19.777" end="02:09:23.177" style="s2">They carry a minor blessing.</p>
<p begin="02:09:25.377" end="02:09:27.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bear with it.</p>
<p begin="02:09:31.877" end="02:09:36.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep going.</p>
<p begin="02:09:32.877" end="02:09:36.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get the rapid repair spray.</p>
<p begin="02:09:38.869" end="02:09:42.377" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="02:09:40.777" end="02:09:44.077" style="s2">It&#39;s worked quite well. That should</p>
<p begin="02:09:42.377" end="02:09:45.977" style="s2">suppress it for a while.</p>
<p begin="02:09:44.077" end="02:09:49.477" style="s2">Whatever you need to do, do it soon. The</p>
<p begin="02:09:45.977" end="02:09:49.477" style="s2">next flare up will be worse.</p>
<p begin="02:09:50.377" end="02:09:53.877" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is there really no other way to lift the</p>
<p begin="02:09:51.777" end="02:09:56.877" style="s2">curse?</p>
<p begin="02:09:53.877" end="02:09:58.977" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is. Curses caused by dark powers</p>
<p begin="02:09:56.877" end="02:10:01.077" style="s2">can be lifted with holy items. For a</p>
<p begin="02:09:58.977" end="02:10:03.377" style="s2">curse this severe, you&#39;d need at least a</p>
<p begin="02:10:01.077" end="02:10:05.377" style="s2">blue tier item. It must also ward off</p>
<p begin="02:10:03.377" end="02:10:07.477" style="s2">corruption and curses. There are very</p>
<p begin="02:10:05.377" end="02:10:09.277" style="s2">few followers of the holy faith left.</p>
<p begin="02:10:07.477" end="02:10:10.877" style="s2">Your friend is a rare exception.</p>
<p begin="02:10:09.277" end="02:10:11.777" style="s2">Unfortunately, they can&#39;t do much to</p>
<p begin="02:10:10.877" end="02:10:13.877" style="s2">help yet.</p>
<p begin="02:10:11.777" end="02:10:15.377" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the Goldot sister&#39;s curse?</p>
<p begin="02:10:13.877" end="02:10:17.477" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the deity who imposed the</p>
<p begin="02:10:15.377" end="02:10:20.277" style="s2">punishment can lift it.</p>
<p begin="02:10:17.477" end="02:10:22.377" style="s2">The good news is, when they purify you,</p>
<p begin="02:10:20.277" end="02:10:24.477" style="s2">they can lift your other curses too,</p>
<p begin="02:10:22.377" end="02:10:26.377" style="s2">unless another deity placed them on you.</p>
<p begin="02:10:24.477" end="02:10:27.777" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So if I ask the three sisters</p>
<p begin="02:10:26.377" end="02:10:29.477" style="s2">to lift my bad luck curse, the</p>
<p begin="02:10:27.777" end="02:10:31.177" style="s2">petrification curse goes too?</p>
<p begin="02:10:29.477" end="02:10:32.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That right. Don&#39;t you also have an earth</p>
<p begin="02:10:31.177" end="02:10:33.877" style="s2">demon curse?</p>
<p begin="02:10:32.177" end="02:10:35.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one&#39;s not much of a problem. There</p>
<p begin="02:10:33.877" end="02:10:37.577" style="s2">aren&#39;t many dark creatures around here.</p>
<p begin="02:10:35.577" end="02:10:38.877" style="s2">Remember that statue I told you about? I</p>
<p begin="02:10:37.577" end="02:10:39.577" style="s2">think it depicts the three Goldot</p>
<p begin="02:10:38.877" end="02:10:41.277" style="s2">sisters.</p>
<p begin="02:10:39.577" end="02:10:42.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That dimwit fisherman keeps calling it</p>
<p begin="02:10:41.277" end="02:10:43.277" style="s2">goddess.</p>
<p begin="02:10:42.177" end="02:10:43.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It has to be them.</p>
<p begin="02:10:43.277" end="02:10:45.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gods</p>
<p begin="02:10:43.579" end="02:10:47.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; can be temperamental. Don&#39;t get your</p>
<p begin="02:10:45.279" end="02:10:49.279" style="s2">hopes up.</p>
<p begin="02:10:47.178" end="02:10:50.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right. I&#39;ll head down and check.</p>
<p begin="02:10:49.279" end="02:10:52.379" style="s2">Wait for me.</p>
<p begin="02:10:50.678" end="02:10:54.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep studying these samples and see</p>
<p begin="02:10:52.379" end="02:10:57.178" style="s2">if I can breed them.</p>
<p begin="02:10:54.379" end="02:10:59.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Haven&#39;t they stopped moving?</p>
<p begin="02:10:57.178" end="02:11:01.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These samples are still viable. If I</p>
<p begin="02:10:59.178" end="02:11:03.279" style="s2">hatch them directly, they may not obey.</p>
<p begin="02:11:01.678" end="02:11:04.579" style="s2">But if I breed them with my ability,</p>
<p begin="02:11:03.279" end="02:11:05.779" style="s2">they&#39;ll be absolutely loyal.</p>
<p begin="02:11:04.579" end="02:11:06.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be a little more selective with the</p>
<p begin="02:11:05.779" end="02:11:08.479" style="s2">materials.</p>
<p begin="02:11:06.479" end="02:11:09.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax. I don&#39;t plan to use you for</p>
<p begin="02:11:08.479" end="02:11:13.579" style="s2">experiments yet.</p>
<p begin="02:11:09.979" end="02:11:13.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Use whatever you want. Just let me go.</p>
<p begin="02:11:17.178" end="02:11:22.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have enough energy for now. Time to</p>
<p begin="02:11:18.879" end="02:11:22.279" style="s2">find the mark that kid left behind.</p>
<p begin="02:11:24.479" end="02:11:30.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Meaning said I&#39;d know once I saw it.</p>
<p begin="02:11:26.279" end="02:11:30.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can this guy actually be trusted?</p>
<p begin="02:11:33.779" end="02:11:37.879" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone&#39;s singing beneath the sea.</p>
<p begin="02:11:38.579" end="02:11:43.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something big often prowls this area.</p>
<p begin="02:11:41.879" end="02:11:47.178" style="s2">So voice is coming from nearby. Then why</p>
<p begin="02:11:43.979" end="02:11:47.178" style="s2">can&#39;t I see a thing?</p>
<p begin="02:11:53.379" end="02:11:56.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you were the one seeing</p>
<p begin="02:11:54.579" end="02:11:58.079" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have an antidote. I can&#39;t take</p>
<p begin="02:11:56.579" end="02:11:59.678" style="s2">it head on. Its tail is still hooked</p>
<p begin="02:11:58.079" end="02:12:01.379" style="s2">onto the platform. I need to lure it</p>
<p begin="02:11:59.678" end="02:12:02.879" style="s2">away first.</p>
<p begin="02:12:01.379" end="02:12:04.379" style="s2">Grab the chest and get out. I&#39;ll take it</p>
<p begin="02:12:02.879" end="02:12:05.579" style="s2">back and have Lanyal open it.</p>
<p begin="02:12:04.379" end="02:12:08.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s the sand worm?</p>
<p begin="02:12:05.579" end="02:12:08.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One more favor.</p>
<p begin="02:12:15.678" end="02:12:19.579" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t count on them. I&#39;ll use you to</p>
<p begin="02:12:17.579" end="02:12:21.879" style="s2">lure the sea serpent away.</p>
<p begin="02:12:19.579" end="02:12:23.479" style="s2">His body can&#39;t withstand this depth.</p>
<p begin="02:12:21.879" end="02:12:26.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sea serpent has already spotted me.</p>
<p begin="02:12:23.479" end="02:12:26.479" style="s2">A little closer.</p>
<p begin="02:12:26.678" end="02:12:28.979" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="02:12:39.279" end="02:12:42.178" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still having second thoughts?</p>
<p begin="02:12:43.279" end="02:12:46.379" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of all times, right now.</p>
<p begin="02:12:45.379" end="02:12:48.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="02:12:46.379" end="02:12:49.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 1 second slower, and it&#39;ll swallow me</p>
<p begin="02:12:48.380" end="02:12:51.580" style="s2">whole.</p>
<p begin="02:12:49.980" end="02:12:54.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t venom. It&#39;s practically</p>
<p begin="02:12:51.580" end="02:12:56.180" style="s2">sulfuric acid.</p>
<p begin="02:12:54.480" end="02:12:58.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s nowhere to push off from. I</p>
<p begin="02:12:56.180" end="02:12:58.880" style="s2">can&#39;t outswim it, so I&#39;ll have to take a</p>
<p begin="02:12:58.080" end="02:13:00.480" style="s2">chance.</p>
<p begin="02:12:58.880" end="02:13:01.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t working. Who knows where the</p>
<p begin="02:13:00.480" end="02:13:03.780" style="s2">current will carry me?</p>
<p begin="02:13:01.880" end="02:13:05.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I finally made it out. The spear gun</p>
<p begin="02:13:03.780" end="02:13:07.180" style="s2">couldn&#39;t hold against the current. That</p>
<p begin="02:13:05.480" end="02:13:09.080" style="s2">passage saved my life.</p>
<p begin="02:13:07.180" end="02:13:11.580" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s so smooth, almost like it was</p>
<p begin="02:13:09.080" end="02:13:11.580" style="s2">polished.</p>
<p begin="02:13:12.480" end="02:13:16.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are sea serpents here too.</p>
<p begin="02:13:19.680" end="02:13:23.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only 1%. They&#39;re different from the</p>
<p begin="02:13:21.580" end="02:13:24.180" style="s2">creatures outside.</p>
<p begin="02:13:23.080" end="02:13:25.680" style="s2">There may really be something left</p>
<p begin="02:13:24.180" end="02:13:27.380" style="s2">behind by Merfolk in here.</p>
<p begin="02:13:25.680" end="02:13:31.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t even fit half my head in there.</p>
<p begin="02:13:27.380" end="02:13:31.280" style="s2">No handle and no keyhole.</p>
<p begin="02:13:32.580" end="02:13:35.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It knows I&#39;m outside. The trick is in</p>
<p begin="02:13:34.280" end="02:13:37.280" style="s2">the song. Try it, but don&#39;t sing it all</p>
<p begin="02:13:35.980" end="02:13:38.380" style="s2">in one breath.</p>
<p begin="02:13:37.280" end="02:13:40.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take a breath.</p>
<p begin="02:13:38.380" end="02:13:41.880" style="s2">Remember that note. Have a bite first.</p>
<p begin="02:13:40.380" end="02:13:43.580" style="s2">Can&#39;t waste all my energy out here.</p>
<p begin="02:13:41.880" end="02:13:45.580" style="s2">There&#39;s some for you too. Feed whoever&#39;s</p>
<p begin="02:13:43.580" end="02:13:46.780" style="s2">inside first. Sure. Here&#39;s another</p>
<p begin="02:13:45.580" end="02:13:49.180" style="s2">piece.</p>
<p begin="02:13:46.780" end="02:13:49.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, it worked. The sound really got</p>
<p begin="02:13:49.180" end="02:13:52.580" style="s2">through.</p>
<p begin="02:13:49.980" end="02:13:52.580" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sing it again.</p>
<p begin="02:13:53.980" end="02:13:58.180" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So the whole stone wall is a door.</p>
<p begin="02:13:56.980" end="02:14:02.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did it close?</p>
<p begin="02:13:58.180" end="02:14:02.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lights. No, those are eyes.</p>
<p begin="02:14:03.380" end="02:14:06.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that food was for you.</p>
<p begin="02:14:09.780" end="02:14:12.780" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you the one teaching me that song?</p>
<p begin="02:14:11.480" end="02:14:14.780" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A human?</p>
<p begin="02:14:12.780" end="02:14:16.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you the Turtle Chancellor?</p>
<p begin="02:14:14.780" end="02:14:18.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can call me Oldtimer.</p>
<p begin="02:14:16.980" end="02:14:22.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why Oldtimer? Is that your name?</p>
<p begin="02:14:18.880" end="02:14:24.980" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My name? It&#39;s been so long. Oldtimer.</p>
<p begin="02:14:22.880" end="02:14:27.480" style="s2">That&#39;s what the great king called me.</p>
<p begin="02:14:24.980" end="02:14:31.180" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oldtimer, can I go inside this palace?</p>
<p begin="02:14:27.480" end="02:14:32.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You must never enter. Entry is</p>
<p begin="02:14:31.180" end="02:14:34.380" style="s2">forbidden.</p>
<p begin="02:14:32.680" end="02:14:35.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay, okay. I won&#39;t go in.</p>
<p begin="02:14:34.380" end="02:14:37.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Human. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="02:14:35.480" end="02:14:39.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the war over?</p>
<p begin="02:14:37.080" end="02:14:40.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah, it&#39;s been over for ages. But some</p>
<p begin="02:14:39.280" end="02:14:42.380" style="s2">goddess seems to have trapped all the</p>
<p begin="02:14:40.680" end="02:14:43.780" style="s2">fishermen. They can&#39;t get out.</p>
<p begin="02:14:42.380" end="02:14:44.380" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The goddesses?</p>
<p begin="02:14:43.780" end="02:14:45.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="02:14:44.380" end="02:14:47.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know either.</p>
<p begin="02:14:45.280" end="02:14:48.580" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What about the sea god? Where did the</p>
<p begin="02:14:47.480" end="02:14:49.281" style="s2">sea god go?</p>
<p begin="02:14:48.580" end="02:14:50.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who knows where</p>
<p begin="02:14:49.281" end="02:14:53.881" style="s2">&gt;&gt; he is?</p>
<p begin="02:14:50.481" end="02:14:53.881" style="s2">Maybe he lost and ran off in shame.</p>
<p begin="02:14:53.981" end="02:14:58.481" style="s2">Hey, this sea belongs to me now. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="02:14:56.381" end="02:14:59.381" style="s2">you go dying on me, you.</p>
<p begin="02:14:58.481" end="02:15:00.581" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re human.</p>
<p begin="02:14:59.381" end="02:15:02.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Human?</p>
<p begin="02:15:00.581" end="02:15:04.481" style="s2">Anyway, the system assigned this area to</p>
<p begin="02:15:02.481" end="02:15:06.281" style="s2">me. I&#39;m in charge here now. Only the</p>
<p begin="02:15:04.481" end="02:15:09.581" style="s2">system recognizes that so far, but give</p>
<p begin="02:15:06.281" end="02:15:09.581" style="s2">me time and I&#39;ll have it under control.</p>
<p begin="02:15:09.681" end="02:15:15.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re the new sea god.</p>
<p begin="02:15:12.581" end="02:15:17.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s right. I&#39;m the new sea god. Old</p>
<p begin="02:15:15.381" end="02:15:19.881" style="s2">timer, look at all this treasure. How</p>
<p begin="02:15:17.981" end="02:15:21.581" style="s2">about a little tribute? No one uses me</p>
<p begin="02:15:19.881" end="02:15:23.381" style="s2">here anyway, and managing the sea is</p>
<p begin="02:15:21.581" end="02:15:23.881" style="s2">hard work. You have to pay some taxes,</p>
<p begin="02:15:23.381" end="02:15:26.881" style="s2">right?</p>
<p begin="02:15:23.881" end="02:15:26.881" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s my child.</p>
<p begin="02:15:27.081" end="02:15:30.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, what about those two eggs,</p>
<p begin="02:15:29.181" end="02:15:32.981" style="s2">seahorse?</p>
<p begin="02:15:30.481" end="02:15:35.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When I die, one of them will inherit my</p>
<p begin="02:15:32.981" end="02:15:37.381" style="s2">duties. The other one will be free.</p>
<p begin="02:15:35.781" end="02:15:37.981" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t seahorses reproduce in a brood</p>
<p begin="02:15:37.381" end="02:15:39.681" style="s2">pouch?</p>
<p begin="02:15:37.981" end="02:15:42.281" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what&#39;s going on here?</p>
<p begin="02:15:39.681" end="02:15:44.281" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is the child Junxi left behind. She</p>
<p begin="02:15:42.281" end="02:15:46.981" style="s2">kept him asleep by force all these</p>
<p begin="02:15:44.281" end="02:15:48.881" style="s2">years. He&#39;s grown this big already. Once</p>
<p begin="02:15:46.981" end="02:15:49.981" style="s2">you open it, he&#39;ll see you and accept</p>
<p begin="02:15:48.881" end="02:15:50.681" style="s2">you as his master.</p>
<p begin="02:15:49.981" end="02:15:51.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Really?</p>
<p begin="02:15:50.681" end="02:15:55.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="02:15:51.781" end="02:15:56.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seahorse Ann, that&#39;s Wang Fei set.</p>
<p begin="02:15:55.081" end="02:15:58.681" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, wasn&#39;t he supposed to acknowledge</p>
<p begin="02:15:56.481" end="02:15:59.881" style="s2">his master? How did I become his dad?</p>
<p begin="02:15:58.681" end="02:16:01.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s the difference?</p>
<p begin="02:15:59.881" end="02:16:03.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t call me dad. Call me master or</p>
<p begin="02:16:01.781" end="02:16:06.781" style="s2">boss. Leader works, too.</p>
<p begin="02:16:03.481" end="02:16:06.781" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, that kid.</p>
<p begin="02:16:06.881" end="02:16:10.081" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, he listened this time.</p>
<p begin="02:16:08.681" end="02:16:11.481" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I need to find the fisherman, but there</p>
<p begin="02:16:10.081" end="02:16:13.781" style="s2">are too many currents and they&#39;re hard</p>
<p begin="02:16:11.481" end="02:16:15.781" style="s2">to navigate. Old turtle, can you help?</p>
<p begin="02:16:13.781" end="02:16:18.381" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come over here, please. Bring your head</p>
<p begin="02:16:15.781" end="02:16:18.381" style="s2">closer.</p>
<p begin="02:16:19.081" end="02:16:24.881" style="s2">Please remember where the fisherman are.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
